品牌在-ai-里的曝光","content":"**Citations 1.16 万**（+33.6%）：AI 回答把 remove.bg 的页面列为引用来源的次数。"},"13":{"id":"/semrush/ai-visibility-11","page_id":"/semrush/ai-visibility","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/ai-visibility#visibility-overview品牌在-ai-里的曝光","content":"**Cited Pages 3,400**（-27.5%）：被引用过的页面数在减少，引用越来越集中在少数页面上。"},"14":{"id":"/semrush/ai-visibility-12","page_id":"/semrush/ai-visibility","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/ai-visibility#visibility-overview品牌在-ai-里的曝光","content":"**46.9% 来自谷歌 AI 概览**：Distribution by LLM：提及次数里，谷歌 AI Overview 占 46.9%，Gemini 22.4%，AI Mode 21.6%，ChatGPT 只有 9.1%。"},"15":{"id":"/semrush/ai-visibility-13","page_id":"/semrush/ai-visibility","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/ai-visibility#visibility-overview品牌在-ai-里的曝光","content":"Mentions by Country：美国占 30.1%，巴西 6.5%，西班牙 4.4%。"},"16":{"id":"/semrush/ai-visibility-14","page_id":"/semrush/ai-visibility","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/ai-visibility#visibility-overview品牌在-ai-里的曝光","content":"Semrush 统计的是**AI 回答里提到了你几次**，Similarweb 的 AI 流量 统计的是**用户从 AI 点过来了多少次**。提及多但点击少，说明 AI 只是顺带提了一句；两个都在涨，才说明 AI 正在成为真实的获客渠道。"},"17":{"id":"/semrush/ai-visibility-15","page_id":"/semrush/ai-visibility","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/ai-visibility#prompt-research用户在-ai-里怎么问","content":"在 AI 工具箱里，顶部搜索框输入关键词，会打开 Prompt Research："},"18":{"id":"/semrush/ai-visibility-16","page_id":"/semrush/ai-visibility","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/ai-visibility#prompt-research用户在-ai-里怎么问","content":"Related Topics AI Volume 850 万：和这个词相关的话题，在 AI 里每月被问的估算次数。"},"19":{"id":"/semrush/ai-visibility-17","page_id":"/semrush/ai-visibility","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/ai-visibility#prompt-research用户在-ai-里怎么问","content":"1,000 个相关话题、4.91 万条提示词（prompt）。"},"20":{"id":"/semrush/ai-visibility-18","page_id":"/semrush/ai-visibility","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/ai-visibility#prompt-research用户在-ai-里怎么问","content":"Intent：除了熟悉的四种，还多了 **Task（任务型，8%）**——用户让 AI 直接帮他完成某件事。"},"21":{"id":"/semrush/ai-visibility-19","page_id":"/semrush/ai-visibility","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/ai-visibility#prompt-research用户在-ai-里怎么问","content":"**AI 最常推荐的品牌**：Brands Mentioned：回答里提到了 9,000 个品牌，最多的是 giphy、canva、tenor。remove.bg 不在前三，说明在 GIF 这个场景里它不是 AI 的首选。"},"22":{"id":"/semrush/ai-visibility-20","page_id":"/semrush/ai-visibility","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/ai-visibility#prompt-research用户在-ai-里怎么问","content":"TOP Sources：AI 引用最多的来源是 youtube.com、adobe.com、giphy.com——视频教程在 AI 回答里很有分量。"},"23":{"id":"/semrush/ai-visibility-21","page_id":"/semrush/ai-visibility","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/ai-visibility#prompt-research用户在-ai-里怎么问","content":"切到 Prompts 能看到具体的提问原文，是写 FAQ 和教程的好素材。"},"24":{"id":"/semrush/ai-visibility-22","page_id":"/semrush/ai-visibility","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/ai-visibility#prompt-research用户在-ai-里怎么问","content":"GIMP Background Removal and Transparency：AI 里每月 4.45 万次，比\"透明 GIF\"本身还多。"},"25":{"id":"/semrush/ai-visibility-23","page_id":"/semrush/ai-visibility","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/ai-visibility#prompt-research用户在-ai-里怎么问","content":"Semrush 用一批固定的提示词去问各个 AI 平台，再统计回答里的品牌和来源。AI 的回答每次都可能不同，所以这些数字适合看**趋势和相对高低**，不要当成精确的次数。"},"26":{"id":"/semrush/ai-visibility-24","page_id":"/semrush/ai-visibility","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/ai-visibility#prompt-research用户在-ai-里怎么问","content":"打开 photoroom.com 的 Visibility Overview，比较它和 remove.bg 的 AI Visibility 和 Mentions。"},"27":{"id":"/semrush/ai-visibility-25","page_id":"/semrush/ai-visibility","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/ai-visibility#prompt-research用户在-ai-里怎么问","content":"在 Prompt Research 里查 `background remover`，看看 AI 最常推荐的 3 个品牌是谁。"},"28":{"id":"/semrush/ai-visibility-26","page_id":"/semrush/ai-visibility","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/ai-visibility#prompt-research用户在-ai-里怎么问","content":"切到 Prompts 标签，挑 3 条真实提问，想一想你的网站能不能写出比现有回答更好的内容。"},"29":{"id":"/semrush/backlink-gap","page_id":"/semrush/backlink-gap","type":"page","content":"Semrush 外链差距 Backlink Gap","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Semrush 教程","外链与 AI"],"tags":[],"url":"/semrush/backlink-gap"},"30":{"id":"/semrush/backlink-gap-0","page_id":"/semrush/backlink-gap","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/backlink-gap","content":"找出链接了竞品、却没有链接你的网站——这份名单就是现成的外链拓展清单。"},"31":{"id":"/semrush/backlink-gap-1","page_id":"/semrush/backlink-gap","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/semrush/backlink-gap#怎么从结果里挑","content":"怎么从结果里挑"},"32":{"id":"/semrush/backlink-gap-2","page_id":"/semrush/backlink-gap","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/backlink-gap","content":"会设置 Backlink Gap 的对比"},"33":{"id":"/semrush/backlink-gap-3","page_id":"/semrush/backlink-gap","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/backlink-gap","content":"看懂 Best、Weak、Strong、Shared、Unique 几个分类"},"34":{"id":"/semrush/backlink-gap-4","page_id":"/semrush/backlink-gap","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/backlink-gap","content":"从结果里挑出值得争取的外链来源"},"35":{"id":"/semrush/backlink-gap-5","page_id":"/semrush/backlink-gap","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/backlink-gap","content":"打开方式：SEO 菜单 → Competitive Analysis → Backlink Gap，填入自己的网站和最多 4 个竞品，点 Find prospects。"},"36":{"id":"/semrush/backlink-gap-6","page_id":"/semrush/backlink-gap","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/backlink-gap","content":"第一个框是你的网站。"},"37":{"id":"/semrush/backlink-gap-7","page_id":"/semrush/backlink-gap","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/backlink-gap","content":"竞品，和 Keyword Gap 一样最多 4 个。"},"38":{"id":"/semrush/backlink-gap-8","page_id":"/semrush/backlink-gap","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/backlink-gap","content":"Prospects for：为哪个网站找机会，默认是\"你\"。"},"39":{"id":"/semrush/backlink-gap-9","page_id":"/semrush/backlink-gap","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/backlink-gap","content":"Best：链接了**所有**竞品、但没有链接你的网站。Weak 是链接你比链接竞品少的，Strong 相反，Shared 是都链接了的，Unique 是只链接了某一家的。"},"40":{"id":"/semrush/backlink-gap-10","page_id":"/semrush/backlink-gap","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/backlink-gap","content":"一共 11,892 个机会网站。"},"41":{"id":"/semrush/backlink-gap-11","page_id":"/semrush/backlink-gap","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/backlink-gap","content":"Matches 2/3：三个网站里有两个被它链接了（两个竞品）。"},"42":{"id":"/semrush/backlink-gap-12","page_id":"/semrush/backlink-gap","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/backlink-gap","content":"remove.bg 列是 0：这个网站没有链接 remove.bg。"},"43":{"id":"/semrush/backlink-gap-13","page_id":"/semrush/backlink-gap","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/backlink-gap","content":"wix.com（AS 81）给 photoroom 25 条链接：很可能是 Wix 的应用市场或帮助文档里推荐了这些工具。"},"44":{"id":"/semrush/backlink-gap-14","page_id":"/semrush/backlink-gap","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/backlink-gap","content":"prnewswire.com：说明竞品发过新闻稿。"},"45":{"id":"/semrush/backlink-gap-15","page_id":"/semrush/backlink-gap","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/backlink-gap#怎么从结果里挑","content":"| 类型            | 例子                    | 怎么争取        |\n| ------------- | --------------------- | ----------- |\n| 平台的应用市场 / 集成页 | wix.com、hostinger.com | 做插件或集成，申请上架 |","table":"table-0"},"46":{"id":"/semrush/backlink-gap-16","page_id":"/semrush/backlink-gap","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/backlink-gap#怎么从结果里挑","content":"| 类型           | 例子                                 | 怎么争取             |\n| ------------ | ---------------------------------- | ---------------- |\n| 软件下载站 / 工具目录 | apkmirror.com、getintopc.com、g2.com | 提交产品、发布 App、收集评价 |","table":"table-0"},"47":{"id":"/semrush/backlink-gap-17","page_id":"/semrush/backlink-gap","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/backlink-gap#怎么从结果里挑","content":"| 类型       | 例子             | 怎么争取           |\n| -------- | -------------- | -------------- |\n| 新闻稿 / 媒体 | prnewswire.com | 有新功能时发新闻稿、联系媒体 |","table":"table-0"},"48":{"id":"/semrush/backlink-gap-18","page_id":"/semrush/backlink-gap","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/backlink-gap#怎么从结果里挑","content":"| 类型       | 例子                  | 怎么争取                 |\n| -------- | ------------------- | -------------------- |\n| 搜索引擎自家服务 | yandex.com.tr、ya.ru | 一般是搜索结果页或工具收录，不用刻意争取 |","table":"table-0"},"49":{"id":"/semrush/backlink-gap-19","page_id":"/semrush/backlink-gap","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/backlink-gap#怎么从结果里挑","content":"点每一行竞品列里的数字，可以看到这个网站具体链接竞品的是哪个页面。先看清楚是\"推荐文章\"\"目录收录\"还是\"付费广告位\"，再决定值不值得争取。AS 很高但和你的领域毫无关系的网站，通常不值得花时间。"},"50":{"id":"/semrush/backlink-gap-20","page_id":"/semrush/backlink-gap","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/backlink-gap#怎么从结果里挑","content":"在 Backlink Gap 里筛选 Authority Score 大于 30，记录前 10 个机会网站和它们的类型。"},"51":{"id":"/semrush/backlink-gap-21","page_id":"/semrush/backlink-gap","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/backlink-gap#怎么从结果里挑","content":"点其中一个网站在 photoroom.com 列的数字，看看它链接的是 photoroom 的哪个页面。"},"52":{"id":"/semrush/backlinks","page_id":"/semrush/backlinks","type":"page","content":"Semrush 外链分析 Backlinks","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Semrush 教程","外链与 AI"],"tags":[],"url":"/semrush/backlinks"},"53":{"id":"/semrush/backlinks-0","page_id":"/semrush/backlinks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/backlinks","content":"一个网站有多少外链、来自多少个网站、质量如何、最近新增和丢失了哪些——以及怎么从中找到值得争取的链接。"},"54":{"id":"/semrush/backlinks-1","page_id":"/semrush/backlinks","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/semrush/backlinks#overview外链概况","content":"Overview：外链概况"},"55":{"id":"/semrush/backlinks-2","page_id":"/semrush/backlinks","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/semrush/backlinks#referring-domains链接从哪些网站来","content":"Referring Domains：链接从哪些网站来"},"56":{"id":"/semrush/backlinks-3","page_id":"/semrush/backlinks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/backlinks","content":"看懂 Backlink Analytics 的概览指标：引荐域名、外链、Authority Score"},"57":{"id":"/semrush/backlinks-4","page_id":"/semrush/backlinks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/backlinks","content":"会用 Referring Domains 列表判断外链质量"},"58":{"id":"/semrush/backlinks-5","page_id":"/semrush/backlinks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/backlinks","content":"知道为什么\"引荐域名数\"比\"外链总数\"更重要"},"59":{"id":"/semrush/backlinks-6","page_id":"/semrush/backlinks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/backlinks","content":"打开方式：SEO 菜单 → Link Building → Backlinks，输入域名点 Analyze。"},"60":{"id":"/semrush/backlinks-7","page_id":"/semrush/backlinks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/backlinks#overview外链概况","content":"Live Update：今天新发现了 99+ 条外链，外链数据是持续更新的。"},"61":{"id":"/semrush/backlinks-8","page_id":"/semrush/backlinks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/backlinks#overview外链概况","content":"子报告：Backlinks（外链明细）、Network Graph（链接网络图）、Anchors（锚文本）、Indexed Pages（被链接的页面）、Outbound Domains（它链出去的网站）、Bulk Analysis（批量查询）；Referring Domains 在 ••• 里。"},"62":{"id":"/semrush/backlinks-9","page_id":"/semrush/backlinks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/backlinks#overview外链概况","content":"可以直接加最多 3 个竞品，在同一页对比外链。"},"63":{"id":"/semrush/backlinks-10","page_id":"/semrush/backlinks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/backlinks#overview外链概况","content":"**Referring Domains 3.56 万**：有多少个不同的网站链接过来，比上月多 6%。"},"64":{"id":"/semrush/backlinks-11","page_id":"/semrush/backlinks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/backlinks#overview外链概况","content":"**Backlinks 190 万**：外链总条数。一个网站可能在每个页面的页脚都放一个链接，所以总条数会被放大很多倍。"},"65":{"id":"/semrush/backlinks-12","page_id":"/semrush/backlinks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/backlinks#overview外链概况","content":"Overall Toxicity Score：有害外链评分，要先在 Backlink Audit 里给**自己的网站**建项目才能看。"},"66":{"id":"/semrush/backlinks-13","page_id":"/semrush/backlinks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/backlinks#overview外链概况","content":"雷达图的三个维度：Link Power（外链的数量和质量）、Organic Traffic（自然流量）、Natural Profile（外链是否自然、有没有刷链接的痕迹）。"},"67":{"id":"/semrush/backlinks-14","page_id":"/semrush/backlinks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/backlinks#overview外链概况","content":"Network Graph：把它和引荐域名画成网络图。Reputable 表示链接网络正常；如果大量来自互相链接的站群，会被标成可疑。"},"68":{"id":"/semrush/backlinks-15","page_id":"/semrush/backlinks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/backlinks#referring-domains链接从哪些网站来","content":"All / Active / New / Lost：New 是最近新增的引荐域名，Lost 是丢失的。看竞品最近从哪里拿到链接，就点 New。"},"69":{"id":"/semrush/backlinks-16","page_id":"/semrush/backlinks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/backlinks#referring-domains链接从哪些网站来","content":"Follow / Nofollow：只有 follow 链接传递权重。"},"70":{"id":"/semrush/backlinks-17","page_id":"/semrush/backlinks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/backlinks#referring-domains链接从哪些网站来","content":"AS：引荐域名自己的 Authority Score。"},"71":{"id":"/semrush/backlinks-18","page_id":"/semrush/backlinks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/backlinks#referring-domains链接从哪些网站来","content":"**AS 只有 2–7 的导航站**：按外链数排序，排在最前面的是 hory-ai.com、coders-junction.com 这类 AS 只有 2–7 的网站，每个给了十几万到二十几万条链接——典型的全站链接、导航站或采集站，几乎没有价值。"},"72":{"id":"/semrush/backlinks-19","page_id":"/semrush/backlinks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/backlinks#referring-domains链接从哪些网站来","content":"Nofollow 标签：这个网站给的链接是 nofollow。"},"73":{"id":"/semrush/backlinks-20","page_id":"/semrush/backlinks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/backlinks#referring-domains链接从哪些网站来","content":"New 标签：最近新增的引荐域名，First Seen 是 Semrush 第一次发现它的日期。"},"74":{"id":"/semrush/backlinks-21","page_id":"/semrush/backlinks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/backlinks#referring-domains链接从哪些网站来","content":"**AS 100 的雅虎**：yahoo.com（AS 100）也链接了 remove.bg：真正有价值的是这种高权威网站的链接。"},"75":{"id":"/semrush/backlinks-22","page_id":"/semrush/backlinks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/backlinks#referring-domains链接从哪些网站来","content":"**看引荐域名，不看外链总数**：1 个网站给 20 万条链接，价值远不如 100 个不同网站各给 1 条"},"76":{"id":"/semrush/backlinks-23","page_id":"/semrush/backlinks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/backlinks#referring-domains链接从哪些网站来","content":"**按 AS 排序**：点 AS 表头从高到低排，先看最有分量的链接来自哪里"},"77":{"id":"/semrush/backlinks-24","page_id":"/semrush/backlinks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/backlinks#referring-domains链接从哪些网站来","content":"**看 New**：竞品最近新拿到的链接，往往说明它在做某种推广（媒体报道、榜单、目录站、合作）"},"78":{"id":"/semrush/backlinks-25"