tor#竞品-seo-拆解表","content":"根据拆解结果，写下你最想切入的 3 个关键词和理由。"},"121":{"id":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword","page_id":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword","type":"page","content":"实战：验证一个新词值不值得做","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Semrush 教程","实战"],"tags":[],"url":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword"},"122":{"id":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword-0","page_id":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword","content":"拿一个刚冒出来的长尾词，按搜索量、趋势、难度、前十名、长尾、AI 六个维度走一遍完整的验证流程。"},"123":{"id":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword-1","page_id":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword#第一步keyword-overview-体检","content":"第一步：Keyword Overview 体检"},"124":{"id":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword-2","page_id":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword#第二步看前十名","content":"第二步：看前十名"},"125":{"id":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword-3","page_id":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword#第三步看长尾有多大","content":"第三步：看长尾有多大"},"126":{"id":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword-4","page_id":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword#第四步看-ai-怎么回答","content":"第四步：看 AI 怎么回答"},"127":{"id":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword-5","page_id":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword#第五步下结论","content":"第五步：下结论"},"128":{"id":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword-6","page_id":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword","content":"把前面学的 Keyword Overview、Keyword Magic Tool、SERP Analysis、Prompt Research 串成一套流程"},"129":{"id":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword-7","page_id":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword","content":"学会识别\"新冒出来的词\"的典型特征"},"130":{"id":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword-8","page_id":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword","content":"最后给出一个明确的结论：做、观察、还是放弃"},"131":{"id":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword-9","page_id":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword","content":"在 Similarweb 教程的 从托管平台和排行榜里挖新词 里，我们找到了一批候选词。这一章换个来源：在 Keyword Magic Tool 里用 KD 30–49 筛 remove background 的长尾词时，**remove background from gif** 排在前面——月搜索 3.31 万、难度 37。它值得做吗？"},"132":{"id":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword-10","page_id":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword#第一步keyword-overview-体检","content":"**Volume 3.31 万**：美国月均搜索量。"},"133":{"id":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword-11","page_id":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword#第一步keyword-overview-体检","content":"**KD 37%（Possible）**：\"需要结构清晰、内容独特的页面\"。对比主词 remove background 的 100%，难度低得多。"},"134":{"id":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword-12","page_id":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword#第一步keyword-overview-体检","content":"Global Volume 5.07 万，其中美国就占了 3.31 万——和主词（印度最多）不同，这个词的需求集中在美国，英文页面就能覆盖大部分。"},"135":{"id":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword-13","page_id":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword#第一步keyword-overview-体检","content":"Intent 显示 n/a：Semrush 还没给它分类，新词经常这样。"},"136":{"id":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword-14","page_id":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword#第一步keyword-overview-体检","content":"Trend：前 6 个月几乎为 0，最近 5 个月突然起量。**这是新需求的典型曲线**，也解释了为什么 Intent 还没分类。注意 12 个月平均值 3.31 万被前面几个月拉低了，最近几个月的真实搜索量更高。"},"137":{"id":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword-15","page_id":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword#第一步keyword-overview-体检","content":"CPC $1.73：有一定商业价值。"},"138":{"id":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword-16","page_id":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword#第一步keyword-overview-体检","content":"Competitive Density 0.04、没有广告：还没有人投广告抢这个词。"},"139":{"id":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword-17","page_id":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword#第二步看前十名","content":"新词的 SERP Analysis 经常显示 n/a（Semrush 还没抓取完整的前十名）。这时直接在谷歌搜一下这个词，逐个看前十名："},"140":{"id":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword-18","page_id":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword#第二步看前十名","content":"有没有**专门做这件事的工具页**？如果前十名都是泛泛的\"去背景工具\"首页，说明还没人专门做 GIF"},"141":{"id":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword-19","page_id":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword#第二步看前十名","content":"排在前面的页面能不能真的处理 GIF 动图（很多去背景工具只支持静态图片）"},"142":{"id":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword-20","page_id":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword#第二步看前十名","content":"把前十名的域名放进 Domain Overview 看 Authority Score，有没有 40 以下的小站"},"143":{"id":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword-21","page_id":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword#第三步看长尾有多大","content":"在 Keyword Overview 下方的 Keyword ideas 里，这个词有 **119 个变体（合计 3.71 万搜索）**、39 个问题词：remove background from a gif（880，KD 47）、remove background from animated gif（590，KD 49）、remove white background from gif（590，KD 40）、how to remove background from gif（320，KD 36）……"},"144":{"id":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword-22","page_id":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword#第三步看长尾有多大","content":"长尾不多，说明这是一个**很具体的需求**：一个页面就能覆盖，适合做成单独的工具页，而不是一个大网站。"},"145":{"id":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword-23","page_id":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword#第四步看-ai-怎么回答","content":"在 AI 工具箱的 Prompt Research 里查同一个词：AI 里相关话题每月被问 850 万次，回答里最常提到的是 giphy、canva、tenor，引用最多的来源是 youtube.com。说明用户在 AI 里也在问这件事，而 AI 目前推荐的大多不是专门的 GIF 去背景工具——**AI 和谷歌里都还有空位**。"},"146":{"id":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword-24","page_id":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword#第五步下结论","content":"| 维度  | 标准     | remove background from gif | 结论  |\n| --- | ------ | -------------------------- | --- |\n| 搜索量 | 每月几千以上 | 美国 3.31 万（近几个月更高）          | ✓   |","table":"table-0"},"147":{"id":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword-25","page_id":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword#第五步下结论","content":"| 维度  | 标准    | remove background from gif | 结论    |\n| --- | ----- | -------------------------- | ----- |\n| 趋势  | 稳定或上升 | 5 个月前突然起量                  | ✓ 新需求 |","table":"table-0"},"148":{"id":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword-26","page_id":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword#第五步下结论","content":"| 维度  | 标准           | remove background from gif | 结论  |\n| --- | ------------ | -------------------------- | --- |\n| 难度  | 新站 KD 50% 以下 | 37%（Possible）              | ✓   |","table":"table-0"},"149":{"id":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword-27","page_id":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword#第五步下结论","content":"| 维度  | 标准          | remove background from gif | 结论  |\n| --- | ----------- | -------------------------- | --- |\n| 前十名 | 有弱页面或没有专门页面 | 需要手动检查                     | 待确认 |","table":"table-0"},"150":{"id":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword-28","page_id":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword#第五步下结论","content":"| 维度  | 标准     | remove background from gif | 结论     |\n| --- | ------ | -------------------------- | ------ |\n| 长尾  | 有一批相关词 | 119 个变体，需求集中               | 适合单页工具 |","table":"table-0"},"151":{"id":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword-29","page_id":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword#第五步下结论","content":"| 维度   | 标准     | remove background from gif | 结论  |\n| ---- | ------ | -------------------------- | --- |\n| 商业价值 | CPC、意图 | CPC $1.73，没有广告竞争           | 一般  |","table":"table-0"},"152":{"id":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword-30","page_id":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword#第五步下结论","content":"**结论：值得做一个专门的 GIF 去背景工具页**，前提是谷歌前十名里确实没有专门处理 GIF 的强页面。上线后用 Organic Rankings 或 Position Tracking 跟踪排名。"},"153":{"id":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword-31","page_id":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword#第五步下结论","content":"突然起量的词也可能是一次性热点（某个短视频、某个节日带起来的）。上线前再观察一两个月的 Trend；如果曲线回落到 0，就说明需求不持续。"},"154":{"id":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword-32","page_id":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword#第五步下结论","content":"在 Keyword Magic Tool 里用 KD 30–49 筛选你自己领域的种子词，找出一个 Trend 最近起量的词。"},"155":{"id":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword-33","page_id":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/case-validate-keyword#第五步下结论","content":"按本章的五步走一遍，把结论填进上面的表格。"},"156":{"id":"/semrush/domain-overview","page_id":"/semrush/domain-overview","type":"page","content":"Semrush 域名概览 Domain Overview","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Semrush 教程","竞品分析 Competitive Analysis"],"tags":[],"url":"/semrush/domain-overview"},"157":{"id":"/semrush/domain-overview-0","page_id":"/semrush/domain-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/domain-overview","content":"分析一个网站的第一站：权威度、自然流量、关键词、品牌词占比、竞品、外链和 AI 可见度，一页看完。"},"158":{"id":"/semrush/domain-overview-1","page_id":"/semrush/domain-overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/semrush/domain-overview#核心指标卡","content":"核心指标卡"},"159":{"id":"/semrush/domain-overview-2","page_id":"/semrush/domain-overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/semrush/domain-overview#流量分布与趋势","content":"流量分布与趋势"},"160":{"id":"/semrush/domain-overview-3","page_id":"/semrush/domain-overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/semrush/domain-overview#自然搜索关键词主题意图","content":"自然搜索：关键词、主题、意图"},"161":{"id":"/semrush/domain-overview-4","page_id":"/semrush/domain-overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/semrush/domain-overview#竞品和广告","content":"竞品和广告"},"162":{"id":"/semrush/domain-overview-5","page_id":"/semrush/domain-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/domain-overview","content":"用 Domain Overview 在几分钟内看清一个网站的 SEO 基本盘"},"163":{"id":"/semrush/domain-overview-6","page_id":"/semrush/domain-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/domain-overview","content":"看懂 Authority Score、Organic Traffic、Traffic Share 这几个核心指标"},"164":{"id":"/semrush/domain-overview-7","page_id":"/semrush/domain-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/domain-overview","content":"学会从品牌词占比、关键词趋势、竞品气泡图里读出结论"},"165":{"id":"/semrush/domain-overview-8","page_id":"/semrush/domain-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/domain-overview","content":"打开方式：顶部搜索框输入域名回车，或 SEO 菜单 → Competitive Analysis → Domain Overview。"},"166":{"id":"/semrush/domain-overview-9","page_id":"/semrush/domain-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/domain-overview#核心指标卡","content":"数据库：Domain Overview 默认 **Worldwide**，把所有国家数据库加在一起。点 US、UK 等按钮看单个国家。"},"167":{"id":"/semrush/domain-overview-10","page_id":"/semrush/domain-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/domain-overview#核心指标卡","content":"**AI Visibility 38**：AI 搜索可见度（0–100），Mentions 是 AI 回答里提到 remove.bg 的次数（1.64 万），Cited Pages 是被 AI 引用为来源的页面数（3,400）。详见 AI 可见度。"},"168":{"id":"/semrush/domain-overview-11","page_id":"/semrush/domain-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/domain-overview#核心指标卡","content":"按 AI 平台拆开：谷歌 AI Overview 提到 7,700 次，远多于 ChatGPT 的 1,500 次。"},"169":{"id":"/semrush/domain-overview-12","page_id":"/semrush/domain-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/domain-overview#核心指标卡","content":"**Authority Score 90（Very good）**：Semrush 综合外链质量、自然流量和链接自然程度打的权威分，0–100。新站一般在 10 以下，能到 50 就算有一定权威。"},"170":{"id":"/semrush/domain-overview-13","page_id":"/semrush/domain-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/domain-overview#核心指标卡","content":"**Organic Traffic 3,600 万**：估算的谷歌自然搜索月流量，比上月下降 8.6%。"},"171":{"id":"/semrush/domain-overview-14","page_id":"/semrush/domain-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/domain-overview#核心指标卡","content":"**Paid Traffic 0**：没有投谷歌搜索广告。"},"172":{"id":"/semrush/domain-overview-15","page_id":"/semrush/domain-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/domain-overview#核心指标卡","content":"**Ref.Domains 3.56 万**：有多少个不同的网站链接到 remove.bg。比外链总数更能说明外链实力。"},"173":{"id":"/semrush/domain-overview-16","page_id":"/semrush/domain-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/domain-overview#核心指标卡","content":"Traffic Share：在 US 数据库里，remove.bg 的自然流量占它和主要竞品总流量的 81%，是这个细分领域的绝对头部。"},"174":{"id":"/semrush/domain-overview-17","page_id":"/semrush/domain-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/domain-overview#核心指标卡","content":"Organic Keywords：在谷歌前 100 名有排名的关键词数（所有国家合计），比上月少 0.9%。"},"175":{"id":"/semrush/domain-overview-18","page_id":"/semrush/domain-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/domain-overview#流量分布与趋势","content":"卡片下方先选 Google Search（默认是 AI Search），就能看到自然流量按国家的分布和近一年的趋势。"},"176":{"id":"/semrush/domain-overview-19","page_id":"/semrush/domain-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/domain-overview#流量分布与趋势","content":"AI Search / Google Search：切换左侧两张表的数据来源，先选 Google Search。"},"177":{"id":"/semrush/domain-overview-20","page_id":"/semrush/domain-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/domain-overview#流量分布与趋势","content":"**印度流量 970 万，比美国（320 万）多三倍**。工具站的流量大头经常不在美国，做多语言和低价市场前先看这里。"},"178":{"id":"/semrush/domain-overview-21","page_id":"/semrush/domain-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/domain-overview#流量分布与趋势","content":"**Branded 71.6%**：七成多的自然流量来自品牌词（remove bg、removebg 这类）。品牌词流量越高，说明用户是\"冲着它来的\"，竞品很难抢。"},"179":{"id":"/semrush/domain-overview-22","page_id":"/semrush/domain-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/domain-overview#流量分布与趋势","content":"Google SERP Positions Distribution：它的排名里 84.4% 是普通自然结果，13.6% 出现在谷歌的 AI Overviews 里。"},"180":{"id":"/semrush/domain-overview-23","page_id":"/semrush/domain-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/domain-overview#流量分布与趋势","content":"时间范围：1M / 6M / 1Y / 2Y / All time。"},"181":{"id":"/semrush/domain-overview-24","page_id":"/semrush/domain-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/domain-overview#流量分布与趋势","content":"Traffic：深色是自然流量，浅紫色是品牌词流量。两条线几乎同步，再次说明流量主要靠品牌。"},"182":{"id":"/semrush/domain-overview-25","page_id":"/semrush/domain-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/domain-overview#流量分布与趋势","content":"Keywords：按排名区间（Top 3、4–10、11–20…）堆叠的关键词数。2026 年 4–8 月，排名词从 50 多万降到 14 万左右，但流量基本没变——掉的都是排在后面、几乎没流量的长尾词。"},"183":{"id":"/semrush/domain-overview-26","page_id":"/semrush/domain-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/domain-overview#流量分布与趋势","content":"图表底部的小图标是备注：G 是谷歌算法更新，红旗是 Semrush 记录的数据变化。曲线突然跳变时，先看是不是撞上了更新。"},"184":{"id":"/semrush/domain-overview-27","page_id":"/semrush/domain-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/domain-overview#自然搜索关键词主题意图","content":"页面上半部分是 Worldwide，从 Organic Research 开始是单个国家（默认 US）的数据。"},"185":{"id":"/semrush/domain-overview-28","page_id":"/semrush/domain-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/domain-overview#自然搜索关键词主题意图","content":"流量最大的词：background remover（月搜索 100 万，排第 1，带来 24.88% 的流量）。前五个词全是品牌词或核心词，而且都排第 1。"},"186":{"id":"/semrush/domain-overview-29","page_id":"/semrush/domain-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/domain-overview#自然搜索关键词主题意图","content":"Intent 搜索意图：N 导航型、I 信息型、C 商业型、T 交易型。一个词可能同时有两种意图。"},"187":{"id":"/semrush/domain-overview-30","page_id":"/semrush/domain-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/domain-overview#自然搜索关键词主题意图","content":"Key Topics：Semrush 用 AI 把它的关键词归成主题，面积越大流量越多。Background Removal 一个主题就有 44.7 万流量。"},"188":{"id":"/semrush/domain-overview-31","page_id":"/semrush/domain-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/domain-overview#自然搜索关键词主题意图","content":"**导航型词只占 6.1%，却带来 200 万流量**，比占 83.7% 的信息型词还多——品牌词的力量。"},"189":{"id":"/semrush/domain-overview-32","page_id":"/semrush/domain-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/domain-overview#自然搜索关键词主题意图","content":"Organic Position Distribution：大部分词排在 21–100 名，这些词几乎没有流量，但说明谷歌认为页面和这些词相关，是可以优化的储备。"},"190":{"id":"/semrush/domain-overview-33","page_id":"/semrush/domain-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/domain-overview#竞品和广告","content":"Main Organic Competitors：和它抢同一批关键词的网站，按竞争程度排序。头号竞品是 photoroom.com。"},"191":{"id":"/semrush/domain-overview-34","page_id":"/semrush/domain-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/domain-overview#竞品和广告","content":"Com. Level：竞争程度，共同关键词越多、占比越高，条越长。"},"192":{"id":"/semrush/domain-overview-35","page_id":"/semrush/domain-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/domain-overview#竞品和广告","content":"Com. Keywords：两站都有排名的共同关键词数。photoroom 和 remove.bg 有 6,842 个共同词。"},"193":{"id":"/semrush/domain-overview-36","page_id":"/semrush/domain-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/domain-overview#竞品和广告","content":"SE Keywords：竞品自己的排名词总数。photoroom 有 4.27 万个，比 remove.bg（US 2.9 万）还多。"},"194":{"id":"/semrush/domain-overview-37","page_id":"/semrush/domain-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/domain-overview#竞品和广告","content":"Competitive Positioning Map：横轴是关键词数，纵轴是自然流量，气泡越大流量越大。remove.bg 在 3 万个词的位置拿到了 300 多万流量。"},"195":{"id":"/semrush/domain-overview-38","page_id":"/semrush/domain-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/domain-overview#竞品和广告","content":"photoroom 排名词最多，但流量只有 remove.bg 的十分之一左右——词多不等于流量大，关键看有没有占住大词的前几名。"},"196":{"id":"/semrush/domain-overview-39","page_id":"/semrush/domain-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/domain-overview#竞品和广告","content":"页面再往下是 **Backlinks** 外链概况："},"197":{"id":"/semrush/domain-overview-40","page_id":"/semrush/domain-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/domain-overview#竞品和广告","content":"最新抓到的外链里，大量来自\"小舅子导航\"这类批量生成的导航页，而且是 nofollow。大站的外链里混着垃圾链接很正常。"},"198":{"id":"/semrush/domain-overview-41","page_id":"/semrush/domain-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/domain-overview#竞品和广告","content":"a16z 的\"Top 100 Gen AI Consumer Apps\"榜单给了 follow 链接，这才是有价值的外链。"},"199":{"id":"/semrush/domain-overview-42","page_id":"/semrush/domain-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/domain-overview#竞品和广告","content":"Follow 104 万 / Nofollow 89 万：只有 follow 链接会传递权重。"},"200":{"id":"/semrush/domain-overview-43","page_id":"/semrush/domain-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/domain-overview#竞品和广告","content":"Top Anchors：锚文本里有 remove、消除图片背景、免费在线抠图——说明它在中文站点上也有大量外链。"},"201":{"id":"/semrush/domain-overview-44","page_id":"/semrush/domain-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/domain-overview#竞品和广告","content":"Referring Domains：链接最多的引荐域名，完整分析见 外链分析。"},"202":{"id":"/semrush/domain-overview-45","page_id":"/semrush/domain-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/domain-overview#竞品和广告","content":"| 看哪里                         | 回答什么问题                |\n| --------------------------- | --------------------- |\n| Authority Score、Ref.Domains | 这个站的外链实力有多强，新站能不能正面竞争 |","table":"table-0"},"203":{"id":"/semrush/domain-overview-46","page_id":"/semrush/domain-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/domain-overview#竞品和广告","content":"| 看哪里                  | 回答什么问题      |\n| -------------------- | ----------- |\n| Organic Traffic + 趋势 | 规模多大，在涨还是在跌 |","table":"table-0"},"204":{"id":"/semrush/domain-overview-47","page_id":"/semrush/domain-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/domain-overview#竞品和广告","content":"| 看哪里                     | 回答什么问题     |\n| ----------------------- | ---------- |\n| Distribution by Country | 流量主要来自哪些国家 |","table":"table-0"},"205":{"id":"/semrush/domain-overview-48","page_id":"/semrush/domain-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/domain-overview#竞品和广告","content":"| 看哪里                   | 回答什么问题                            |\n| --------------------- | --------------------------------- |\n| Branded / Non-Branded | 靠品牌还是靠 SEO 拿流量；非品牌流量越高，越值得研究它的关键词 |","table":"table-0"},"206":{"id":"/semrush/domain-overview-49","page_id":"/semrush/domain-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/domain-overview#竞品和广告","content":"| 看哪里                      | 回答什么问题        |\n| ------------------------ | ------------- |\n| Main Organic Competitors | 同赛道还有谁，下一步该拆谁 |","table":"table-0"},"207":{"id":"/semrush/domain-overview-50","page_id":"/semrush/domain-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/domain-overview#竞品和广告","content":"| 看哪里                                 | 回答什么问题 |\n| ----------------------------------- | ------ |\n| Paid Traffic / Advertising Research | 有没有投广告 |","table":"table-0"},"208":{"id":"/semrush/domain-overview-51","page_id":"/semrush/domain-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/domain-overview#竞品和广告","content":"打开 photoroom.com 的 Domain Overview，记录它的 Authority Score、Organic Traffic 和 Branded 占比，和 remove.bg 对比。"},"209":{"id":"/semrush/domain-overview-52","page_id":"/semrush/domain-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/domain-overview#竞品和广告","content":"把数据库切到 IN（印度），看看 remove.bg 在印度排名第一的词是什么。"},"210":{"id":"/semrush/domain-overview-53","page_id":"/semrush/domain-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/domain-overview#竞品和广告","content":"在 Main Organic Competitors 里挑一个你没听说过的竞品，打开它的 Domain Overview。"},"211":{"id":"/semrush/faq","page_id":"/semrush/faq","type":"page","content":"Semrush 常见问题","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Semrush 教程","附录"],"tags":[],"url":"/semrush/faq"},"212":{"id":"/semrush/faq-0","page_id":"/semrush/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/faq","content":"数据对不上、数据库怎么选、KD 多少能做、报告次数用完了、工具打不开……新手最常遇到的问题。"},"213":{"id":"/semrush/faq-1","page_id":"/semrush/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/faq","content":"三者口径完全不同：Semrush 的 Organic Traffic 只算**谷歌自然搜索**，而且只算它数据库里有排名的词；Similarweb 算的是**所有渠道的总访问**；Search Console 是网站自己的**真实点击**。Semrush 通常比 Search Console 低，因为长尾词和新词覆盖不全。比较时只在同一个工具里比，看相对高低和趋势。"},"214":{"id":"/semrush/faq-2","page_id":"/semrush/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/faq","content":"看整体规模用 Worldwide（只有 Domain Overview 等少数报告支持）；分析具体关键词、排名、难度，一定要选单个国家，通常先看 US，再看流量最大的那个国家。**比较两个网站、两个词时，必须用同一个数据库。**"},"215":{"id":"/semrush/faq-3","page_id":"/semrush/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/faq","content":"Volume 是过去 12 个月的月均搜索量。季节性强的词旺季会远高于这个数；突然起量的新词，最近几个月的真实搜索量也会比平均值高。看 Trend 柱状图判断。"},"216":{"id":"/semrush/faq-4","page_id":"/semrush/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/faq","content":"新站优先 KD 50% 以下，最好是 30% 以下；但 KD 只是前十名的平均难度，一定要再看 SERP Analysis 里有没有 Page AS 低、引荐域名少的页面。详见 关键词难度。"},"217":{"id":"/semrush/faq-5","page_id":"/semrush/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/faq","content":"统计范围不同：Domain Overview 顶部是所有国家合计，Organic Rankings 是单个国家；Keyword Gap 只统计参与对比的数据；有的报告包含 SERP 特性里的排名，有的不包含；日期也可能不同。看同一个报告里的变化即可。"},"218":{"id":"/semrush/faq-6","page_id":"/semrush/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/faq","content":"每个套餐都有每日报告数上限，打开报告、翻页、换筛选、导出都会消耗，第二天恢复。多人共用一个账号时更容易用完：先把要查的网站和词整理好再集中查，少翻页、不导出。"},"219":{"id":"/semrush/faq-7","page_id":"/semrush/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/faq","content":"Topic Research 要先在后台收集选题卡片，网络或账号环境不好时会一直停在加载状态。可以换个时间再试，或者先用 Keyword Overview 的 Questions、Keyword Strategy 和 AI 工具箱的 Prompt Research 找选题。"},"220":{"id":"/semrush/faq-8","page_id":"/semrush/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/faq","content":"它们要先创建 Project（项目），填写自己的网站，适合管理**自己的**网站：Site Audit 定期体检技术问题，Position Tracking 每天追踪指定关键词的排名。项目会保存在账号里，多人共用的账号里别人也能看到。"},"221":{"id":"/semrush/faq-9","page_id":"/semrush/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/faq","content":"Semrush 的 Traffic & Market 工具箱（Traffic Analytics 等）也能看网站的总访问、渠道和受众，功能上和 Similarweb 接近，但需要单独订阅。本教程的总流量部分用 Similarweb 讲解，见 Similarweb 教程。"},"222":{"id":"/semrush/faq-10","page_id":"/semrush/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/faq","content":"免费账号每天只能查少量报告，表格只显示前几行，适合偶尔查一个网站或一个词的概览。要系统地拓词、做差距分析，需要付费套餐。"},"223":{"id":"/semrush/glossary","page_id":"/semrush/glossary","type":"page","content":"Semrush 指标词典","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Semrush 教程","附录"],"tags":[],"url":"/semrush/glossary"},"224":{"id":"/semrush/glossary-0","page_id":"/semrush/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/glossary","content":"本教程里出现的 Semrush 指标和术语，中英对照，一句话解释。"},"225":{"id":"/semrush/glossary-1","page_id":"/semrush/glossary","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/semrush/glossary#网站指标","content":"网站指标"},"226":{"id":"/semrush/glossary-2","page_id":"/semrush/glossary","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/semrush/glossary#关键词指标","content":"关键词指标"},"227":{"id":"/semrush/glossary-3","page_id":"/semrush/glossary","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/semrush/glossary#匹配方式与差距分类","content":"匹配方式与差距分类"},"228":{"id":"/semrush/glossary-4","page_id":"/semrush/glossary","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/semrush/glossary#外链指标","content":"外链指标"},"229":{"id":"/semrush/glossary-5","page_id":"/semrush/glossary","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/semrush/glossary#ai-指标","content":"AI 指标"},"230":{"id":"/semrush/glossary-6","page_id":"/semrush/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/glossary#网站指标","content":"| 指标                   | 中文  | 解释                          |\n| -------------------- | --- | --------------------------- |\n| Authority Score (AS) | 权威分 | 综合外链质量、自然流量、链接自然程度的分数，0–100 |","table":"table-0"},"231":{"id":"/semrush/glossary-7","page_id":"/semrush/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/glossary#网站指标","content":"| 指标      | 中文    | 解释       |\n| ------- | ----- | -------- |\n| Page AS | 页面权威分 | 单个页面的权威分 |","table":"table-0"},"232":{"id":"/semrush/glossary-8","page_id":"/semrush/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/glossary#网站指标","content":"| 指标              | 中文   | 解释                               |\n| ---------------