sity (Com.) | 广告竞争度 | 有多少广告主在投这个词，0–1 |","table":"table-1"},"246":{"id":"/semrush/glossary-22","page_id":"/semrush/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/glossary#关键词指标","content":"| 指标    | 中文  | 解释             |\n| ----- | --- | -------------- |\n| Trend | 趋势  | 过去 12 个月每月的搜索量 |","table":"table-1"},"247":{"id":"/semrush/glossary-23","page_id":"/semrush/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/glossary#关键词指标","content":"| 指标                 | 中文   | 解释                                |\n| ------------------ | ---- | --------------------------------- |\n| SERP Features (SF) | 搜索特性 | 结果页上除普通结果以外的模块：AI 概览、图片、视频、问答、评分等 |","table":"table-1"},"248":{"id":"/semrush/glossary-24","page_id":"/semrush/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/glossary#关键词指标","content":"| 指标          | 中文    | 解释                |\n| ----------- | ----- | ----------------- |\n| AI Overview | AI 概览 | 谷歌在结果页顶部给出的 AI 答案 |","table":"table-1"},"249":{"id":"/semrush/glossary-25","page_id":"/semrush/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/glossary#关键词指标","content":"| 指标      | 中文  | 解释          |\n| ------- | --- | ----------- |\n| Results | 结果数 | 谷歌返回的搜索结果总数 |","table":"table-1"},"250":{"id":"/semrush/glossary-26","page_id":"/semrush/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/glossary#关键词指标","content":"| 指标       | 中文  | 解释        |\n| -------- | --- | --------- |\n| Position | 排名  | 在谷歌结果里的位置 |","table":"table-1"},"251":{"id":"/semrush/glossary-27","page_id":"/semrush/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/glossary#关键词指标","content":"| 指标        | 中文   | 解释                 |\n| --------- | ---- | ------------------ |\n| Traffic % | 流量占比 | 这个词带来的流量占全站自然流量的比例 |","table":"table-1"},"252":{"id":"/semrush/glossary-28","page_id":"/semrush/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/glossary#匹配方式与差距分类","content":"| 术语          | 解释                  |\n| ----------- | ------------------- |\n| Broad Match | 包含种子词的每个单词，顺序不限，含变形 |","table":"table-2"},