url":"/semrush/glossary#ai-指标","content":"| 指标      | 中文  | 解释           |\n| ------- | --- | ------------ |\n| Prompts | 提示词 | 用户向 AI 提问的原文 |","table":"table-4"},"276":{"id":"/semrush/glossary-52","page_id":"/semrush/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/glossary#ai-指标","content":"| 指标        | 中文     | 解释                  |\n| --------- | ------ | ------------------- |\n| AI Volume | AI 搜索量 | 某个话题在 AI 里每月被问的估算次数 |","table":"table-4"},"277":{"id":"/semrush/glossary-53","page_id":"/semrush/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/glossary#ai-指标","content":"| 指标   | 中文    | 解释             |\n| ---- | ----- | -------------- |\n| Task | 任务型意图 | 用户让 AI 直接完成某件事 |","table":"table-4"},"278":{"id":"/semrush","page_id":"/semrush","type":"page","content":"Semrush 教程","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Semrush 教程","入门"],"tags":[],"url":"/semrush"},"279":{"id":"/semrush-0","page_id":"/semrush","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush","content":"从界面导览到实战验证新词，一步一图，带你把 Semrush 的关键词、排名和外链用明白。"},"280":{"id":"/semrush-1","page_id":"/semrush","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/semrush#谁适合阅读本教程","content":"谁适合阅读本教程？"},"281":{"id":"/semrush-2","page_id":"/semrush","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/semrush#需要具备的基础","content":"需要具备的基础"},"282":{"id":"/semrush-3","page_id":"/semrush","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/semrush#怎么看本教程的截图","content":"怎么看本教程的截图"},"283":{"id":"/semrush-4","page_id":"/semrush","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/semrush#学习路线","content":"学习路线"},"284":{"id":"/semrush-5","page_id":"/semrush","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/semrush#入门","content":"入门"},"285":{"id":"/semrush-6","page_id":"/semrush","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/semrush#竞品分析","content":"竞品分析"},"286":{"id":"/semrush-7","page_id":"/semrush","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/semrush#关键词研究","content":"关键词研究"},"287":{"id":"/semrush-8","page_id":"/semrush","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/semrush#外链与-ai","content":"外链与 AI"},"288":{"id":"/semrush-9","page_id":"/semrush","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/semrush#实战","content":"实战"},"289":{"id":"/semrush-10","page_id":"/semrush","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush","content":"Semrush 是一款**搜索营销工具**：输入一个域名，能看到它在谷歌上靠哪些关键词拿到流量、排在第几、竞品是谁、有多少外链；输入一个关键词，能看到它每月多少人搜、难不难做、谷歌前十都是谁。"},"290":{"id":"/semrush-11","page_id":"/semrush","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush","content":"如果说 Similarweb 回答的是\"这个网站有多少流量、流量从哪来\"，Semrush 回答的就是\"它靠哪些词拿到搜索流量、这些词我能不能做\"。两个工具配合，才是完整的找词与竞品分析流程。"},"291":{"id":"/semrush-12","page_id":"/semrush","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush","content":"看懂 Semrush 的核心报告：域名概览、自然排名、热门页面、关键词差距、关键词概览、拓词、外链、AI 可见度"},"292":{"id":"/semrush-13","page_id":"/semrush","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush","content":"学会用它做三件事：**拆解竞品的 SEO**、**从种子词拓出长尾词**、**判断一个词值不值得做**"},"293":{"id":"/semrush-14","page_id":"/semrush","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush","content":"知道 Semrush 的数据怎么估算出来、和 Similarweb 对不上时该信谁"},"294":{"id":"/semrush-15","page_id":"/semrush","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush#谁适合阅读本教程","content":"想做出海网站、工具站，需要验证\"这个词有没有人搜、新站能不能排上去\"的独立开发者"},"295":{"id":"/semrush-16","page_id":"/semrush","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush#谁适合阅读本教程","content":"做 SEO / 内容的运营，需要研究竞品的关键词和外链"},"296":{"id":"/semrush-17","page_id":"/semrush","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush#谁适合阅读本教程","content":"学完了 Similarweb 教程，想把\"找到的词\"进一步验证的人"},"297":{"id":"/semrush-18","page_id":"/semrush","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush#需要具备的基础","content":"能登录 Semrush（本教程截图基于 **Semrush Guru** 套餐的 SEO 工具箱和 AI Visibility）"},"298":{"id":"/semrush-19","page_id":"/semrush","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush#需要具备的基础","content":"知道什么是关键词、排名、外链即可，其他指标在教程里和指标词典里都有解释"},"299":{"id":"/semrush-20","page_id":"/semrush","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush#需要具备的基础","content":"Semrush 的免费账号每天能查少量报告，Domain Overview、Keyword Overview 的概览部分都能看到。本教程前几章在免费账号里也能跟着操作，拓词、差距分析、完整排名表需要付费套餐。"},"300":{"id":"/semrush-21","page_id":"/semrush","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush#怎么看本教程的截图","content":"标注规则和 Similarweb 教程完全一样："},"301":{"id":"/semrush-22","page_id":"/semrush","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush#怎么看本教程的截图","content":"| 标注           | 含义                        |\n| ------------ | ------------------------- |\n| 蓝色圆形数字 ① ② ③ | 看图顺序，图下方的「步骤说明」按同样的序号详细解释 |","table":"table-0"},"302":{"id":"/semrush-23","page_id":"/semrush","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush#怎么看本教程的截图","content":"| 标注        | 含义        |\n| --------- | --------- |\n| 红色圈 / 红色框 | 要点击或要看的位置 |","table":"table-0"},"303":{"id":"/semrush-24","page_id":"/semrush","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush#怎么看本教程的截图","content":"| 标注    | 含义     |\n| ----- | ------ |\n| 浅蓝色标签 | 这一步做什么 |","table":"table-0"},"304":{"id":"/semrush-25","page_id":"/semrush","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush#怎么看本教程的截图","content":"| 标注     | 含义             |\n| ------ | -------------- |\n| 红色实心标签 | 这个位置的关键数字 / 结论 |","table":"table-0"},"305":{"id":"/semrush-26","page_id":"/semrush","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush#怎么看本教程的截图","content":"点击任意截图可以放大查看；手机上图里只显示序号，文字说明看图下方的步骤列表。"},"306":{"id":"/semrush-27","page_id":"/semrush","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush#怎么看本教程的截图","content":"截图采集于 2026 年 10 月，示例网站用 **remove.bg**，竞品用 photoroom.com 和 pixelcut.ai，示例关键词用 remove background。除特别说明外，数据库都是 **United States（美国）**。你实际操作时看到的数字会不同，重要的是学会在哪里看、怎么判断。"},"307":{"id":"/semrush-28","page_id":"/semrush","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush#入门","content":"Semrush 简介：它是什么、数据怎么估算、和 Similarweb 怎么分工；界面导览：左侧工具箱、顶部搜索框和每个报告都有的数据库、设备、日期控件。"},"308":{"id":"/semrush-29","page_id":"/semrush","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush#竞品分析","content":"以 remove.bg 为例：域名概览 → 自然排名 → 热门页面 → 关键词差距。"},"309":{"id":"/semrush-30","page_id":"/semrush","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush#关键词研究","content":"关键词概览：给一个词做体检；Keyword Magic Tool 拓词：从种子词拓出几万个长尾词；关键词难度：判断新站能不能做。"},"310":{"id":"/semrush-31","page_id":"/semrush","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush#外链与-ai","content":"外链分析、外链差距：竞品的外链从哪来、你还缺哪些；AI 可见度：品牌在 ChatGPT、谷歌 AI 概览里被提到多少次。"},"311":{"id":"/semrush-32","page_id":"/semrush","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush#实战","content":"验证一个新词值不值得做、30 分钟拆解竞品的 SEO。遇到问题先查 指标词典 和 常见问题。"},"312":{"id":"/semrush/interface","page_id":"/semrush/interface","type":"page","content":"Semrush 界面导览与通用控件","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Semrush 教程","入门"],"tags":[],"url":"/semrush/interface"},"313":{"id":"/semrush/interface-0","page_id":"/semrush/interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/interface","content":"先认路：左侧的工具箱和 SEO 菜单、顶部搜索框，以及每个报告都有的数据库、设备、日期控件。"},"314":{"id":"/semrush/interface-1","page_id":"/semrush/interface","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/semrush/interface#左侧导航工具箱和-seo-菜单","content":"左侧导航：工具箱和 SEO 菜单"},"315":{"id":"/semrush/interface-2","page_id":"/semrush/interface","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/semrush/interface#顶部搜索框和报告通用控件","content":"顶部搜索框和报告通用控件"},"316":{"id":"/semrush/interface-3","page_id":"/semrush/interface","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/semrush/interface#常用报告怎么打开","content":"常用报告怎么打开"},"317":{"id":"/semrush/interface-4","page_id":"/semrush/interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/interface","content":"认识左侧的工具箱导航，知道 SEO 菜单里每一组工具解决什么问题"},"318":{"id":"/semrush/interface-5","page_id":"/semrush/interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/interface","content":"会用顶部搜索框打开任意域名或关键词的报告"},"319":{"id":"/semrush/interface-6","page_id":"/semrush/interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/interface","content":"掌握报告顶部的通用控件：数据库（国家）、设备、日期、子报告标签"},"320":{"id":"/semrush/interface-7","page_id":"/semrush/interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/interface","content":"登录后看到的是 Semrush 首页。不管查什么，操作路径都是同一个套路："},"321":{"id":"/semrush/interface-8","page_id":"/semrush/interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/interface","content":"> 顶部搜索框输入域名或关键词 → 进入对应报告 → 用报告顶部的控件换国家、设备、日期 → 在左侧菜单里切换到相关报告"},"322":{"id":"/semrush/interface-9","page_id":"/semrush/interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/interface#左侧导航工具箱和-seo-菜单","content":"左侧最窄的一列是**工具箱**，鼠标移到某个图标上，会弹出这个工具箱的菜单。本教程主要用 SEO 工具箱。"},"323":{"id":"/semrush/interface-10","page_id":"/semrush/interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/interface#左侧导航工具箱和-seo-菜单","content":"SEO 工具箱：本教程 90% 的报告都在这里。进入某个报告后，左侧会展开同样的二级菜单。"},"324":{"id":"/semrush/interface-11","page_id":"/semrush/interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/interface#左侧导航工具箱和-seo-菜单","content":"Site Performance：Site Audit（网站体检）、Position Tracking（每天追踪排名）。这两个工具要先创建项目、填写自己的网站，适合管理自己的站，本教程不展开。"},"325":{"id":"/semrush/interface-12","page_id":"/semrush/interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/interface#左侧导航工具箱和-seo-菜单","content":"Competitive Analysis：Domain Overview、Organic Rankings、Top Pages、Compare Domains、Keyword Gap、Backlink Gap。**分析任何一个网站都从这里开始。**"},"326":{"id":"/semrush/interface-13","page_id":"/semrush/interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/interface#左侧导航工具箱和-seo-菜单","content":"Keyword Research：Keyword Overview 给一个词做体检，Keyword Magic Tool 拓词，Keyword Strategy Builder 把词自动分组成内容规划，Saved Keywords 是收藏夹。"},"327":{"id":"/semrush/interface-14","page_id":"/semrush/interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/interface#左侧导航工具箱和-seo-菜单","content":"Content Ideas：Topic Research 按主题找选题和问题，SEO Writing Assistant 在写作时检查关键词覆盖。"},"328":{"id":"/semrush/interface-15","page_id":"/semrush/interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/interface#左侧导航工具箱和-seo-菜单","content":"Link Building：Backlinks、Referring Domains 查任意网站的外链；Backlink Audit 检查自己网站的有害外链（要建项目）。"},"329":{"id":"/semrush/interface-16","page_id":"/semrush/interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/interface#左侧导航工具箱和-seo-菜单","content":"其他工具箱：AI（AI 可见度）、Traffic & Market（网站流量，和 Similarweb 类似）、Ad（广告研究）、Local（本地商家）、Content、AI PR、Social、Reports、Apps。没有开通的工具箱打开后会显示升级提示。"},"330":{"id":"/semrush/interface-17","page_id":"/semrush/interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/interface#左侧导航工具箱和-seo-菜单","content":"Semrush 经常调整菜单。比如以前叫 Organic Research 的报告，现在叫 **Organic Rankings**；Keyword Manager 改名成了 Keyword Strategy Builder。找不到某个报告时，直接在顶部搜索框旁的 \"Go to tool...\" 里搜报告名。"},"331":{"id":"/semrush/interface-18","page_id":"/semrush/interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/interface#顶部搜索框和报告通用控件","content":"打开任意一个报告（下图是 remove.bg 的 Domain Overview），顶部这几排控件在大部分报告里都一样："},"332":{"id":"/semrush/interface-19","page_id":"/semrush/interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/interface#顶部搜索框和报告通用控件","content":"输入域名（如 `remove.bg`）回车打开 Domain Overview；输入关键词（如 `remove background`）回车打开 Keyword Overview。在 AI 工具箱里输入关键词，会打开 AI 的 Prompt Research。"},"333":{"id":"/semrush/interface-20","page_id":"/semrush/interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/interface#顶部搜索框和报告通用控件","content":"Root Domain 统计整个根域名（含所有子域名）；也可以选 Subdomain、Subfolder（如 `remove.bg/es/`）或 Exact URL（单个页面）。"},"334":{"id":"/semrush/interface-21","page_id":"/semrush/interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/interface#顶部搜索框和报告通用控件","content":"关键词和排名数据按国家分库。Domain Overview 默认 Worldwide（全球汇总），其他报告默认 US。**比较两个网站时一定要用同一个数据库。**"},"335":{"id":"/semrush/interface-22","page_id":"/semrush/interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/interface#顶部搜索框和报告通用控件","content":"Desktop / Mobile：谷歌桌面和移动端的排名不同，移动端占比高的网站要切到 Mobile 再看一次。"},"336":{"id":"/semrush/interface-23","page_id":"/semrush/interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/interface#顶部搜索框和报告通用控件","content":"默认是最新数据，可以选过去的日期，看某个时间点的排名快照（需要有历史数据的套餐）。"},"337":{"id":"/semrush/interface-24","page_id":"/semrush/interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/interface#顶部搜索框和报告通用控件","content":"子报告标签：同一个报告的不同视角，比如 Domain Overview 的 Growth report（增长报告）、Compare by countries（按国家对比）。"},"338":{"id":"/semrush/interface-25","page_id":"/semrush/interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/interface#顶部搜索框和报告通用控件","content":"User manual：这个报告的官方说明，看不懂某个指标时最快的查法。"},"339":{"id":"/semrush/interface-26","page_id":"/semrush/interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/interface#顶部搜索框和报告通用控件","content":"Export to PDF：导出报告。会消耗额度，多人共用的账号尽量不要导出。"},"340":{"id":"/semrush/interface-27","page_id":"/semrush/interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/interface#常用报告怎么打开","content":"| 想看什么      | 打开方式                      |\n| --------- | ------------------------- |\n| 一个网站的整体情况 | 搜索框输入域名 → Domain Overview |","table":"table-0"},"341":{"id":"/semrush/interface-28","page_id":"/semrush/interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/interface#常用报告怎么打开","content":"| 想看什么       | 打开方式                                  |\n| ---------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| 一个网站排在哪些词上 | SEO 菜单 → Organic Rankings → Positions |","table":"table-0"},"342":{"id":"/semrush/interface-29","page_id":"/semrush/interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/interface#常用报告怎么打开","content":"| 想看什么         | 打开方式               |\n| ------------ | ------------------ |\n| 一个网站哪些页面流量最大 | SEO 菜单 → Top Pages |","table":"table-0"},"343":{"id":"/semrush/interface-30","page_id":"/semrush/interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/interface#常用报告怎么打开","content":"| 想看什么       | 打开方式                            |\n| ---------- | ------------------------------- |\n| 几个网站的关键词差距 | SEO 菜单 → Keyword Gap，填入 2–5 个域名 |","table":"table-0"},"344":{"id":"/semrush/interface-31","page_id":"/semrush/interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/interface#常用报告怎么打开","content":"| 想看什么       | 打开方式                        |\n| ---------- | --------------------------- |\n| 一个词的搜索量和难度 | 搜索框输入关键词 → Keyword Overview |","table":"table-0"},"345":{"id":"/semrush/interface-32","page_id":"/semrush/interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/interface#常用报告怎么打开","content":"| 想看什么    | 打开方式                        |\n| ------- | --------------------------- |\n| 围绕一个词拓词 | SEO 菜单 → Keyword Magic Tool |","table":"table-0"},"346":{"id":"/semrush/interface-33","page_id":"/semrush/interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/interface#常用报告怎么打开","content":"| 想看什么    | 打开方式               |\n| ------- | ------------------ |\n| 一个网站的外链 | SEO 菜单 → Backlinks |","table":"table-0"},"347":{"id":"/semrush/interface-34","page_id":"/semrush/interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/interface#常用报告怎么打开","content":"Site Audit、Position Tracking、Backlink Audit、On Page SEO Checker 这类工具要先建 **Project（项目）**，项目和收藏的关键词清单会保存在账号里。如果你用的是多人共用的账号，别人也能看到；而且首页、搜索框下拉里出现的\"最近查询\"，也可能是别人查过的网站。"},"348":{"id":"/semrush/interface-35","page_id":"/semrush/interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/interface#常用报告怎么打开","content":"把鼠标移到左侧的 SEO 图标上，依次找到 Domain Overview、Keyword Magic Tool、Backlinks 三个报告。"},"349":{"id":"/semrush/interface-36","page_id":"/semrush/interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/interface#常用报告怎么打开","content":"打开 remove.bg 的 Domain Overview，把数据库从 Worldwide 切到 US，记下 Organic Traffic 前后的变化。"},"350":{"id":"/semrush/intro","page_id":"/semrush/intro","type":"page","content":"Semrush 简介","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Semrush 教程","入门"],"tags":[],"url":"/semrush/intro"},"351":{"id":"/semrush/intro-0","page_id":"/semrush/intro","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/intro","content":"Semrush 是什么、能回答哪些问题、关键词和流量数据怎么估算、准不准，以及它和 Similarweb 的分工。"},"352":{"id":"/semrush/intro-1","page_id":"/semrush/intro","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/semrush/intro#semrush-是什么","content":"Semrush 是什么"},"353":{"id":"/semrush/intro-2","page_id":"/semrush/intro","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/semrush/intro#数据从哪来怎么估算","content":"数据从哪来、怎么估算"},"354":{"id":"/semrush/intro-3","page_id":"/semrush/intro","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/semrush/intro#套餐和工具箱","content":"套餐和工具箱"},"355":{"id":"/semrush/intro-4","page_id":"/semrush/intro","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/semrush/intro#semrush-和-similarweb-怎么分工","content":"Semrush 和 Similarweb 怎么分工"},"356":{"id":"/semrush/intro-5","page_id":"/semrush/intro","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/intro","content":"知道 Semrush 能回答哪些问题、不能回答哪些问题"},"357":{"id":"/semrush/intro-6","page_id":"/semrush/intro","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/intro","content":"理解搜索量、自然流量这些数字是怎么估算出来的，知道什么时候可信"},"358":{"id":"/semrush/intro-7","page_id":"/semrush/intro","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/intro","content":"分清 Semrush 和 Similarweb 各自擅长什么"},"359":{"id":"/semrush/intro-8","page_id":"/semrush/intro","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/intro#semrush-是什么","content":"Semrush 是一套**搜索营销工具**，核心是一个按国家划分的关键词数据库：它持续抓取谷歌的搜索结果，记录每个关键词每月大概有多少人搜、前 100 名分别是哪些网页。有了这份数据，就能反过来查任意一个网站排在哪些词上、大概能拿到多少搜索流量。"},"360":{"id":"/semrush/intro-9","page_id":"/semrush/intro","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/intro#semrush-是什么","content":"它能回答的典型问题："},"361":{"id":"/semrush/intro-10","page_id":"/semrush/intro","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/intro#semrush-是什么","content":"| 问题                     | 去哪看  |\n| ---------------------- | ---- |\n| 这个网站在谷歌上有多少自然流量？在涨还是跌？ | 域名概览 |","table":"table-0"},"362":{"id":"/semrush/intro-11","page_id":"/semrush/intro","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/intro#semrush-是什么","content":"| 问题                    | 去哪看  |\n| --------------------- | ---- |\n| 它靠哪些关键词拿流量？最近新排上了哪些词？ | 自然排名 |","table":"table-0"},"363":{"id":"/semrush/intro-12","page_id":"/semrush/intro","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/intro#semrush-是什么","content":"| 问题            | 去哪看  |\n| ------------- | ---- |\n| 它哪些页面带来的流量最多？ | 热门页面 |","table":"table-0"},"364":{"id":"/semrush/intro-13","page_id":"/semrush/intro","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/intro#semrush-是什么","content":"| 问题              | 去哪看   |\n| --------------- | ----- |\n| 竞品有排名、我没有的词有哪些？ | 关键词差距 |","table":"table-0"},"365":{"id":"/semrush/intro-14","page_id":"/semrush/intro","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/intro#semrush-是什么","content":"| 问题                    | 去哪看   |\n| --------------------- | ----- |\n| 一个词每月多少人搜？难不难做？前十名是谁？ | 关键词概览 |","table":"table-0"},"366":{"id":"/semrush/intro-15","page_id":"/semrush/intro","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/intro#semrush-是什么","content":"| 问题               | 去哪看                |\n| ---------------- | ------------------ |\n| 围绕一个种子词，还有哪些长尾词？ | Keyword Magic Tool |","table":"table-0"},"367":{"id":"/semrush/intro-16","page_id":"/semrush/intro","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/intro#semrush-是什么","content":"| 问题                   | 去哪看       |\n| -------------------- | --------- |\n| 它有多少外链、从哪些网站来？我还缺哪些？ | 外链分析、外链差距 |","table":"table-0"},"368":{"id":"/semrush/intro-17","page_id":"/semrush/intro","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/intro#semrush-是什么","content":"| 问题            | 去哪看    |\n| ------------- | ------ |\n| AI 回答里提到它多少次？ | AI 可见度 |","table":"table-0"},"369":{"id":"/semrush/intro-18","page_id":"/semrush/intro","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/intro#数据从哪来怎么估算","content":"| 数据         | 来源和算法                              | 注意                     |\n| ---------- | ---------------------------------- | ---------------------- |\n| 搜索量 Volume | 第三方点击流数据 + 模型，得出**过去 12 个月的月均搜索量** | 季节性强的词，旺季的实际搜索量会比月均高很多 |","table":"table-1"},"370":{"id":"/semrush/intro-19","page_id":"/semrush/intro","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/intro#数据从哪来怎么估算","content":"| 数据          | 来源和算法                        | 注意                                |\n| ----------- | ---------------------------- | --------------------------------- |\n| 排名 Position | Semrush 自己抓取谷歌搜索结果，记录前 100 名 | 每个词的更新频率不同，表格里的 Updated 列写着最后更新时间 |","table":"table-1"},"371":{"id":"/semrush/intro-20","page_id":"/semrush/intro","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/intro#数据从哪来怎么估算","content":"| 数据           | 来源和算法                          | 注意                              |\n| ------------ | ------------------------------ | ------------------------------- |\n| 自然流量 Traffic | 排名 × 该位置的点击率 × 搜索量，把一个网站所有词加起来 | 只统计数据库里有的词；长尾词、新词覆盖不全，所以通常比真实值低 |","table":"table-1"},"372":{"id":"/semrush/intro-21","page_id":"/semrush/intro","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/intro#数据从哪来怎么估算","content":"| 数据           | 来源和算法                 | 注意                    |\n| ------------ | --------------------- | --------------------- |\n| 外链 Backlinks | Semrush 的爬虫抓取全网网页上的链接 | 只能看到被抓到的链接，新链接要过几天才出现 |","table":"table-1"},"373":{"id":"/semrush/intro-22","page_id":"/semrush/intro","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/intro#数据从哪来怎么估算","content":"| 数据     | 来源和算法                                  | 注意                      |\n| ------ | -------------------------------------- | ----------------------- |\n| AI 可见度 | 用一组提示词去问 ChatGPT、谷歌 AI 概览等，统计回答里提到哪些品牌 | 是抽样估算，看趋势和相对高低，不要当成精确次数 |","table":"table-1"},"374":{"id":"/semrush/intro-23","page_id":"/semrush/intro","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/intro#数据从哪来怎么估算","content":"**自然流量是估算出来的**：它只算谷歌自然搜索，而且只算 Semrush 数据库里有的词。和网站自己 Google Search Console 里的点击数对不上是常态，Semrush 通常偏低"},"375":{"id":"/semrush/intro-24","page_id":"/semrush/intro","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/intro#数据从哪来怎么估算","content":"**大词准、小词偏差大**：月搜索几千以上的词比较可靠；只有几十次的词，搜索量、难度都可能不准"},"376":{"id":"/semrush/intro-25","page_id":"/semrush/intro","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/intro#数据从哪来怎么估算","content":"**看相对值比看绝对值更有用**：同一工具、同一数据库里，A 站比 B 站多、这个月比上个月多，比单个数字更值得相信"},"377":{"id":"/semrush/intro-26","page_id":"/semrush/intro","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/intro#数据从哪来怎么估算","content":"**数据库要选对**：同一个网站在 US 数据库和 Worldwide 下的数字差别很大，比较时一定用同一个数据库"},"378":{"id":"/semrush/intro-27","page_id":"/semrush/intro","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/intro#套餐和工具箱","content":"Semrush 的功能按\"工具箱\"拆开卖：SEO 工具箱（本教程的重点，套餐分 Pro、Guru、Business）、AI Visibility、Traffic & Market（网站流量，类似 Similarweb）、Content、Local、Social、Advertising 等。不同工具箱需要单独订阅，没开通的会显示升级提示。"},"379":{"id":"/semrush/intro-28","page_id":"/semrush/intro","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/intro#套餐和工具箱","content":"| 套餐   | 适合    | 和本教程有关的区别          |\n| ---- | ----- | ------------------ |\n| 免费账号 | 偶尔查一下 | 每天只能查少量报告，表格只显示前几行 |","table":"table-2"},"380":{"id":"/semrush/intro-29","page_id":"/semrush/intro","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/intro#套餐和工具箱","content":"| 套餐  | 适合   | 和本教程有关的区别                |\n| --- | ---- | ------------------------ |\n| Pro | 个人站长 | 大部分 SEO 报告可用，没有历史数据和内容工具 |","table":"table-2"},"381":{"id":"/semrush/intro-30","page_id":"/semrush/intro","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/intro#套餐和工具箱","content":"| 套餐   | 适合         | 和本教程有关的区别                       |\n| ---- | ---------- | ------------------------------- |\n| Guru | 本教程截图使用的套餐 | 有历史数据、Topic Research、更多项目和每日报告数 |","table":"table-2"},"382":{"id":"/semrush/intro-31","page_id":"/semrush/intro","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/intro#套餐和工具箱","content":"| 套餐       | 适合    | 和本教程有关的区别     |\n| -------- | ----- | ------------- |\n| Business | 团队、机构 | 更多额度，支持 API 等 |","table":"table-2"},"383":{"id":"/semrush/intro-32","page_id":"/semrush/intro","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/intro#套餐和工具箱","content":"每个套餐都有**每日报告数上限**，打开一个报告、换一次筛选都会消耗。达到上限后报告页会提示 \"Reports per day are limited\"，第二天恢复。"},"384":{"id":"/semrush/intro-33","page_id":"/semrush/intro","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/intro#semrush-和-similarweb-怎么分工","content":"|      | Semrush            | Similarweb                      |\n| ---- | ------------------ | ------------------------------- |\n| 核心视角 | **搜索引擎**：关键词、排名、外链 | 网站的**全部流量**：直接访问、搜索、社交、引荐、广告、AI |","table":"table-3"},"385":{"id":"/semrush/intro-34","page_id":"/semrush/intro","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/intro#semrush-和-similarweb-怎么分工","content":"|      | Semrush         | Similarweb |\n| ---- | --------------- | ---------- |\n| 流量数字 | 只算谷歌自然搜索（和付费搜索） | 所有渠道的总访问   |","table":"table-3"},"386":{"id":"/semrush/intro-35","page_id":"/semrush/intro","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/intro#semrush-和-similarweb-怎么分工","content":"|     | Semrush                     | Similarweb                    |\n| --- | --------------------------- | ----------------------------- |\n| 关键词 | 数据库大，有难度 KD、搜索意图、SERP 分析、拓词 | 能看到真实点击、零点击、新出现的词（New Clicks） |","table":"table-3"},"387":{"id":"/semrush/intro-36","page_id":"/semrush/intro","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/intro#semrush-和-similarweb-怎么分工","content":"|     | Semrush          | Similarweb    |\n| --- | ---------------- | ------------- |\n| 外链  | 强项：外链列表、锚文本、外链差距 | 只有引荐流量，没有外链数据 |","table":"table-3"},"388":{"id":"/semrush/intro-37","page_id":"/semrush/intro","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/intro#semrush-和-similarweb-怎么分工","content":"|       | Semrush       | Similarweb        |\n| ----- | ------------- | ----------------- |\n| 适合的问题 | \"这个词能不能做、怎么做\" | \"这个方向有没有流量、流量从哪来\" |","table":"table-3"},"389":{"id":"/semrush/intro-38","page_id":"/semrush/intro","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/intro#semrush-和-similarweb-怎么分工","content":"一个常见的组合用法：先在 Similarweb 里看一个网站或行业的流量规模、找到新冒出来的词（实战：从托管平台和排行榜里挖新词），再把这些词拿到 Semrush 里查搜索量、难度和前十名（实战：验证一个新词值不值得做）。"},"390":{"id":"/semrush/intro-39","page_id":"/semrush/intro","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/intro#semrush-和-similarweb-怎么分工","content":"用免费或付费账号登录 Semrush，在顶部搜索框输入 `remove.bg`，看看打开的是哪个报告。"},"391":{"id":"/semrush/intro-40","page_id":"/semrush/intro","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/intro#semrush-和-similarweb-怎么分工","content":"再输入 `remove background`，对比一下：输入域名和输入关键词，分别跳到了哪里？"},"392":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty","type":"page","content":"Semrush 关键词难度 KD 与新站选词","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Semrush 教程","关键词研究 Keyword Research"],"tags":[],"url":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty"},"393":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty-0","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty","content":"KD% 怎么算、六个难度档位分别意味着什么，以及为什么只看 KD 不够，还要看 SERP 里的对手。"},"394":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty-1","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty#kd-的六个档位","content":"KD% 的六个档位"},"395":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty-2","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty#只看-kd-不够还要看前十名是谁","content":"只看 KD 不够：还要看前十名是谁"},"396":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty-3","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty","content":"看懂 KD% 的六个档位，知道新站应该从哪一档做起"},"397":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty-4","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty","content":"学会用 SERP Analysis 判断\"难度高但有弱页面\"的词"},"398":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty-5","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty","content":"掌握一套判断一个词能不能做的检查清单"},"399":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty-6","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty#kd-的六个档位","content":"KD%（Keyword Difficulty）是 Semrush 根据**谷歌前十名页面的权威度、外链数量和质量**算出来的排名难度，0–100%。在 Keyword Magic Tool、Organic Rankings 等表格的 KD % 筛选里能看到完整的档位："},"400":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty-7","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty#kd-的六个档位","content":"KD % 筛选。"},"401":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty-8","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty#kd-的六个档位","content":"**新站别碰**：Very hard 85–100%、Hard 70–84%、Difficult 50–69%：需要大量高质量外链，新站一年内都很难排进前十。"},"402":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty-9","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty#kd-的六个档位","content":"**新站从这里开始**：Possible 30–49%、Easy 15–29%、Very easy 0–14%：内容写好、做好站内优化，就有机会排上去。"},"403":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty-10","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty#kd-的六个档位","content":"Custom range：自定义区间，比如 0–40。"},"404":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty-11","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty#kd-的六个档位","content":"**黄点 = Possible**：表格里 KD 数字旁的颜色点和档位对应：深红、红是 Hard 以上，橙色是 Difficult，黄色是 Possible，绿色是 Easy 及以下。"},"405":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty-12","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty#kd-的六个档位","content":"| 档位        | KD%  | 对新站意味着什么              |\n| --------- | ---- | --------------------- |\n| Very easy | 0–14 | 写一篇好内容就可能排上去，但通常搜索量也小 |","table":"table-0"},"406":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty-13","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty#kd-的六个档位","content":"| 档位   | KD%   | 对新站意味着什么 |\n| ---- | ----- | -------- |\n| Easy | 15–29 | 新站的主战场   |","table":"table-0"},"407":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty-14","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty#kd-的六个档位","content":"| 档位       | KD%   | 对新站意味着什么             |\n| -------- | ----- | -------------------- |\n| Possible | 30–49 | 需要结构清晰、内容独特的页面，加少量外链 |","table":"table-0"},"408":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty-15","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty#kd-的六个档位","content":"| 档位        | KD%   | 对新站意味着什么           |\n| --------- | ----- | ------------------ |\n| Difficult | 50–69 | 需要一定外链和权威度，适合有基础的站 |","table":"table-0"},"409":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty-16","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty#kd-的六个档位","content":"| 档位   | KD%   | 对新站意味着什么  |\n| ---- | ----- | --------- |\n| Hard | 70–84 | 需要大量高质量外链 |","table":"table-0"},"410":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty-17","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty#kd-的六个档位","content":"| 档位        | KD%    | 对新站意味着什么 |\n| --------- | ------ | -------- |\n| Very hard | 85–100 | 大站和品牌的地盘 |","table":"table-0"},"411":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty-18","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty#只看-kd-不够还要看前十名是谁","content":"KD% 是前十名的平均难度。平均值高，不代表每个位置都难。回到上一章 remove background（KD 100%）的 SERP Analysis："},"412":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty-19","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty#只看-kd-不够还要看前十名是谁","content":"Page AS：页面权威度（0–100），比域名的 Authority Score 更能说明这个页面本身有多强。"},"413":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty-20","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty#只看-kd-不够还要看前十名是谁","content":"Ref. Domains：链接到这个页面的网站数。"},"414":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty-21","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty#只看-kd-不够还要看前十名是谁","content":"第 2 名 remove.bg：Page AS 84、2.01 万个引荐域名——打不动。"},"415":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty-22","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty#只看-kd-不够还要看前十名是谁","content":"第 6 名 photiu.ai：Page AS 31、91 个引荐域名。说明这个位置上，内容和用户体验比外链更重要。"},"416":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty-23","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty#只看-kd-不够还要看前十名是谁","content":"第 10 名是谷歌应用商店里的一个 App，Page AS 30。"},"417":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty-24","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty#只看-kd-不够还要看前十名是谁","content":"**搜索量够不够**：Volume 每月几百以上，Trend 稳定或在涨（季节性词看旺季）"},"418":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty-25","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty#只看-kd-不够还要看前十名是谁","content":"**难度在不在射程内**：新站优先 KD 50% 以下"},"419":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty-26","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty#只看-kd-不够还要看前十名是谁","content":"**前十名有没有弱页面**：SERP Analysis 里有没有 Page AS 低于 40、引荐域名不到 100 的页面"},"420":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty-27","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty#只看-kd-不够还要看前十名是谁","content":"**意图和你的页面类型是否匹配**：前十名都是工具页，你就做工具页；都是教程，你就写教程"},"421":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty-28","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty#只看-kd-不够还要看前十名是谁","content":"**有没有商业价值**：CPC 高、Commercial / Transactional 意图，说明有人愿意为它付费"},"422":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty-29","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty#只看-kd-不够还要看前十名是谁","content":"在 Keyword Magic Tool 里用 `remove background` 拓词，筛选 KD 15–29%（Easy），挑出搜索量最高的 3 个词。"},"423":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty-30","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-difficulty#只看-kd-不够还要看前十名是谁","content":"逐个打开它们的 SERP Analysis，按上面 5 步打分，选出你最想做的一个。"},"424":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-gap","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-gap","type":"page","content":"Semrush 关键词差距 Keyword Gap","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Semrush 教程","竞品分析 Competitive Analysis"],"tags":[],"url":"/semrush/keyword-gap"},"425":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-gap-0","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-gap","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-gap","content":"把自己和最多 4 个竞品放在一起比，找出竞品有排名而你没有的词——最直接的找词方法之一。"},"426":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-gap-1","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-gap","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/semrush/keyword-gap#第一步填写对比的域名","content":"第一步：填写对比的域名"},"427":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-gap-2","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-gap","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/semrush/keyword-gap#第二步看机会词和重叠关系","content":"第二步：看机会词和重叠关系"},"428":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-gap-3","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-gap","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/semrush/keyword-gap#第三步在-missing-里挑词","content":"第三步：在 Missing 里挑词"},"429":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-gap-4","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-gap","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-gap","content":"会设置 Keyword Gap 的对比：自己 + 最多 4 个竞品"},"430":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-gap-5","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-gap","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-gap","content":"看懂 Shared、Missing、Weak、Strong、Untapped、Unique 六种分类"},"431":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-gap-6","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-gap","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-gap","content":"从 Missing 和 Untapped 里挑出可以做的词和产品方向"},"432":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-gap-7","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-gap","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-gap","content":"打开方式：SEO 菜单 → Competitive Analysis → Keyword Gap。"},"433":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-gap-8","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-gap","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-gap#第一步填写对比的域名","content":"第一行固定是\"你\"，这里填 remove.bg。"},"434":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-gap-9","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-gap","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-gap#第一步填写对比的域名","content":"竞品：最多再填 4 个。可以先用 Domain Overview 里的 Main Organic Competitors 挑。"},"435":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-gap-10","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-gap","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-gap#第一步填写对比的域名","content":"每个域名可以单独选范围：Root domain、Subdomain、Subfolder、URL。"},"436":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-gap-11","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-gap","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-gap#第一步填写对比的域名","content":"关键词类型：Organic（自然）、Paid（付费广告）、PLA（购物广告），可以混着比。"},"437":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-gap-12","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-gap","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-gap#第一步填写对比的域名","content":"数据库（国家）。"},"438":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-gap-13","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-gap","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-gap#第一步填写对比的域名","content":"点 Compare 开始对比。"},"439":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-gap-14","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-gap","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-gap#第二步看机会词和重叠关系","content":"可以随时切换比较自然词、付费词或购物广告词。"},"440":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-gap-15","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-gap","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-gap#第二步看机会词和重叠关系","content":"Top Opportunities：Semrush 先挑出的机会词，Missing 是你没有、竞品都有的；Weak 是你排名比竞品都低的。"},"441":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-gap-16","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-gap","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-gap#第二步看机会词和重叠关系","content":"第一个机会词是 image resizer（调整图片尺寸），月搜索 183 万——remove.bg 只做抠图，竞品已经在做更多图片工具。"},"442":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-gap-17","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-gap","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-gap#第二步看机会词和重叠关系","content":"Keyword Overlap：三个圆分别是三个网站的关键词，重叠部分是共同词。photoroom 的圆最大（2.62 万个词）。"},"443":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-gap-18","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-gap","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-gap#第二步看机会词和重叠关系","content":"Missing 4.7K：竞品都有排名、你完全没有的词。"},"444":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-gap-19","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-gap","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-gap#第二步看机会词和重叠关系","content":"Untapped 27.4K：至少有一个竞品排名、你没有的词，范围比 Missing 大得多。"},"445":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-gap-20","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-gap","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-gap#第二步看机会词和重叠关系","content":"| 分类     | 含义         | 怎么用          |\n| ------ | ---------- | ------------ |\n| Shared | 所有网站都有排名的词 | 了解这个赛道的\"基本盘\" |","table":"table-0"},"446":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-gap-21","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-gap","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-gap#第二步看机会词和重叠关系","content":"| 分类          | 含义                 | 怎么用                |\n| ----------- | ------------------ | ------------------ |\n| **Missing** | 竞品**都有**、你**没有**的词 | 优先补的词：大家都在做，说明需求确定 |","table":"table-0"},"447":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-gap-22","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-gap","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-gap#第二步看机会词和重叠关系","content":"| 分类   | 含义            | 怎么用    |\n| ---- | ------------- | ------ |\n| Weak | 你有排名，但比所有竞品都低 | 优化已有页面 |","table":"table-0"},"448":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-gap-23","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-gap","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-gap#第二步看机会词和重叠关系","content":"| 分类     | 含义         | 怎么用        |\n| ------ | ---------- | ---------- |\n| Strong | 你排名比所有竞品都高 | 你的护城河，注意守住 |","table":"table-0"},"449":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-gap-24","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-gap","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-gap#第二步看机会词和重叠关系","content":"| 分类           | 含义                | 怎么用      |\n| ------------ | ----------------- | -------- |\n| **Untapped** | **至少一个**竞品有、你没有的词 | 范围更大的机会池 |","table":"table-0"},"450":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-gap-25","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-gap","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-gap#第二步看机会词和重叠关系","content":"| 分类     | 含义       | 怎么用       |\n| ------ | -------- | --------- |\n| Unique | 只有你有排名的词 | 看看自己的独特优势 |","table":"table-0"},"451":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-gap-26","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-gap","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-gap#第三步在-missing-里挑词","content":"remove.bg 列全是 0：没有排名。"},"452":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-gap-27","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-gap","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-gap#第三步在-missing-里挑词","content":"两个竞品的排名，绿色底色表示几家里排名最好的那个。"},"453":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-gap-28","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-gap","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-gap#第三步在-missing-里挑词","content":"**pixelcut 已经排第 3**：image upscaler（图片放大）月搜索 4.95 万，pixelcut 已经排到第 3。"},"454":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-gap-29","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-gap","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-gap#第三步在-missing-里挑词","content":"**难度只有 68**：unblur image（去模糊）难度 68，是这批词里最低的，两个竞品都只排在 15–17 名——还没有人做透。"},"455":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-gap-30","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-gap","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-gap#第三步在-missing-里挑词","content":"KD%：这批词难度普遍在 75–92，正面竞争很难，适合找它们的长尾词（见 Keyword Magic Tool）。"},"456":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-gap-31","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-gap","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-gap#第三步在-missing-里挑词","content":"Missing 里排在前面的 image resizer、image upscaler、image enhancer、unblur image，全是 remove.bg **没有做的图片功能**。对做工具站的人来说，这张表就是一份\"竞品已经验证过需求的功能清单\"：挑一个难度相对低、竞品排名不靠前的功能，做成单独的工具页。"},"457":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-gap-32","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-gap","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-gap#第三步在-missing-里挑词","content":"用 Keyword Gap 对比 photoroom.com 和 remove.bg、pixelcut.ai，看看 photoroom 的 Missing 里有哪些词。"},"458":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-gap-33","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-gap","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-gap#第三步在-missing-里挑词","content":"在 remove.bg 的 Untapped 里筛选 KD 小于 50、Volume 大于 1,000，记录 5 个词。"},"459":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-gap-34","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-gap","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-gap#第三步在-missing-里挑词","content":"把 Keyword type 切成 Paid keywords，看看这三家有没有投搜索广告。"},"460":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool","type":"page","content":"Semrush 拓词 Keyword Magic Tool","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Semrush 教程","关键词研究 Keyword Research"],"tags":[],"url":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool"},"461":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool-0","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool","content":"输入一个种子词，拓出几万个相关词，再用匹配方式、分组和筛选，把可以做的长尾词挑出来。"},"462":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool-1","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool#界面一览","content":"界面一览"},"463":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool-2","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool#筛出低难度的长尾词","content":"筛出低难度的长尾词"},"464":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool-3","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool","content":"用 Keyword Magic Tool 从一个种子词拓出全部相关词"},"465":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool-4","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool","content":"分清 Broad、Phrase、Exact、Related 四种匹配方式"},"466":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool-5","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool","content":"用左侧分组和 KD、Include、Exclude 筛选，把几万个词缩小到可以做的几十个"},"467":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool-6","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool","content":"打开方式：SEO 菜单 → Keyword Research → Keyword Magic Tool，输入种子词；或在 Keyword Overview 的 Keyword Variations 里点 View all。"},"468":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool-7","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool#界面一览","content":"All / Questions：Questions 只看问题词（how、what、can…）。"},"469":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool-8","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool#界面一览","content":"匹配方式：All Keywords、Broad Match、Phrase Match、Exact Match、Related，区别见下表。"},"470":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool-9","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool#界面一览","content":"Languages：只看某种语言的词。"},"471":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool-10","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool#界面一览","content":"筛选：Volume、KD %、Intent、CPC、Include keywords（必须包含）、Exclude keywords（排除）、Advanced filters。"},"472":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool-11","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool#界面一览","content":"Groups：Semrush 按词里的单词自动分组，比如 remove（4.85 万个词）、images、photoshop、free、video……点一个组，右边只显示这个组的词。**拓词最快的读法是先扫一遍分组。**"},"473":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool-12","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool#界面一览","content":"一共 51,716 个词，合计月搜索 801 万，平均难度 61%。"},"474":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool-13","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool#界面一览","content":"how to remove background in gimp：13.5 万搜索、难度 39，按搜索量排第 6，是前面唯一的黄点。"},"475":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool-14","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool#界面一览","content":"Trend：12 个月的搜索量走势，鼓起来的是最近在涨的词。"},"476":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool-15","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool#界面一览","content":"SERP Features：结果页上的特性图标。"},"477":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool-16","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool#界面一览","content":"Results：谷歌的搜索结果数（百万），竞争程度的粗略参考。"},"478":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool-17","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool#界面一览","content":"| 匹配方式        | 返回什么                     | remove background 的例子                   |\n| ----------- | ------------------------ | --------------------------------------- |\n| Broad Match | 包含种子词里的每个单词，顺序不限，含单复数等变形 | background remover、remove bg from image |","table":"table-0"},"479":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool-18","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool#界面一览","content":"| 匹配方式         | 返回什么        | remove background 的例子             |\n| ------------ | ----------- | --------------------------------- |\n| Phrase Match | 包含完整短语，顺序不变 | how to remove background in canva |","table":"table-0"},"480":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool-19","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool#界面一览","content":"| 匹配方式        | 返回什么            | remove background 的例子  |\n| ----------- | --------------- | ---------------------- |\n| Exact Match | 包含完整短语，顺序和形式都不变 | remove background free |","table":"table-0"},"481":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool-20","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool#界面一览","content":"| 匹配方式    | 返回什么              | remove background 的例子               |\n| ------- | ----------------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| Related | 语义相关、但不一定包含这些单词的词 | transparent background、cutout image |","table":"table-0"},"482":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool-21","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool#界面一览","content":"| 匹配方式         | 返回什么 | remove background 的例子 |\n| ------------ | ---- | --------------------- |\n| All Keywords | 以上全部 | —                     |","table":"table-0"},"483":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool-22","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool#筛出低难度的长尾词","content":"在 KD % 筛选里选 Possible（30–49%）或填自定义区间，结果如下："},"484":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool-23","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool#筛出低难度的长尾词","content":"生效的筛选会显示成一个小标签，点 × 取消。"},"485":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool-24","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool#筛出低难度的长尾词","content":"**平均难度降到 38%**：剩下 1,437 个词，合计月搜索 80 万。"},"486":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool-25","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool#筛出低难度的长尾词","content":"分组也跟着变：canvas、photoshop、transparent 这些\"工具名 + 去背景\"的组冒了出来。"},"487":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool-26","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool#筛出低难度的长尾词","content":"remove background from gif：3.31 万搜索、难度 37。下一章和实战章会继续分析这个词。"},"488":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool-27","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool#筛出低难度的长尾词","content":"nair hair removal（脱毛膏）也混进来了：Broad Match 会把 removal 这样的变形也算进去。用 **Exclude keywords** 排除 hair、eye 这类无关词。"},"489":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool-28","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool#筛出低难度的长尾词","content":"backround：拼写错误的词，难度只有 30，同样有 1.81 万搜索。"},"490":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool-29","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool#筛出低难度的长尾词","content":"Include keywords：比如只看包含 video、gif、png 的词。"},"491":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool-30","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool#筛出低难度的长尾词","content":"种子词用最短的核心词（remove background、background remover），匹配方式先选 All Keywords"},"492":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool-31","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool#筛出低难度的长尾词","content":"先扫左侧 Groups，记下和你产品相关的组（video、gif、canva、photoshop……）"},"493":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool-32","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool#筛出低难度的长尾词","content":"KD % 选 Possible 及以下，Volume 设 500 以上"},"494":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool-33","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool#筛出低难度的长尾词","content":"用 Exclude keywords 排除无关词，用 Include keywords 聚焦某个功能"},"495":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool-34","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool#筛出低难度的长尾词","content":"把剩下的词逐个丢进 Keyword Overview 看 SERP，确认前十名里有弱页面"},"496":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool-35","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool#筛出低难度的长尾词","content":"Keyword Magic Tool 一页 100 个词，每翻一页、每换一次筛选都会消耗报告次数。先用筛选把范围缩小，再翻页；多人共用的账号尽量不要导出整张表。"},"497":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool-36","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool#筛出低难度的长尾词","content":"用 `background remover` 当种子词，选 Phrase Match，对比结果数量和 All Keywords 的差别。"},"498":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool-37","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool#筛出低难度的长尾词","content":"点左侧的 video 组，筛选 KD 低于 50，记录 5 个和视频去背景有关的词。"},"499":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool-38","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-magic-tool#筛出低难度的长尾词","content":"切到 Questions，找出搜索量最高的 3 个问题词。"},"500":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-overview","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-overview","type":"page","content":"Semrush 关键词概览 Keyword Overview","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Semrush 教程","关键词研究 Keyword Research"],"tags":[],"url":"/semrush/keyword-overview"},"501":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-overview-0","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-overview","content":"决定做不做一个词之前的体检：搜索量、全球分布、难度、意图、趋势、CPC，以及谷歌前十名都是谁。"},"502":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-overview-1","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/semrush/keyword-overview#关键词体检卡片","content":"关键词体检卡片"},"503":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-overview-2","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/semrush/keyword-overview#关键词扩展变体问题主题","content":"关键词扩展：变体、问题、主题"},"504":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-overview-3","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/semrush/keyword-overview#谁占着这个词serp-analysis","content":"谁占着这个词：SERP Analysis"},"505":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-overview-4","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-overview","content":"用 Keyword Overview 给一个关键词做完整体检"},"506":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-overview-5","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-overview","content":"看懂 Volume、KD%、Intent、CPC、Competitive Density 这几个\"值不值得做\"的指标"},"507":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-overview-6","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-overview","content":"用 SERP Analysis 看清前十名的实力，判断新站有没有机会"},"508":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-overview-7","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-overview","content":"打开方式：顶部搜索框输入关键词回车，或 SEO 菜单 → Keyword Research → Keyword Overview。在其他报告里点任意一个关键词，也会跳到这里。"},"509":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-overview-8","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-overview#关键词体检卡片","content":"数据库：搜索量、难度、前十名都按国家计算，默认 United States。"},"510":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-overview-9","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-overview#关键词体检卡片","content":"**Volume 82.3 万**：美国每月平均搜索量（过去 12 个月的平均）。"},"511":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-overview-10","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-overview#关键词体检卡片","content":"**Keyword Difficulty 100%（Very hard）**：Semrush 根据前十名网站的权威度和外链算出的排名难度，0–100%。100% 是最难的一档，提示写着\"需要大量站内优化、外链和推广\"。"},"512":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-overview-11","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-overview#关键词体检卡片","content":"**Global Volume 820 万**，其中印度 340 万、美国只有 82.3 万。做这个词不能只看美国。"},"513":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-overview-12","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-overview#关键词体检卡片","content":"Intent：Informational（信息型）。Semrush 按搜索结果页的内容判断用户想干什么。"},"514":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-overview-13","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-overview#关键词体检卡片","content":"Trend：过去 12 个月每月的搜索量，近半年明显走高，但最后一个月回落。"},"515":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-overview-14","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-overview#关键词体检卡片","content":"**CPC $2.65**：投谷歌广告时每次点击的平均价格，越高说明这个词越值钱。"},"516":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-overview-15","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-overview#关键词体检卡片","content":"**Competitive Density 0.05**：广告竞争程度（0–1），几乎没人投这个词的广告。PLA、Ads 是 n/a：搜索结果里没有购物广告和文字广告。"},"517":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-overview-16","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-overview#关键词体检卡片","content":"Similarweb 的 关键词概览 给 remove background 的月搜索是 330 万（全球、近 28 天），Semrush 是全球 820 万（12 个月平均）。两边口径不同、量级也不同，**不要拿一个工具的数字去否定另一个**；但两个工具都显示这是一个百万级、难度极高的词，结论就是可信的。"},"518":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-overview-17","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-overview#关键词扩展变体问题主题","content":"**4.67 万个变体**：Keyword Variations 是包含 remove background 的所有词，合计月搜索 430 万。点下方 View all 进入 Keyword Magic Tool。"},"519":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-overview-18","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-overview#关键词扩展变体问题主题","content":"how to remove background in gimp：月搜索 13.5 万，难度只有 39（黄色）。教程类的长尾词难度低得多。"},"520":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-overview-19","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-overview#关键词扩展变体问题主题","content":"**1.25 万个问题**：Questions 是以 how、what、why 等开头的问题词，适合写教程、做 FAQ。"},"521":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-overview-20","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-overview#关键词扩展变体问题主题","content":"**难度 29**：how to remove background in canva：月搜索 6.05 万，难度 29（绿色，Easy）。"},"522":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-overview-21","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-overview#关键词扩展变体问题主题","content":"Keyword Strategy：Semrush 自动把相关词分成\"主题 + 子页面\"，比如 erase image background、transparent background。点 View all clusters 进入 Keyword Strategy Builder。"},"523":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-overview-22","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-overview#谁占着这个词serp-analysis","content":"Domain / URL：按网站还是按具体页面显示。"},"524":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-overview-23","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-overview#谁占着这个词serp-analysis","content":"SERP Features：这个词的结果页上有 AI 概览、评分、图片、视频。"},"525":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-overview-24","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-overview#谁占着这个词serp-analysis","content":"1-10、11-20……：翻看前 100 名。"},"526":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-overview-25","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-overview#谁占着这个词serp-analysis","content":"第一行是 AI Overview：谷歌在所有自然结果上方先给出 AI 答案。"},"527":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-overview-26","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-overview#谁占着这个词serp-analysis","content":"第 1 名是 Adobe Firefly 的去背景页面，Page AS 是 0、外链 0——这是新页面，Semrush 还没算出它的权威度，它靠的是 adobe.com 整个域名的实力。"},"528":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-overview-27","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-overview#谁占着这个词serp-analysis","content":"Ref. Domains：链接到这个页面的网站数。remove.bg 首页有 2.01 万个。"},"529":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-overview-28","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-overview#谁占着这个词serp-analysis","content":"photiu.ai 页面权威度只有 31、91 个引荐域名，却排在第 6。**难度 100 的词，前十名里也可能有弱页面**，这就是新站的机会。"},"530":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-overview-29","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-overview#谁占着这个词serp-analysis","content":"Search Traffic：这个页面从所有词上拿到的自然流量。"},"531":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-overview-30","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-overview#谁占着这个词serp-analysis","content":"前十名里同时有 Adobe、Canva、Picsart 这样的大站，第 2 名的 remove.bg 首页有 2 万多个引荐域名，意图又是品牌导航为主。这种词对新站来说只能\"顺带\"排，不能当主攻目标。更现实的做法见 关键词难度。"},"532":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-overview-31","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-overview#谁占着这个词serp-analysis","content":"在 Keyword Overview 里分别查 `remove background from gif`、`transparent background maker`、`unblur image`，记录三者的 Volume、KD% 和 CPC。"},"533":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-overview-32","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-overview#谁占着这个词serp-analysis","content":"打开它们的 SERP Analysis，数一数前十名里有几个 Page AS 低于 40 的页面。"},"534":{"id":"/semrush/keyword-overview-33","page_id":"/semrush/keyword-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/keyword-overview#谁占着这个词serp-analysis","content":"把同一个词放到 Similarweb 的 Keyword overview 里，对比两边的搜索量。"},"535":{"id":"/semrush/organic-rankings","page_id":"/semrush/organic-rankings","type":"page","content":"Semrush 自然排名 Organic Rankings","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Semrush 教程","竞品分析 Competitive Analysis"],"tags":[],"url":"/semrush/organic-rankings"},"536":{"id":"/semrush/organic-rankings-0","page_id":"/semrush/organic-rankings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/organic-rankings","content":"一个网站在谷歌上排在哪些词、第几名、每个词带来多少流量，以及最近新排上和掉出的词。"},"537":{"id":"/semrush/organic-rankings-1","page_id":"/semrush/organic-rankings","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/semrush/organic-rankings#overview排名概况","content":"Overview：排名概况"},"538":{"id":"/semrush/organic-rankings-2","page_id":"/semrush/organic-rankings","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/semrush/organic-rankings#排名变化最近新排上了哪些词","content":"排名变化：最近新排上了哪些词"},"539":{"id":"/semrush/organic-rankings-3","page_id":"/semrush/organic-rankings","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/semrush/organic-rankings#positions完整排名表","content":"Positions：完整排名表"},"540":{"id":"/semrush/organic-rankings-4","page_id":"/semrush/organic-rankings","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/semrush/organic-rankings#用筛选找快赢词","content":"用筛选找\"快赢词\""},"541":{"id":"/semrush/organic-rankings-5","page_id":"/semrush/organic-rankings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/organic-rankings","content":"用 Organic Rankings 查出一个网站的全部排名词"},"542":{"id":"/semrush/organic-rankings-6","page_id":"/semrush/organic-rankings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/organic-rankings","content":"看懂 Positions 表格里的每一列，会用筛选找出\"快赢词\""},"543":{"id":"/semrush/organic-rankings-7","page_id":"/semrush/organic-rankings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/organic-rankings","content":"用 Position Changes 发现竞品最近新排上的词"},"544":{"id":"/semrush/organic-rankings-8","page_id":"/semrush/organic-rankings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/organic-rankings","content":"打开方式：SEO 菜单 → Competitive Analysis → Organic Rankings（旧版叫 Organic Research），或在 Domain Overview 里点 Organic Research 区块的 View details。"},"545":{"id":"/semrush/organic-rankings-9","page_id":"/semrush/organic-rankings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/organic-rankings#overview排名概况","content":"国家数据库：按钮上直接显示每个国家的排名词数。remove.bg 在美国有 2.92 万个排名词，在印尼、巴西各 1.18 万个。**这个报告不能选 Worldwide**，要一个国家一个国家看。"},"546":{"id":"/semrush/organic-rankings-10","page_id":"/semrush/organic-rankings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/organic-rankings#overview排名概况","content":"子报告：Positions（完整排名表）、Position Changes（排名变化）、Competitors（竞品）、Topics（主题）、Subdomains（子域名）。"},"547":{"id":"/semrush/organic-rankings-11","page_id":"/semrush/organic-rankings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/organic-rankings#overview排名概况","content":"Keywords 2.92 万：美国数据库里的排名词数，比上月少 6.25%。"},"548":{"id":"/semrush/organic-rankings-12","page_id":"/semrush/organic-rankings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/organic-rankings#overview排名概况","content":"Traffic 320 万：美国的月自然流量估算，基本持平（+0.57%）。"},"549":{"id":"/semrush/organic-rankings-13","page_id":"/semrush/organic-rankings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/organic-rankings#overview排名概况","content":"**Traffic Cost 300 万美元**：如果这些流量都靠谷歌广告买，每月要花多少钱。用来衡量 SEO 流量的商业价值。"},"550":{"id":"/semrush/organic-rankings-14","page_id":"/semrush/organic-rankings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/organic-rankings#overview排名概况","content":"Branded 250 万 / Non-Branded 76 万：品牌词流量在降，非品牌流量在涨，说明它在品牌以外的词上有进展。"},"551":{"id":"/semrush/organic-rankings-15","page_id":"/semrush/organic-rankings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/organic-rankings#overview排名概况","content":"Organic Keywords Trend（All time）：从 2017 年开始有数据，2025 年初排名词最多，之后回落。"},"552":{"id":"/semrush/organic-rankings-16","page_id":"/semrush/organic-rankings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/organic-rankings#overview排名概况","content":"图里的竖虚线是 Semrush 自己的数据变化，比如 Database growth（数据库扩容）、SERP features（开始统计搜索特性）。这些时间点的跳变不是网站本身的变化。"},"553":{"id":"/semrush/organic-rankings-17","page_id":"/semrush/organic-rankings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/organic-rankings#排名变化最近新排上了哪些词","content":"Overview 再往下，有最重要的两张卡片："},"554":{"id":"/semrush/organic-rankings-18","page_id":"/semrush/organic-rankings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/organic-rankings#排名变化最近新排上了哪些词","content":"All Positions / Organic / SERP Features：只看普通自然排名，还是只看图片、视频等搜索特性里的排名。"},"555":{"id":"/semrush/organic-rankings-19","page_id":"/semrush/organic-rankings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/organic-rankings#排名变化最近新排上了哪些词","content":"Position：排名。前面的链接图标表示这个结果在谷歌里带有站内链接（sitelinks）。"},"556":{"id":"/semrush/organic-rankings-20","page_id":"/semrush/organic-rankings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/organic-rankings#排名变化最近新排上了哪些词","content":"SF：这个词的搜索结果页上有几种 SERP 特性（AI 概览、图片、视频、问答等）。"},"557":{"id":"/semrush/organic-rankings-21","page_id":"/semrush/organic-rankings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/organic-rankings#排名变化最近新排上了哪些词","content":"Top Position Changes in Organic：New 是新进入前 100 名的词，Lost 是掉出前 100 名的词，Improved、Declined 是排名上升、下降的词。"},"558":{"id":"/semrush/organic-rankings-22","page_id":"/semrush/organic-rankings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/organic-rankings#排名变化最近新排上了哪些词","content":"新排上的词：bgremove（第 3）、change background（第 14）、bg remoive（第 18）……很多是**拼写错误的变体**，这类词竞争小，靠首页就能顺带排上去。"},"559":{"id":"/semrush/organic-rankings-23","page_id":"/semrush/organic-rankings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/organic-rankings#排名变化最近新排上了哪些词","content":"Previous 是灰点，表示上一次统计时还没有排名。"},"560":{"id":"/semrush/organic-rankings-24","page_id":"/semrush/organic-rankings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/organic-rankings#排名变化最近新排上了哪些词","content":"Top Position Changes in SERP Features：make background transperent 新出现在谷歌 AI 概览（✦ 图标）里。AI 概览里的位置越来越重要。"},"561":{"id":"/semrush/organic-rankings-25","page_id":"/semrush/organic-rankings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/organic-rankings#排名变化最近新排上了哪些词","content":"竞品新排上的词，往往对应它刚上线的新页面或新功能。每个月看一次竞品的 Position Changes › New，按搜索量排序，是发现新需求最省力的办法——和 Similarweb 的 New Clicks 思路一样。"},"562":{"id":"/semrush/organic-rankings-26","page_id":"/semrush/organic-rankings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/organic-rankings#positions完整排名表","content":"切到 Positions 标签，就是这个网站全部排名词的表格。表格上面先是一排筛选："},"563":{"id":"/semrush/organic-rankings-27","page_id":"/semrush/organic-rankings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/organic-rankings#positions完整排名表","content":"Positions 标签。"},"564":{"id":"/semrush/organic-rankings-28","page_id":"/semrush/organic-rankings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/organic-rankings#positions完整排名表","content":"All Positions / Organic / SERP Features：和 Overview 里的同名切换一样。"},"565":{"id":"/semrush/organic-rankings-29","page_id":"/semrush/organic-rankings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/organic-rankings#positions完整排名表","content":"Positions：按排名区间筛选，比如只看第 4–20 名。"},"566":{"id":"/semrush/organic-rankings-30","page_id":"/semrush/organic-rankings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/organic-rankings#positions完整排名表","content":"Volume：按搜索量筛选。"},"567":{"id":"/semrush/organic-rankings-31","page_id":"/semrush/organic-rankings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/organic-rankings#positions完整排名表","content":"KD：按关键词难度筛选。"},"568":{"id":"/semrush/organic-rankings-32","page_id":"/semrush/organic-rankings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/organic-rankings#positions完整排名表","content":"Intent：按搜索意图筛选，比如只看 Commercial、Transactional。"},"569":{"id":"/semrush/organic-rankings-33","page_id":"/semrush/organic-rankings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/organic-rankings#positions完整排名表","content":"SERP Features：只看出现了某种搜索特性的词，比如 AI Overview、视频。"},"570":{"id":"/semrush/organic-rankings-34","page_id":"/semrush/organic-rankings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/organic-rankings#positions完整排名表","content":"Advanced filters：组合条件，比如\"URL 包含 /tools/\"、\"关键词不包含品牌词\"。"},"571":{"id":"/semrush/organic-rankings-35","page_id":"/semrush/organic-rankings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/organic-rankings#positions完整排名表","content":"一共 29,170 个排名词。"},"572":{"id":"/semrush/organic-rankings-36","page_id":"/semrush/organic-rankings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/organic-rankings#positions完整排名表","content":"展开箭头：查看这个词的搜索结果页快照和排名历史。"},"573":{"id":"/semrush/organic-rankings-37","page_id":"/semrush/organic-rankings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/organic-rankings#positions完整排名表","content":"Intent：搜索意图。"},"574":{"id":"/semrush/organic-rankings-38","page_id":"/semrush/organic-rankings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/organic-rankings#positions完整排名表","content":"Position：当前排名。"},"575":{"id":"/semrush/organic-rankings-39","page_id":"/semrush/organic-rankings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/organic-rankings#positions完整排名表","content":"SF：搜索结果页上的特性，亮色图标表示这个网站占了该特性（比如在图片结果里也出现了）。"},"576":{"id":"/semrush/organic-rankings-40","page_id":"/semrush/organic-rankings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/organic-rankings#positions完整排名表","content":"Traffic %：这个词带来的流量占全站的百分比，默认按它排序。"},"577":{"id":"/semrush/organic-rankings-41","page_id":"/semrush/organic-rankings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/organic-rankings#positions完整排名表","content":"KD %：关键词难度，红点越多越难。remove.bg 排第 1 的词几乎都是 90 以上。"},"578":{"id":"/semrush/organic-rankings-42","page_id":"/semrush/organic-rankings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/organic-rankings#positions完整排名表","content":"URL：排名的具体页面。remove.bg 绝大多数词都排在首页。"},"579":{"id":"/semrush/organic-rankings-43","page_id":"/semrush/organic-rankings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/organic-rankings#positions完整排名表","content":"transparent background maker：难度 54，月搜索 2.22 万，是表里少有的中等难度词。"},"580":{"id":"/semrush/organic-rankings-44","page_id":"/semrush/organic-rankings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/organic-rankings#用筛选找快赢词","content":"| 想找什么 | 筛选条件                        | 为什么                 |\n| ---- | --------------------------- | ------------------- |\n| 快赢词  | Positions 4–20，Volume > 500 | 已经在第一、二页，稍微优化就可能进前三 |","table":"table-0"},"581":{"id":"/semrush/organic-rankings-45","page_id":"/semrush/organic-rankings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/organic-rankings#用筛选找快赢词","content":"| 想找什么   | 筛选条件                                | 为什么      |\n| ------ | ----------------------------------- | -------- |\n| 竞品的商业词 | Intent = Commercial / Transactional | 这些词离付费最近 |","table":"table-0"},"582":{"id":"/semrush/organic-rankings-46","page_id":"/semrush/organic-rankings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/organic-rankings#用筛选找快赢词","content":"| 想找什么 | 筛选条件                                                  | 为什么                 |\n| ---- | ----------------------------------------------------- | ------------------- |\n| 非品牌词 | Advanced filters → Keyword 不包含 `remove bg`、`removebg` | 排除品牌词，才能看出 SEO 真实能力 |","table":"table-0"},"583":{"id":"/semrush/organic-rankings-47","page_id":"/semrush/organic-rankings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/organic-rankings#用筛选找快赢词","content":"| 想找什么   | 筛选条件                            | 为什么         |\n| ------ | ------------------------------- | ----------- |\n| 某个功能的词 | Advanced filters → URL 包含 `/f/` | 只看某一类页面带来的词 |","table":"table-0"},"584":{"id":"/semrush/organic-rankings-48","page_id":"/semrush/organic-rankings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/organic-rankings#用筛选找快赢词","content":"| 想找什么 | 筛选条件                               | 为什么      |\n| ---- | ---------------------------------- | -------- |\n| 新兴需求 | Position Changes › New，按 Volume 排序 | 竞品最近排上的词 |","table":"table-0"},"585":{"id":"/semrush/organic-rankings-49","page_id":"/semrush/organic-rankings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/organic-rankings#用筛选找快赢词","content":"在 remove.bg 的 Positions 里筛选 Positions 4–20、Volume 大于 1,000，看看还有哪些词有机会冲进前三。"},"586":{"id":"/semrush/organic-rankings-50","page_id":"/semrush/organic-rankings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/organic-rankings#用筛选找快赢词","content":"用 Advanced filters 排除品牌词，找出 remove.bg 流量最大的 5 个非品牌词。"},"587":{"id":"/semrush/organic-rankings-51","page_id":"/semrush/organic-rankings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/organic-rankings#用筛选找快赢词","content":"打开 photoroom.com 的 Position Changes，看看它最近新排上了哪些词。"},"588":{"id":"/semrush/top-pages","page_id":"/semrush/top-pages","type":"page","content":"Semrush 热门页面 Top Pages","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Semrush 教程","竞品分析 Competitive Analysis"],"tags":[],"url":"/semrush/top-pages"},"589":{"id":"/semrush/top-pages-0","page_id":"/semrush/top-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/top-pages","content":"一个网站哪些页面带来的自然流量最多、每个页面靠哪个词、最近新增了哪些页面，以及哪些页面被 AI 引用。"},"590":{"id":"/semrush/top-pages-1","page_id":"/semrush/top-pages","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/semrush/top-pages#怎么用-top-pages","content":"怎么用 Top Pages"},"591":{"id":"/semrush/top-pages-2","page_id":"/semrush/top-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/top-pages","content":"用 Top Pages 找出竞品流量最大的页面"},"592":{"id":"/semrush/top-pages-3","page_id":"/semrush/top-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/top-pages","content":"看懂 Traffic Diff、Keywords、LLM Prompts、Ref. Domains 这几列"},"593":{"id":"/semrush/top-pages-4","page_id":"/semrush/top-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/top-pages","content":"学会用 New 筛选和 Traffic Diff 排序，发现竞品正在起量的页面"},"594":{"id":"/semrush/top-pages-5","page_id":"/semrush/top-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/top-pages","content":"打开方式：SEO 菜单 → Competitive Analysis → Top Pages。"},"595":{"id":"/semrush/top-pages-6","page_id":"/semrush/top-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/top-pages","content":"Organic Traffic 320 万：美国数据库的月自然流量估算。"},"596":{"id":"/semrush/top-pages-7","page_id":"/semrush/top-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/top-pages","content":"Organic Pages 889：有自然流量的页面数，比上月多 2.89%。"},"597":{"id":"/semrush/top-pages-8","page_id":"/semrush/top-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/top-pages","content":"Cited Pages 220：被 AI 回答引用为来源的页面数，下降了 32.31%。"},"598":{"id":"/semrush/top-pages-9","page_id":"/semrush/top-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/top-pages","content":"紫色线是 Cited Pages 的趋势：从年初开始一路下滑，而自然流量（深色线）在 5 月后反而上涨。"},"599":{"id":"/semrush/top-pages-10","page_id":"/semrush/top-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/top-pages","content":"All URLs / New / Lost：New 是最近新出现流量的页面，Lost 是失去流量的页面。"},"600":{"id":"/semrush/top-pages-11","page_id":"/semrush/top-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/top-pages","content":"首页一个页面就拿走了 **93.41%** 的流量（300 万），排名词 1.01 万个，2.01 万个引荐域名链接到它。单页工具站的典型结构。"},"601":{"id":"/semrush/top-pages-12","page_id":"/semrush/top-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/top-pages","content":"第二名是西班牙语首页 `/es`，靠 quitar fondo（西语\"去背景\"）拿到 3.6 万流量。**多语言页面是工具站的第二增长点。**"},"602":{"id":"/semrush/top-pages-13","page_id":"/semrush/top-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/top-pages","content":"`/f/transparent-background` 这类功能落地页，单页流量 3.28 万，比上月多 7,800。"},"603":{"id":"/semrush/top-pages-14","page_id":"/semrush/top-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/top-pages","content":"Traffic Diff：和上一期相比流量变化了多少，点表头按它排序，最先看到的就是正在起量的页面。"},"604":{"id":"/semrush/top-pages-15","page_id":"/semrush/top-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/top-pages","content":"LLM Prompts：有多少条 AI 提示词的回答引用了这个页面。"},"605":{"id":"/semrush/top-pages-16","page_id":"/semrush/top-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/top-pages#怎么用-top-pages","content":"| 目的       | 操作                         |\n| -------- | -------------------------- |\n| 看竞品的流量结构 | 默认按 Traffic 排序，前几个页面占了多少流量 |","table":"table-0"},"606":{"id":"/semrush/top-pages-17","page_id":"/semrush/top-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/top-pages#怎么用-top-pages","content":"| 目的         | 操作                    |\n| ---------- | --------------------- |\n| 找竞品正在起量的页面 | 按 Traffic Diff 从高到低排序 |","table":"table-0"},"607":{"id":"/semrush/top-pages-18","page_id":"/semrush/top-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/top-pages#怎么用-top-pages","content":"| 目的        | 操作    |\n| --------- | ----- |\n| 找竞品新上线的页面 | 点 New |","table":"table-0"},"608":{"id":"/semrush/top-pages-19","page_id":"/semrush/top-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/top-pages#怎么用-top-pages","content":"| 目的           | 操作                                |\n| ------------ | --------------------------------- |\n| 看一个页面靠什么词拿流量 | 点这一行的 Keywords 数字，跳到这个 URL 的排名词列表 |","table":"table-0"},"609":{"id":"/semrush/top-pages-20","page_id":"/semrush/top-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/top-pages#怎么用-top-pages","content":"| 目的         | 操作                                        |\n| ---------- | ----------------------------------------- |\n| 找可以模仿的页面类型 | 用 Filter by URL 过滤 `/tools/`、`/blog/` 等目录 |","table":"table-0"},"610":{"id":"/semrush/top-pages-21","page_id":"/semrush/top-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/top-pages#怎么用-top-pages","content":"Similarweb 的 落地页 统计的是**所有搜索点击**（包括它数据库里的新词），Semrush 的 Top Pages 只统计**它数据库里有排名的词**。两边都排在前面的页面，基本可以确定是竞品的核心流量页。"},"611":{"id":"/semrush/top-pages-22","page_id":"/semrush/top-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/top-pages#怎么用-top-pages","content":"打开 photoroom.com 的 Top Pages，按 Traffic Diff 排序，记录最近流量增长最多的 3 个页面。"},"612":{"id":"/semrush/top-pages-23","page_id":"/semrush/top-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/semrush/top-pages#怎么用-top-pages","content":"点 New，看看 photoroom 最近新增了哪些有流量的页面，它们对应什么功能。"},"613":{"id":"/similarweb/ai-traffic","page_id":"/similarweb/ai-traffic","type":"page","content":"Similarweb AI 流量 AI traffic","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Similarweb 教程","排名与 AI"],"tags":[],"url":"/similarweb/ai-traffic"},"614":{"id":"/similarweb/ai-traffic-0","page_id":"/similarweb/ai-traffic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/ai-traffic","content":"ChatGPT、Gemini、Perplexity、Claude 等 AI 产品给一个网站带来了多少访问、趋势如何、落到了哪些页面。"},"615":{"id":"/similarweb/ai-traffic-1","page_id":"/similarweb/ai-traffic","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/similarweb/ai-traffic#ai-流量和其他报告的关系","content":"AI 流量和其他报告的关系"},"616":{"id":"/similarweb/ai-traffic-2","page_id":"/similarweb/ai-traffic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/ai-traffic","content":"看懂 AI traffic 报告：AI 引荐流量总量、各 AI 平台占比、逐月趋势"},"617":{"id":"/similarweb/ai-traffic-3","page_id":"/similarweb/ai-traffic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/ai-traffic","content":"知道 AI 流量在整个渠道结构里的位置，以及它和传统搜索的关系"},"618":{"id":"/similarweb/ai-traffic-4","page_id":"/similarweb/ai-traffic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/ai-traffic","content":"用户越来越多地在 ChatGPT、Gemini 里直接问\"有什么好用的抠图工具\"，AI 的回答里如果推荐了你的网站，用户点进来就是 **AI 引荐流量**。Similarweb 把它单独做成了 AI search intelligence 模块里的 AI traffic 报告。"},"619":{"id":"/similarweb/ai-traffic-5","page_id":"/similarweb/ai-traffic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/ai-traffic","content":"打开方式：左侧主导航 AI search intelligence → AI traffic，输入网站。这个报告默认看最近 6 个月。"},"620":{"id":"/similarweb/ai-traffic-6","page_id":"/similarweb/ai-traffic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/ai-traffic","content":"和自然搜索的 55% 比，AI 流量还很小，但它是唯一一个\"新冒出来\"的渠道，值得持续跟踪。"},"621":{"id":"/similarweb/ai-traffic-7","page_id":"/similarweb/ai-traffic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/ai-traffic","content":"Traffic split：各 AI 平台的占比。两家合计超过八成。"},"622":{"id":"/similarweb/ai-traffic-8","page_id":"/similarweb/ai-traffic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/ai-traffic","content":"最深色是 ChatGPT，其次是 Gemini。可以看到 Gemini 的份额在 7–8 月明显扩大。"},"623":{"id":"/similarweb/ai-traffic-9","page_id":"/similarweb/ai-traffic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/ai-traffic","content":"右侧列出所有 AI 平台的月均流量：ChatGPT 21.58 万、Gemini 18.65 万、Perplexity 9,900、Claude 1,500、Copilot 702……"},"624":{"id":"/similarweb/ai-traffic-10","page_id":"/similarweb/ai-traffic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/ai-traffic","content":"导出 Excel。"},"625":{"id":"/similarweb/ai-traffic-11","page_id":"/similarweb/ai-traffic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/ai-traffic","content":"页面往下还有 **URL** 列表：哪些页面拿到了 AI 引荐流量（remove.bg 有 98 个）。如果你的网站有 AI 流量，这里能看出 AI 最常推荐你的哪个页面。"},"626":{"id":"/similarweb/ai-traffic-12","page_id":"/similarweb/ai-traffic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/ai-traffic#ai-流量和其他报告的关系","content":"| 你在哪看到              | 内容                            |\n| ------------------ | ----------------------------- |\n| 网站概览 › AI insights | 一句话结论，例如\"Gemini 带来了大部分 AI 流量\" |","table":"table-0"},"627":{"id":"/similarweb/ai-traffic-13","page_id":"/similarweb/ai-traffic","tags":