":"text","url":"/similarweb/audience","content":"用 Audience Interests 找到\"访客还常去的网站\"——这是发现竞品和合作对象最快的方法"},"646":{"id":"/similarweb/audience-9","page_id":"/similarweb/audience","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/audience","content":"用 Audience Overlap 判断和竞品抢的是不是同一批用户"},"647":{"id":"/similarweb/audience-10","page_id":"/similarweb/audience","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/audience","content":"打开方式：二级菜单点 Audience。页面顶部有 4 个标签页，本章按顺序讲。"},"648":{"id":"/similarweb/audience-11","page_id":"/similarweb/audience","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/audience#geography-地域","content":"第一个标签页是地图加国家明细表。地图和网站概览里的 Top countries 一样，真正有用的是下面这张 121 个国家的完整表："},"649":{"id":"/similarweb/audience-12","page_id":"/similarweb/audience","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/audience#geography-地域","content":"Change 是该国流量的环比变化。前五大市场全部是红色（下降）。"},"650":{"id":"/similarweb/audience-13","page_id":"/similarweb/audience","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/audience#geography-地域","content":"越南 +4.68%、秘鲁 +5.56%、马来西亚 +3.19%，以及墨西哥、泰国小幅增长。整体下滑时，这些\"逆势增长\"的国家值得单独研究。"},"651":{"id":"/similarweb/audience-14","page_id":"/similarweb/audience","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/audience#geography-地域","content":"**受众占比 > 流量占比。**\nAudience Share 是\"人数\"占比。印尼流量占 13.99%，人数却占 15.68%：说明印尼用户人多、但每人访问次数偏少。"},"652":{"id":"/similarweb/audience-15","page_id":"/similarweb/audience","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/audience#geography-地域","content":"**在当地的排名。**\nCountry rank 是 remove.bg 在该国所有网站里的排名：菲律宾 #202、美国 #2,842。排名越靠前，说明在当地越\"主流\"。"},"653":{"id":"/similarweb/audience-16","page_id":"/similarweb/audience","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/audience#geography-地域","content":"把表格按 Change 排序，找**流量占比不低、又在增长**的国家；再结合 Country rank 判断竞争程度。比如越南：占比 1.61%、还在增长，而且非品牌热词里就有越南语\"tách nền\"\"cắt nền\"——做越南语落地页是一个很具体的机会。"},"654":{"id":"/similarweb/audience-17","page_id":"/similarweb/audience","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/audience#demographics-人口属性","content":"18–24 岁 29.86%，25–34 岁 28.06%，年轻用户为主。"},"655":{"id":"/similarweb/audience-18","page_id":"/similarweb/audience","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/audience#demographics-人口属性","content":"Traffic and engagement by audience：在两个下拉框里选性别和年龄段，下面的表格就只统计这部分人。"},"656":{"id":"/similarweb/audience-19","page_id":"/similarweb/audience","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/audience#demographics-人口属性","content":"这群人占受众的 11.4%，平均访问 3 分 12 秒、2.99 页、跳出率 28.79%——都比整体平均（2:51、2.87 页、33.05%）更好。"},"657":{"id":"/similarweb/audience-20","page_id":"/similarweb/audience","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/audience#demographics-人口属性","content":"性别和年龄是 Similarweb 根据样本用户推算的，小网站误差更大。用来判断\"大致是什么人群\"没问题，不要把百分比精确到小数点去做决策。"},"658":{"id":"/similarweb/audience-21","page_id":"/similarweb/audience","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/audience#audience-interests-兴趣与交叉访问","content":"Industry distribution：remove.bg 的访客在其他网站上的浏览，按行业分布。游戏、政府网站排在前面——可以推测不少用户和\"做游戏头像、办证件照\"这类场景有关，这类推测需要再用关键词数据验证。"},"659":{"id":"/similarweb/audience-22","page_id":"/similarweb/audience","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/audience#audience-interests-兴趣与交叉访问","content":"字越大，访客越常浏览这个话题。"},"660":{"id":"/similarweb/audience-23","page_id":"/similarweb/audience","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/audience#audience-interests-兴趣与交叉访问","content":"下面的表列出 15,277 个\"访客也会去\"的网站。Cross-visitation（交叉访问率）= 也访问该网站的访客比例。"},"661":{"id":"/similarweb/audience-24","page_id":"/similarweb/audience","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/audience#audience-interests-兴趣与交叉访问","content":"**直接竞品也在前几名：**\nphotoroom.com、iloveimg.com 是功能重叠的图片工具。"},"662":{"id":"/similarweb/audience-25","page_id":"/similarweb/audience","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/audience#audience-interests-兴趣与交叉访问","content":"Relevance score（0–100）综合了交叉访问率和网站规模，越高表示受众越相似。找竞品时按它排序比按交叉访问率排序更准。"},"663":{"id":"/similarweb/audience-26","page_id":"/similarweb/audience","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/audience#audience-interests-兴趣与交叉访问","content":"**找竞品**：在 Industry 列筛选和自己同一行业的网站，排在前面的就是\"抢同一批用户\"的竞品"},"664":{"id":"/similarweb/audience-27","page_id":"/similarweb/audience","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/audience#audience-interests-兴趣与交叉访问","content":"**找合作 / 投放渠道**：不同行业、但交叉访问率高的网站（比如 Canva），是做内容合作、广告投放的好对象"},"665":{"id":"/similarweb/audience-28","page_id":"/similarweb/audience","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/audience#audience-interests-兴趣与交叉访问","content":"**找新需求**：访客常去、但你没想到的网站类别，往往对应着新的使用场景"},"666":{"id":"/similarweb/audience-29","page_id":"/similarweb/audience","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/audience#audience-overlap-受众重合","content":"这个标签页需要对比对象。没有手动添加时，Similarweb 会自动选两个竞品（这里是 photoroom.com 和 pixelcut.ai）。"},"667":{"id":"/similarweb/audience-30","page_id":"/similarweb/audience","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/audience#audience-overlap-受众重合","content":"把鼠标移到圆圈上可以看到具体人数。注意：圆圈大小只是示意，不严格代表网站规模。"},"668":{"id":"/similarweb/audience-31","page_id":"/similarweb/audience","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/audience#audience-overlap-受众重合","content":"remove.bg 2234 万、photoroom.com 555 万、pixelcut.ai 431 万，三家去重后合计 2910 万。"},"669":{"id":"/similarweb/audience-32","page_id":"/similarweb/audience","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/audience#audience-overlap-受众重合","content":"下面的表格从主网站的视角计算：共同访客占比、主网站独有访客、对方有但主网站还没覆盖到的访客（Unreached potential visitors）。"},"670":{"id":"/similarweb/audience-33","page_id":"/similarweb/audience","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/audience#audience-overlap-受众重合","content":"表格的数据（以 remove.bg 为主网站）："},"671":{"id":"/similarweb/audience-34","page_id":"/similarweb/audience","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/audience#audience-overlap-受众重合","content":"| 对比对象          | 共同访客占比 | 共同访客数    | remove.bg 独有访客 | 还没覆盖到的潜在访客 |\n| ------------- | ------ | -------- | -------------- | ---------- |\n| photoroom.com | 1.1%   | 约 23.6 万 | 1981 万         | 676 万      |","table":"table-0"},"672":{"id":"/similarweb/audience-35","page_id":"