| --------------------- | --------- |\n| 它靠哪些关键词拿流量？最近冒出了哪些新词？ | 关键词研究、落地页 |","table":"table-0"},"995":{"id":"/similarweb/intro-15","page_id":"/similarweb/intro","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/intro#similarweb-是什么","content":"| 问题           | 去哪看   |\n| ------------ | ----- |\n| 某个行业谁最大、谁在涨？ | 网站排行榜 |","table":"table-0"},"996":{"id":"/similarweb/intro-16","page_id":"/similarweb/intro","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/intro#similarweb-是什么","content":"| 问题            | 去哪看   |\n| ------------- | ----- |\n| AI 给它带来了多少流量？ | AI 流量 |","table":"table-0"},"997":{"id":"/similarweb/intro-17","page_id":"/similarweb/intro","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/intro#数据从哪来","content":"Similarweb 不能直接看到别人网站的后台，它的数据是**多种来源 + 模型估算**："},"998":{"id":"/similarweb/intro-18","page_id":"/similarweb/intro","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/intro#数据从哪来","content":"**用户行为样本**：通过合作的浏览器扩展、App 等收集匿名化的浏览行为样本"},"999":{"id":"/similarweb/intro-19","page_id":"/similarweb/intro","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/intro#数据从哪来","content":"**直接测量**：网站主主动连接 Google Analytics 等工具后提供的真实数据（也用来校准模型）"},"1000":{"id":"/similarweb/intro-20","page_id":"/similarweb/intro","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/intro#数据从哪来","content":"**合作伙伴数据**：来自第三方数据合作方的流量数据"},"1001":{"id":"/similarweb/intro-21","page_id":"/similarweb/intro","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/intro#数据从哪来","content":"**公开数据**：抓取公开网页、搜索结果等"},"1002":{"id":"/similarweb/intro-22","page_id":"/similarweb/intro","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/intro#数据从哪来","content":"这些数据经过机器学习模型，推算出全网的流量估算值。"},"1003":{"id":"/similarweb/intro-23","page_id":"/similarweb/intro","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/intro#数据从哪来","content":"**大网站相对准**：月访问几百万以上的网站，趋势和量级通常可信"},"1004":{"id":"/similarweb/intro-24","page_id":"/similarweb/intro","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/intro#数据从哪来","content":"**小网站误差大**：月访问只有几万甚至更少时，数字可能偏差很大，太小的网站会直接显示没有数据"},"1005":{"id":"/similarweb/intro-25","page_id":"/similarweb/intro","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/intro#数据从哪来","content":"**看趋势比看绝对值更可靠**：同一工具、同一口径下的涨跌和排序，比单个数字更有参考价值"},"1006":{"id":"/similarweb/intro-26","page_id":"/similarweb/intro","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/intro#数据从哪来","content":"**不同工具口径不同**：Similarweb 的访问量和 Semrush、Google Analytics 对不上是正常的，不要混在一起比"},"1007":{"id":"/similarweb/intro-27","page_id":"/similarweb/intro","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/intro#账号与版本","content":"| 方式                                | 能看什么              | 适合        |\n| --------------------------------- | ----------------- | --------- |\n| 官网免费查询（similarweb.com/website/域名） | 月访问、国家、渠道、相似网站等概览 | 偶尔查一下某个网站 |","table":"table-1"},"1008":{"id":"/similarweb/intro-28","page_id":"/similarweb/intro","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/intro#账号与版本","content":"| 方式    | 能看什么        | 适合     |\n| ----- | ----------- | ------ |\n| 浏览器扩展 | 当前浏览网站的流量概览 | 浏览时随手看 |","table":"table-1"},"1009":{"id":"/similarweb/intro-29","page_id":"/similarweb/intro","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/intro#账号与版本","content":"| 方式                    | 能看什么      | 适合         |\n| --------------------- | --------- | ---------- |\n| 付费平台 Web Intelligence | 本教程讲的全部报告 | 系统做竞品分析和找词 |","table":"table-1"},"1010":{"id":"/similarweb/intro-30","page_id":"/similarweb/intro","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/intro#账号与版本","content":"付费平台里，不同套餐开放的功能、历史长度和国家范围不同。本教程截图使用的套餐：**历史数据最长 6 个月、国家只开放 Worldwide**（见界面导览里的时间和国家选择器）。"},"1011":{"id":"/similarweb/intro-31","page_id":"/similarweb/intro","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/intro#similarweb-和-semrush-怎么分工","content":"|      | Similarweb                      | Semrush            |\n| ---- | ------------------------------- | ------------------ |\n| 核心视角 | 网站的**全部流量**：直接访问、搜索、社交、引荐、广告、AI | **搜索引擎**：关键词、排名、外链 |","table":"table-2"},"1012":{"id":"/similarweb/intro-32","page_id":"/similarweb/intro","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/intro#similarweb-和-semrush-怎么分工","content":"|     | Similarweb             | Semrush                       |\n| --- | ---------------------- | ----------------------------- |\n| 最擅长 | 流量规模、渠道结构、受众、竞品格局、市场份额 | 关键词搜索量与难度、排名追踪、外链分析、站内 SEO 审计 |","table":"table-2"},"1013":{"id":"/similarweb/intro-33","page_id":"/similarweb/intro","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/intro#similarweb-和-semrush-怎么分工","content":"|        | Similarweb           | Semrush                 |\n| ------ | -------------------- | ----------------------- |\n| 找词时的角色 | 发现：哪些网站和页面在起量、它们靠什么词 | 验证：词的搜索量、难度、CPC、SERP 竞争 |","table":"table-2"},"1014":{"id":"/similarweb/intro-34","page_id":"/similarweb/intro","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/intro#similarweb-和-semrush-怎么分工","content":"**先用 Similarweb 发现，再用 Semrush 验证。** 比如：用 Similarweb 的 Landing pages + New Clicks 发现一批新词 → 用 Semrush 的 Keyword Overview 查搜索量、KD 和 CPC → 两边数据都支持，再动手做。"},"1015":{"id":"/similarweb/keyword-generator","page_id":"/similarweb/keyword-generator","type":"page","content":"Similarweb 拓词 Keyword generator","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Similarweb 教程","SEO 关键词研究"],"tags":[],"url":"/similarweb/keyword-generator"},"1016":{"id":"/similarweb/keyword-generator-0","page_id":"/similarweb/keyword-generator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/keyword-generator","content":"输入一个种子词，拓展出成千上万个相关关键词，并用全年趋势一眼发现正在爆发的词。"},"1017":{"id":"/similarweb/keyword-generator-1","page_id":"/similarweb/keyword-generator","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/similarweb/keyword-generator#词表两种搜索量--全年趋势","content":"词表：两种搜索量 + 全年趋势"},"1018":{"id":"/similarweb/keyword-generator-2","page_id":"/similarweb/keyword-generator","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/similarweb/keyword-generator#拓词的实用技巧","content":"拓词的实用技巧"},"1019":{"id":"/similarweb/keyword-generator-3","page_id":"/similarweb/keyword-generator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/keyword-generator","content":"用 Keyword generator 从一个种子词拓展词表"},"1020":{"id":"/similarweb/keyword-generator-4","page_id":"/similarweb/keyword-generator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/keyword-generator","content":"分清 4 种拓词方式：Phrase Match、Related、Trending、Questions"},"1021":{"id":"/similarweb/keyword-generator-5","page_id":"/similarweb/keyword-generator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/keyword-generator","content":"用 Yearly trend 和两种搜索量的差距找到\"正在变热\"的词"},"1022":{"id":"/similarweb/keyword-generator-6","page_id":"/similarweb/keyword-generator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/keyword-generator","content":"打开方式：Keyword research → Keyword explorer → Keyword generator，输入种子词后回车。本章种子词用 `remove background`，时间为 Last 28 days。"},"1023":{"id":"/similarweb/keyword-generator-7","page_id":"/similarweb/keyword-generator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/keyword-generator","content":"默认 Google，也可以切换成其他搜索引擎。"},"1024":{"id":"/similarweb/keyword-generator-8","page_id":"/similarweb/keyword-generator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/keyword-generator","content":"**Phrase Match**：包含种子词的所有词（如 remove background free、remove background from image）。"},"1025":{"id":"/similarweb/keyword-generator-9","page_id":"/similarweb/keyword-generator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/keyword-generator","content":"**Related Keywords**：不一定包含种子词、但搜索意图相近的词，用来发现同一需求的其他说法。"},"1026":{"id":"/similarweb/keyword-generator-10","page_id":"/similarweb/keyword-generator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/keyword-generator","content":"**Trending Keywords**：最近搜索量增长最快的相关词。"},"1027":{"id":"/similarweb/keyword-generator-11","page_id":"/similarweb/keyword-generator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/keyword-generator","content":"**Questions Queries**：疑问句形式的词（how to remove background…），适合写教程类内容。"},"1028":{"id":"/similarweb/keyword-generator-12","page_id":"/similarweb/keyword-generator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/keyword-generator","content":"勾选词后可以加入关键词清单（Keyword list）或排名追踪（Search tracker）。"},"1029":{"id":"/similarweb/keyword-generator-13","page_id":"/similarweb/keyword-generator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/keyword-generator#词表两种搜索量--全年趋势","content":"28 Days Volume 是最近 28 天的搜索量，Avg. volume 是长期平均。两者对比，能看出一个词是在升温还是降温。"},"1030":{"id":"/similarweb/keyword-generator-14","page_id":"/similarweb/keyword-generator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/keyword-generator#词表两种搜索量--全年趋势","content":"**background remove：**\n近 28 天 240 万次，平均只有 63.8 万次；全年趋势柱前面都很矮，最后两个月突然拉高。"},"1031":{"id":"/similarweb/keyword-generator-15","page_id":"/similarweb/keyword-generator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/keyword-generator#词表两种搜索量--全年趋势","content":"它的全年趋势：最后两根柱子猛涨。"},"1032":{"id":"/similarweb/keyword-generator-16","page_id":"/similarweb/keyword-generator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/keyword-generator#词表两种搜索量--全年趋势","content":"**全年趋势。**\nYearly trend：过去 12 个月的搜索量柱状图。整排一样高 = 稳定需求；越来越高 = 上升期；只有一两根特别高 = 短期热点或季节性。"},"1033":{"id":"/similarweb/keyword-generator-17","page_id":"/similarweb/keyword-generator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/keyword-generator#词表两种搜索量--全年趋势","content":"video background remover 每月约 10 万次，说明\"视频去背景\"是一个独立的细分需求，可以单独做一个工具。"},"1034":{"id":"/similarweb/keyword-generator-18","page_id":"/similarweb/keyword-generator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/keyword-generator#词表两种搜索量--全年趋势","content":"表格右侧还有 KD（难度）、Intent（意图）、CPC 和 **Leader**（这个词当前流量最大的网站）。"},"1035":{"id":"/similarweb/keyword-generator-19","page_id":"/similarweb/keyword-generator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/keyword-generator#拓词的实用技巧","content":"| 目的    | 操作                                                                 |\n| ----- | ------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| 找细分需求 | 在 Phrase Match 里看\"种子词 + 修饰词\"：free、png、video、online、app、for iphone… |","table":"table-0"},"1036":{"id":"/similarweb/keyword-generator-20","page_id":"/similarweb/keyword-generator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/keyword-generator#拓词的实用技巧","content":"| 目的   | 操作                               |\n| ---- | -------------------------------- |\n| 找新说法 | 切到 Related Keywords，找不包含种子词的同义说法 |","table":"table-0"},"1037":{"id":"/similarweb/keyword-generator-21","page_id":"/similarweb/keyword-generator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/keyword-generator#拓词的实用技巧","content":"| 目的    | 操作                                |\n| ----- | --------------------------------- |\n| 找内容选题 | 切到 Questions Queries，问题词就是现成的文章标题 |","table":"table-0"},"1038":{"id":"/similarweb/keyword-generator-22","page_id":"/similarweb/keyword-generator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/keyword-generator#拓词的实用技巧","content":"| 目的   | 操作                                                     |\n| ---- | ------------------------------------------------------ |\n| 找爆发词 | 对比 28 Days Volume 和 Avg. volume，或直接看 Trending Keywords |","table":"table-0"},"1039":{"id":"/similarweb/keyword-generator-23","page_id":"/similarweb/keyword-generator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/keyword-generator#拓词的实用技巧","content":"| 目的   | 操作                                                 |\n| ---- | -------------------------------------------------- |\n| 排除干扰 | Include/Exclude Keywords 里排除品牌词（如 remove bg、canva） |","table":"table-0"},"1040":{"id":"/similarweb/keyword-generator-24","page_id":"/similarweb/keyword-generator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/keyword-generator#拓词的实用技巧","content":"拓词默认看最近 28 天，单月波动会被放大。看到\"爆发词\"后，一定要用全年趋势和关键词概览里的 Trend over time 再确认一次。"},"1041":{"id":"/similarweb/keyword-generator-25","page_id":"/similarweb/keyword-generator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/keyword-generator#拓词的实用技巧","content":"输入种子词 `remove background`，切到 Questions Queries，挑出 10 个可以写成教程文章的问题。"},"1042":{"id":"/similarweb/keyword-generator-26","page_id":"/similarweb/keyword-generator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/keyword-generator#拓词的实用技巧","content":"换一个你感兴趣的种子词（例如 `ai headshot`），在 Phrase Match 里找出 Yearly trend 明显上升的 5 个词。"},"1043":{"id":"/similarweb/keyword-generator-27","page_id":"/similarweb/keyword-generator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/keyword-generator#拓词的实用技巧","content":"勾选这些词，加入一个新的 Keyword list，方便以后追踪。"},"1044":{"id":"/similarweb/keyword-overview","page_id":"/similarweb/keyword-overview","type":"page","content":"Similarweb 关键词概览 Keyword overview","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Similarweb 教程","SEO 关键词研究"],"tags":[],"url":"/similarweb/keyword-overview"},"1045":{"id":"/similarweb/keyword-overview-0","page_id":"/similarweb/keyword-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/keyword-overview","content":"决定做不做一个词之前的体检：搜索量、点击量、零点击、SERP 构成、自然难度、付费竞争、CPC，以及谁在拿这个词的流量。"},"1046":{"id":"/similarweb/keyword-overview-1","page_id":"/similarweb/keyword-overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/similarweb/keyword-overview#关键词体检卡片","content":"关键词体检卡片"},"1047":{"id":"/similarweb/keyword-overview-2","page_id":"/similarweb/keyword-overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/similarweb/keyword-overview#谁在拿这个词的流量top-players","content":"谁在拿这个词的流量：Top players"},"1048":{"id":"/similarweb/keyword-overview-3","page_id":"/similarweb/keyword-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/keyword-overview","content":"用 Keyword overview 给一个关键词做完整\"体检\""},"1049":{"id":"/similarweb/keyword-overview-4","page_id":"/similarweb/keyword-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/keyword-overview","content":"看懂难度、竞争、CPC 三个\"值不值得做\"的指标"},"1050":{"id":"/similarweb/keyword-overview-5","page_id":"/similarweb/keyword-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/keyword-overview","content":"用 Top players 判断这个词被谁占着"},"1051":{"id":"/similarweb/keyword-overview-6","page_id":"/similarweb/keyword-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/keyword-overview","content":"打开方式：Keyword research → Keyword explorer → Overview，输入关键词。在其他报告里点任意一个关键词的链接，也会跳到这里。"},"1052":{"id":"/similarweb/keyword-overview-7","page_id":"/similarweb/keyword-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/keyword-overview#关键词体检卡片","content":"Clicks：搜索后真正点进了某个网站的次数。"},"1053":{"id":"/similarweb/keyword-overview-8","page_id":"/similarweb/keyword-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/keyword-overview#关键词体检卡片","content":"Zero-Clicks Searches：搜索后没点任何结果的比例，环比上升了 3.28%。"},"1054":{"id":"/similarweb/keyword-overview-9","page_id":"/similarweb/keyword-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/keyword-overview#关键词体检卡片","content":"SERP composition：搜索结果页的构成。普通自然结果占比高，说明排名上去就能拿到点击；如果\"SERP features\"（图片、视频、问答框等）占比高，就要针对这些展示位优化。"},"1055":{"id":"/similarweb/keyword-overview-10","page_id":"/similarweb/keyword-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/keyword-overview#关键词体检卡片","content":"**自然难度 84（Difficult）**。Organic difficulty：做到自然搜索前排的难度，0–100。"},"1056":{"id":"/similarweb/keyword-overview-11","page_id":"/similarweb/keyword-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/keyword-overview#关键词体检卡片","content":"**付费竞争 1（Easy），几乎没人投广告**。Paid competition：投这个词搜索广告的竞争程度。"},"1057":{"id":"/similarweb/keyword-overview-12","page_id":"/similarweb/keyword-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/keyword-overview#关键词体检卡片","content":"**CPC $0.01–$4.98**。CPC range：广告点击单价区间，下方小字是估算的总投放额。"},"1058":{"id":"/similarweb/keyword-overview-13","page_id":"/similarweb/keyword-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/keyword-overview#关键词体检卡片","content":"Generate keyword list：以这个词为种子一键生成关键词清单。"},"1059":{"id":"/similarweb/keyword-overview-14","page_id":"/similarweb/keyword-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/keyword-overview#关键词体检卡片","content":"| 指标                 | 好做的信号 | 难做的信号                         |\n| ------------------ | ----- | ----------------------------- |\n| Organic difficulty | 低于 40 | 高于 70（remove background 是 84） |","table":"table-0"},"1060":{"id":"/similarweb/keyword-overview-15","page_id":"/similarweb/keyword-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/keyword-overview#关键词体检卡片","content":"| 指标  | 好做的信号           | 难做的信号         |\n| --- | --------------- | ------------- |\n| 搜索量 | 每月几千以上，且趋势稳定或上升 | 只有几十，或只是一次性尖峰 |","table":"table-0"},"1061":{"id":"/similarweb/keyword-overview-16","page_id":"/similarweb/keyword-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/keyword-overview#关键词体检卡片","content":"| 指标  | 好做的信号      | 难做的信号       |\n| --- | ---------- | ----------- |\n| CPC | 越高越说明有商业价值 | 接近 0，说明很难变现 |","table":"table-0"},"1062":{"id":"/similarweb/keyword-overview-17","page_id":"/similarweb/keyword-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/keyword-overview#关键词体检卡片","content":"remove background 搜索量巨大但难度 84，新站几乎不可能正面竞争——更现实的做法是去做它的**长尾词和多语言词**（见前两章）。"},"1063":{"id":"/similarweb/keyword-overview-18","page_id":"/similarweb/keyword-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/keyword-overview#谁在拿这个词的流量top-players","content":"左边按网站统计（Top websites），右边按具体页面统计（Top URL）。"},"1064":{"id":"/similarweb/keyword-overview-19","page_id":"/similarweb/keyword-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/keyword-overview#谁在拿这个词的流量top-players","content":"translate.google 的趋势线在最后突然拉起——搜索引擎自己的工具开始抢这个词的流量，这是需要警惕的信号。"},"1065":{"id":"/similarweb/keyword-overview-20","page_id":"/similarweb/keyword-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/keyword-overview#谁在拿这个词的流量top-players","content":"See pages / See SERP feature 查看完整的排名页面和搜索结果特性。"},"1066":{"id":"/similarweb/keyword-overview-21","page_id":"/similarweb/keyword-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/keyword-overview#谁在拿这个词的流量top-players","content":"页面再往下还有 **Intent**（搜索意图：这个词是 Navigational 导航型——大部分人搜它就是想找 remove.bg）、**Device distribution**（桌面 58% / 移动 42%）和 **Keyword ideas**（相关词推荐）。"},"1067":{"id":"/similarweb/keyword-overview-22","page_id":"/similarweb/keyword-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/keyword-overview#谁在拿这个词的流量top-players","content":"当 Top players 里第一名的点击是第二名的 7 倍以上（1.9M vs 249.7K），而且意图是 Navigational，说明用户搜这个词就是在找那个网站。这种词再大也不适合新站去抢。"},"1068":{"id":"/similarweb/keyword-overview-23","page_id":"/similarweb/keyword-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/keyword-overview#谁在拿这个词的流量top-players","content":"在 Keyword overview 里分别查 `background remove`、`video background remover`、`quitar fondo`，记录三者的 Organic difficulty 和 Top players。"},"1069":{"id":"/similarweb/keyword-overview-24","page_id":"/similarweb/keyword-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/keyword-overview#谁在拿这个词的流量top-players","content":"判断哪一个最适合新站切入，写下你的理由。"},"1070":{"id":"/similarweb/keyword-overview-25","page_id":"/similarweb/keyword-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/keyword-overview#谁在拿这个词的流量top-players","content":"把这三个词再丢进 Semrush 的 Keyword Overview 交叉验证搜索量。"},"1071":{"id":"/similarweb/keyword-research","page_id":"/similarweb/keyword-research","type":"page","content":"Similarweb 关键词研究总览 Keyword research","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Similarweb 教程","SEO 关键词研究"],"tags":[],"url":"/similarweb/keyword-research"},"1072":{"id":"/similarweb/keyword-research-0","page_id":"/similarweb/keyword-research","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/keyword-research","content":"SEO intelligence 模块里最常用的 Keyword research：两条找词路径、每个子报告是干什么的。"},"1073":{"id":"/similarweb/keyword-research-1","page_id":"/similarweb/keyword-research","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/similarweb/keyword-research#两条找词路径","content":"两条找词路径"},"1074":{"id":"/similarweb/keyword-research-2","page_id":"/similarweb/keyword-research","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/keyword-research","content":"认识 Keyword research 的菜单结构"},"1075":{"id":"/similarweb/keyword-research-3","page_id":"/similarweb/keyword-research","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/keyword-research","content":"分清\"从网站出发\"和\"从关键词出发\"两条找词路径"},"1076":{"id":"/similarweb/keyword-research-4","page_id":"/similarweb/keyword-research","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/keyword-research","content":"知道接下来几章分别解决什么问题"},"1077":{"id":"/similarweb/keyword-research-5","page_id":"/similarweb/keyword-research","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/keyword-research","content":"前面的 Website analysis 回答\"一个网站有多少流量\"；**Keyword research 回答\"这些流量来自哪些关键词\"**。它在左侧主导航的 SEO intelligence 分组里。"},"1078":{"id":"/similarweb/keyword-research-6","page_id":"/similarweb/keyword-research","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/keyword-research","content":"Keyword lists：把挑出来的词存成清单，之后可以批量追踪、对比。"},"1079":{"id":"/similarweb/keyword-research-7","page_id":"/similarweb/keyword-research","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/keyword-research","content":"**Keyword explorer**：输入一个关键词，查它的搜索量、难度、谁在排名、相关词。包括 Keyword generator（拓词）、Overview（关键词概览）、SERP players（谁在抢这个词）、Pages（排名页面）、Search ads（广告）、SERP snapshot（搜索结果快照）。"},"1080":{"id":"/similarweb/keyword-research-8","page_id":"/similarweb/keyword-research","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/keyword-research","content":"**Website explorer**：输入一个网站，看它靠哪些词拿流量。包括 SEO overview、Keyword clusters（关键词聚类）、Keywords（关键词）、Landing pages（落地页）、Search competitors（搜索竞品）、Ranking distribution（排名分布）、Search ads。"},"1081":{"id":"/similarweb/keyword-research-9","page_id":"/similarweb/keyword-research","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/keyword-research#两条找词路径","content":"| 路径    | 起点                | 适合什么时候             | 本教程章节 |\n| ----- | ----------------- | ------------------ | ----- |\n| 从网站出发 | 竞品网站（如 remove.bg） | 已经知道对手是谁，想把它的词表扒下来 | 站点关键词 |","table":"table-0"},"1082":{"id":"/similarweb/keyword-research-10","page_id":"/similarweb/keyword-research","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/keyword-research#两条找词路径","content":"| 路径         | 起点                 | 适合什么时候              | 本教程章节 |\n| ---------- | ------------------ | ------------------- | ----- |\n| 从网站出发（找新词） | 托管平台（如 vercel.app） | 想发现**最近才冒出来**的新站和新词 | 落地页   |","table":"table-0"},"1083":{"id":"/similarweb/keyword-research-11","page_id":"/similarweb/keyword-research","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/keyword-research#两条找词路径","content":"| 路径     | 起点                       | 适合什么时候          | 本教程章节 |\n| ------ | ------------------------ | --------------- | ----- |\n| 从关键词出发 | 种子词（如 remove background） | 想围绕一个需求拓展出所有相关词 | 拓词    |","table":"table-0"},"1084":{"id":"/similarweb/keyword-research-12","page_id":"/similarweb/keyword-research","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/keyword-research#两条找词路径","content":"| 路径    | 起点    | 适合什么时候                   | 本教程章节 |\n| ----- | ----- | ------------------------ | ----- |\n| 验证一个词 | 单个关键词 | 决定做不做之前，看搜索量、难度、CPC、竞争对手 | 关键词概览 |","table":"table-0"},"1085":{"id":"/similarweb/keyword-research-13","page_id":"/similarweb/keyword-research","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/keyword-research#两条找词路径","content":"用 Website explorer 扒竞品的词，或者用 Landing pages + New Clicks 找新出现的词；"},"1086":{"id":"/similarweb/keyword-research-14","page_id":"/similarweb/keyword-research","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/keyword-research#两条找词路径","content":"把感兴趣的词丢进 Keyword generator 拓展同类需求；"},"1087":{"id":"/similarweb/keyword-research-15","page_id":"/similarweb/keyword-research","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/keyword-research#两条找词路径","content":"用 Keyword overview 验证：搜索量够不够、难度高不高、有没有商业价值；"},"1088":{"id":"/similarweb/keyword-research-16","page_id":"/similarweb/keyword-research","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/keyword-research#两条找词路径","content":"最后用 Semrush 交叉验证（见 实战：验证一个新词值不值得做）。"},"1089":{"id":"/similarweb/keyword-research-17","page_id":"/similarweb/keyword-research","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/keyword-research#两条找词路径","content":"Keyword research 的报告默认是 **Last 28 days** 或单个月（例如 Landing pages 固定按月），和 Website analysis 里选的 3 个月不一样。看数字时先确认右上角的时间。"},"1090":{"id":"/similarweb/landing-pages","page_id":"/similarweb/landing-pages","type":"page","content":"Similarweb 落地页 Landing pages（New Clicks 找新词）","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Similarweb 教程","SEO 关键词研究"],"tags":[],"url":"/similarweb/landing-pages"},"1091":{"id":"/similarweb/landing-pages-0","page_id":"/similarweb/landing-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/landing-pages","content":"用 Landing pages + New Clicks，从 vercel.app 这样的托管平台里找出最近一个月才开始有搜索流量的新站和新词。"},"1092":{"id":"/similarweb/landing-pages-1","page_id":"/similarweb/landing-pages","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/similarweb/landing-pages#第-1-步打开-vercelapp-的-landing-pages","content":"第 1 步：打开 vercel.app 的 Landing pages"},"1093":{"id":"/similarweb/landing-pages-2","page_id":"/similarweb/landing-pages","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/similarweb/landing-pages#第-2-步筛选-new-clicks","content":"第 2 步：筛选 New Clicks"},"1094":{"id":"/similarweb/landing-pages-3","page_id":"/similarweb/landing-pages","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/similarweb/landing-pages#第-3-步看新冒出来的页面","content":"第 3 步：看新冒出来的页面"},"1095":{"id":"/similarweb/landing-pages-4","page_id":"/similarweb/landing-pages","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/similarweb/landing-pages#第-4-步展开-all-keywords","content":"第 4 步：展开 All keywords"},"1096":{"id":"/similarweb/landing-pages-5","page_id":"/similarweb/landing-pages","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/similarweb/landing-pages#怎么判断一个新词值不值得做","content":"怎么判断一个新词值不值得做"},"1097":{"id":"/similarweb/landing-pages-6","page_id":"/similarweb/landing-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/landing-pages","content":"看懂 Landing pages 报告：一个网站的哪些页面在吃搜索流量"},"1098":{"id":"/similarweb/landing-pages-7","page_id":"/similarweb/landing-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/landing-pages","content":"掌握找新词的经典 4 步：搜平台域名 → 进 Landing pages → 选 Organic Pages 筛 New Clicks → 展开 All keywords"},"1099":{"id":"/similarweb/landing-pages-8","page_id":"/similarweb/landing-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/landing-pages","content":"学会判断一个\"新词\"值不值得跟进"},"1100":{"id":"/similarweb/landing-pages-9","page_id":"/similarweb/landing-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/landing-pages","content":"Landing pages（落地页）报告列出一个网站**每个页面**带来的搜索点击。对普通网站，它告诉你竞品靠哪些页面拿流量；对 **vercel.app、netlify.app、github.io 这种托管平台**，每个子域名就是一个独立的小网站——它就变成了一台\"新站发现器\"。"},"1101":{"id":"/similarweb/landing-pages-10","page_id":"/similarweb/landing-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/landing-pages","content":"本章用 `vercel.app` 演示。注意这个报告**按单个月统计**，这里是 September 2026。"},"1102":{"id":"/similarweb/landing-pages-11","page_id":"/similarweb/landing-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/landing-pages#第-1-步打开-vercelapp-的-landing-pages","content":"Keyword research → Website explorer → Landing pages。"},"1103":{"id":"/similarweb/landing-pages-12","page_id":"/similarweb/landing-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/landing-pages#第-1-步打开-vercelapp-的-landing-pages","content":"点左上角域名旁的铅笔图标，输入 `vercel.app`，在下拉里选中它（类型为 Domain）。"},"1104":{"id":"/similarweb/landing-pages-13","page_id":"/similarweb/landing-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/landing-pages#第-1-步打开-vercelapp-的-landing-pages","content":"确认停留在 Organic Pages 标签。"},"1105":{"id":"/similarweb/landing-pages-14","page_id":"/similarweb/landing-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/landing-pages#第-2-步筛选-new-clicks","content":"Organic Pages 是自然搜索带来的流量；Paid Pages 是搜索广告带来的。"},"1106":{"id":"/similarweb/landing-pages-15","page_id":"/similarweb/landing-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/landing-pages#第-2-步筛选-new-clicks","content":"四个选项：**Trending**（点击在增长）、**De-trending**（在下降）、**Lost Clicks**（上个月有、这个月没了）、**New Clicks**（上个月没有、这个月**新出现**的点击）。找新站新词选 New Clicks。"},"1107":{"id":"/similarweb/landing-pages-16","page_id":"/similarweb/landing-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/landing-pages#第-2-步筛选-new-clicks","content":"Keywords 列是这个页面有排名的关键词数量。"},"1108":{"id":"/similarweb/landing-pages-17","page_id":"/similarweb/landing-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/landing-pages#第-3-步看新冒出来的页面","content":"**aethoflix.vercel.app：新增 2.06 万次点击。**排在最前面的就是本月新增点击最多的子域名。"},"1109":{"id":"/similarweb/landing-pages-18","page_id":"/similarweb/landing-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/landing-pages#第-3-步看新冒出来的页面","content":"Change 列全部是 New。"},"1110":{"id":"/similarweb/landing-pages-19","page_id":"/similarweb/landing-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/landing-pages#第-3-步看新冒出来的页面","content":"Clicks trend 的小折线前面一直贴着底部、最后突然拉起来，就是典型的新站曲线。"},"1111":{"id":"/similarweb/landing-pages-20","page_id":"/similarweb/landing-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/landing-pages#第-3-步看新冒出来的页面","content":"列表里能看到各种新站：streaming 类（aethoflix）、学生系统（kundalik-dun、srm student portal）、游戏（taipei-gta）、工具（human-atlas、sodapeak）……每一个都对应着一个**刚刚被搜索引擎收录、已经开始有人搜**的需求。"},"1112":{"id":"/similarweb/landing-pages-21","page_id":"/similarweb/landing-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/landing-pages#第-4-步展开-all-keywords","content":"表格往右滚动，每一行都有 All keywords 按钮和 Top keyword（主要关键词）："},"1113":{"id":"/similarweb/landing-pages-22","page_id":"/similarweb/landing-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/landing-pages#第-4-步展开-all-keywords","content":"Top keyword 一眼就能看出这个新站是靠什么词起来的：aethoflix、emaktab、human atlas vercel、sodapeak……"},"1114":{"id":"/similarweb/landing-pages-23","page_id":"/similarweb/landing-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/landing-pages#第-4-步展开-all-keywords","content":"关键词数量：7、15、3、53……数量多的页面说明它覆盖了一组相关需求，更值得研究。"},"1115":{"id":"/similarweb/landing-pages-24","page_id":"/similarweb/landing-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/landing-pages#第-4-步展开-all-keywords","content":"还有 aethoflix vercel、aesthoflix 等拼写变体。变体多，往往说明这是一个**用户口口相传、记不准名字**的新品牌。"},"1116":{"id":"/similarweb/landing-pages-25","page_id":"/similarweb/landing-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/landing-pages#第-4-步展开-all-keywords","content":"See full view 打开这个页面的完整关键词报告；旁边的图标可以导出 Excel。"},"1117":{"id":"/similarweb/landing-pages-26","page_id":"/similarweb/landing-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/landing-pages#怎么判断一个新词值不值得做","content":"拿到一批新词后，按下面的顺序筛："},"1118":{"id":"/similarweb/landing-pages-27","page_id":"/similarweb/landing-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/landing-pages#怎么判断一个新词值不值得做","content":"| 检查项    | 怎么看                           | 淘汰信号                      |\n| ------ | ----------------------------- | ------------------------- |\n| 是不是品牌词 | 词本身是不是某个网站 / 产品名（如 aethoflix） | 纯品牌词你抢不到，除非做\"替代品 / 评测\"类内容 |","table":"table-0"},"1119":{"id":"/similarweb/landing-pages-28","page_id":"/similarweb/landing-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/landing-pages#怎么判断一个新词值不值得做","content":"| 检查项   | 怎么看                     | 淘汰信号            |\n| ----- | ----------------------- | --------------- |\n| 背后的需求 | Top keyword + 页面本身是做什么的 | 侵权、成人、灰产类需求直接放弃 |","table":"table-0"},"1120":{"id":"/similarweb/landing-pages-29","page_id":"/similarweb/landing-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/landing-pages#怎么判断一个新词值不值得做","content":"| 检查项 | 怎么看                              | 淘汰信号            |\n| --- | -------------------------------- | --------------- |\n| 搜索量 | 展开后的 Volume，或丢进 Keyword overview | 太小（每月几十次）不值得单独做 |","table":"table-0"},"1121":{"id":"/similarweb/landing-pages-30","page_id":"/similarweb/landing-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/landing-pages#怎么判断一个新词值不值得做","content":"| 检查项 | 怎么看                       | 淘汰信号            |\n| --- | ------------------------- | --------------- |\n| 趋势  | Clicks trend 是持续上升还是一次性尖峰 | 只有一个尖峰的，多半是短暂热点 |","table":"table-0"},"1122":{"id":"/similarweb/landing-pages-31","page_id":"/similarweb/landing-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/landing-pages#怎么判断一个新词值不值得做","content":"| 检查项 | 怎么看                                  | 淘汰信号            |\n| --- | ------------------------------------ | --------------- |\n| 竞争  | Keyword overview 里的 KD 和 Top players | 前几名都是大站，新站很难挤进去 |","table":"table-0"},"1123":{"id":"/similarweb/landing-pages-32","page_id":"/similarweb/landing-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/landing-pages#怎么判断一个新词值不值得做","content":"独立开发者做新工具，第一版通常直接部署在 vercel.app、netlify.app 这类免费平台上，还没来得及买域名。所以**一个需求刚被验证有搜索量时，最先出现的往往就是这些子域名**。定期（比如每月一次）用 New Clicks 扫一遍，就能比大多数人更早发现新需求。同样的方法还可以用在 `netlify.app`、`pages.dev`、`github.io`、`streamlit.app`、`hf.space` 等平台上。"},"1124":{"id":"/similarweb/landing-pages-33","page_id":"/similarweb/landing-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/landing-pages#怎么判断一个新词值不值得做","content":"New Clicks 是\"上个月没有点击、这个月有\"，并不等于\"网站刚上线\"——也可能是老页面这个月第一次排上了搜索结果。判断新站时，结合 Website analysis 里该子域名的流量历史一起看。"},"1125":{"id":"/similarweb/landing-pages-34","page_id":"/similarweb/landing-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/landing-pages#怎么判断一个新词值不值得做","content":"按本章 4 步，在 vercel.app 的 Landing pages 里筛出 New Clicks，记录前 20 个页面的 Top keyword。"},"1126":{"id":"/similarweb/landing-pages-35","page_id":"/similarweb/landing-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/landing-pages#怎么判断一个新词值不值得做","content":"从中挑 3 个你看得懂需求的词，丢进 关键词概览 查搜索量和难度。"},"1127":{"id":"/similarweb/landing-pages-36","page_id":"/similarweb/landing-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/landing-pages#怎么判断一个新词值不值得做","content":"换成 `netlify.app` 再做一遍，看看两个平台上冒出来的新需求有什么不同。"},"1128":{"id":"/similarweb/marketing-channels","page_id":"/similarweb/marketing-channels","type":"page","content":"Similarweb 营销渠道 Marketing channels","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Similarweb 教程","网站分析 Website analysis"],"tags":[],"url":"/similarweb/marketing-channels"},"1129":{"id":"/similarweb/marketing-channels-0","page_id":"/similarweb/marketing-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/marketing-channels","content":"一个网站的流量靠什么渠道获得？哪个渠道在拉动增长？具体是哪些来源网站带来的？"},"1130":{"id":"/similarweb/marketing-channels-1","page_id":"/similarweb/marketing-channels","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/similarweb/marketing-channels#渠道占比","content":"渠道占比"},"1131":{"id":"/similarweb/marketing-channels-2","page_id":"/similarweb/marketing-channels","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/similarweb/marketing-channels#用渠道结构判断增长引擎","content":"用渠道结构判断\"增长引擎\""},"1132":{"id":"/similarweb/marketing-channels-3","page_id":"/similarweb/marketing-channels","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/similarweb/marketing-channels#哪个渠道在拉动增长pop-对比表","content":"哪个渠道在拉动增长：PoP 对比表"},"1133":{"id":"/similarweb/marketing-channels-4","page_id":"/similarweb/marketing-channels","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/similarweb/marketing-channels#渠道趋势channel-traffic","content":"渠道趋势：Channel traffic"},"1134":{"id":"/similarweb/marketing-channels-5","page_id":"/similarweb/marketing-channels","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/similarweb/marketing-channels#流量来源明细traffic-sources","content":"流量来源明细：Traffic sources"},"1135":{"id":"/similarweb/marketing-channels-6","page_id":"/similarweb/marketing-channels","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/similarweb/marketing-channels#本章小结","content":"本章小结"},"1136":{"id":"/similarweb/marketing-channels-7","page_id":"/similarweb/marketing-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/marketing-channels","content":"看懂 10 个营销渠道的占比，判断网站的\"增长引擎\""},"1137":{"id":"/similarweb/marketing-channels-8","page_id":"/similarweb/marketing-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/marketing-channels","content":"用 PoP 对比表找出**哪个渠道在拉动（或拖累）增长**，并和竞品对比"},"1138":{"id":"/similarweb/marketing-channels-9","page_id":"/similarweb/marketing-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/marketing-channels","content":"在 Traffic sources 明细里找到具体的来源：哪个搜索引擎、哪个社交平台、哪个 AI 产品"},"1139":{"id":"/similarweb/marketing-channels-10","page_id":"/similarweb/marketing-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/marketing-channels","content":"打开方式：二级菜单 Traffic → Marketing channels。"},"1140":{"id":"/similarweb/marketing-channels-11","page_id":"/similarweb/marketing-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/marketing-channels#渠道占比","content":"默认显示每个渠道占总流量的百分比，切到 # 显示具体访问次数。"},"1141":{"id":"/similarweb/marketing-channels-12","page_id":"/similarweb/marketing-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/marketing-channels#渠道占比","content":"Benchmark to an industry：选一个行业后，每根柱子旁会出现行业平均水平，一眼看出这个网站哪个渠道比同行强、哪个弱。"},"1142":{"id":"/similarweb/marketing-channels-13","page_id":"/similarweb/marketing-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/marketing-channels#渠道占比","content":"直接访问 37.13%，第二大来源。"},"1143":{"id":"/similarweb/marketing-channels-14","page_id":"/similarweb/marketing-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/marketing-channels#用渠道结构判断增长引擎","content":"| 渠道结构特征              | 说明什么              | 你可以怎么做               |\n| ------------------- | ----------------- | -------------------- |\n| Organic Search 占比最高 | 靠 SEO 获客，流量稳定、成本低 | 去 Search 和关键词研究里扒它的词 |","table":"table-0"},"1144":{"id":"/similarweb/marketing-channels-15","page_id":"/similarweb/marketing-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/marketing-channels#用渠道结构判断增长引擎","content":"| 渠道结构特征      | 说明什么                    | 你可以怎么做           |\n| ----------- | ----------------------- | ---------------- |\n| Direct 占比很高 | 品牌强、回访多，或者大量来自 App / 书签 | 新站很难复制，重点看它的拉新渠道 |","table":"table-0"},"1145":{"id":"/similarweb/marketing-channels-16","page_id":"/similarweb/marketing-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/marketing-channels#用渠道结构判断增长引擎","content":"| 渠道结构特征                    | 说明什么        | 你可以怎么做                          |\n| ------------------------- | ----------- | ------------------------------- |\n| Paid Search / Display 占比高 | 靠买量增长，停投就会掉 | 看它投哪些词、哪些媒体（Ad intelligence 模块） |","table":"table-0"},"1146":{"id":"/similarweb/marketing-channels-17","page_id":"/similarweb/marketing-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/marketing-channels#用渠道结构判断增长引擎","content":"| 渠道结构特征     | 说明什么       | 你可以怎么做            |\n| ---------- | ---------- | ----------------- |\n| Social 占比高 | 靠内容传播或网红带货 | 看是哪个平台，去平台上研究它的内容 |","table":"table-0"},"1147":{"id":"/similarweb/marketing-channels-18","page_id":"/similarweb/marketing-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/marketing-channels#用渠道结构判断增长引擎","content":"| 渠道结构特征        | 说明什么             | 你可以怎么做      |\n| ------------- | ---------------- | ----------- |\n| Referrals 占比高 | 被大量网站推荐，或做了联盟、合作 | 在引荐报告里找合作机会 |","table":"table-0"},"1148":{"id":"/similarweb/marketing-channels-19","page_id":"/similarweb/marketing-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/marketing-channels#用渠道结构判断增长引擎","content":"| 渠道结构特征       | 说明什么         | 你可以怎么做                |\n| ------------ | ------------ | --------------------- |\n| Gen AI 有可观占比 | AI 产品在回答里推荐它 | 研究它在 AI 回答里的曝光（AI 模块） |","table":"table-0"},"1149":{"id":"/similarweb/marketing-channels-20","page_id":"/similarweb/marketing-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/marketing-channels#用渠道结构判断增长引擎","content":"remove.bg 是典型的\"SEO + 品牌\"型：55% 自然搜索加 37% 直接访问，几乎不花钱买量。"},"1150":{"id":"/similarweb/marketing-channels-21","page_id":"/similarweb/marketing-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/marketing-channels#哪个渠道在拉动增长pop-对比表","content":"往下是两张热力表，比较的是 **Jun–Aug 2026 和 Jul–Sep 2026 两个周期**。三列分别是 remove.bg 和系统自动选的两个竞品，表头只显示网站图标：紫色 R 是 photoroom.com，橙色 P 是 pixelcut.ai（在「受众画像」的 Audience Overlap 里能看到对应关系）。"},"1151":{"id":"/similarweb/marketing-channels-22","page_id":"/similarweb/marketing-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/marketing-channels#哪个渠道在拉动增长pop-对比表","content":"对比的两个周期：Jun–Aug 2026 vs. Jul–Sep 2026。"},"1152":{"id":"/similarweb/marketing-channels-23","page_id":"/similarweb/marketing-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/marketing-channels#哪个渠道在拉动增长pop-对比表","content":"左表 Within each competitor：同一个网站内部，哪个渠道贡献的增减最多。颜色越深，影响越大。"},"1153":{"id":"/similarweb/marketing-channels-24","page_id":"/similarweb/marketing-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/marketing-channels#哪个渠道在拉动增长pop-对比表","content":"下滑主要来自直接访问（-200 万）和自然搜索（-170 万）。"},"1154":{"id":"/similarweb/marketing-channels-25","page_id":"/similarweb/marketing-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/marketing-channels#哪个渠道在拉动增长pop-对比表","content":"绿色表示增长：photoroom.com 的付费搜索增加了 9.54 万次访问（右表显示是 +10%），说明它在加大搜索广告投放。"},"1155":{"id":"/similarweb/marketing-channels-26","page_id":"/similarweb/marketing-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/marketing-channels#哪个渠道在拉动增长pop-对比表","content":"右表 Across competitors：横向比较几个网站同一渠道的增速，适合找\"谁在哪个渠道发力\"。"},"1156":{"id":"/similarweb/marketing-channels-27","page_id":"/similarweb/marketing-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/marketing-channels#哪个渠道在拉动增长pop-对比表","content":"点 Compare 可以把对比对象换成你关心的竞品。"},"1157":{"id":"/similarweb/marketing-channels-28","page_id":"/similarweb/marketing-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/marketing-channels#哪个渠道在拉动增长pop-对比表","content":"先看 **Total change** 这一行确定整体是涨是跌，再往下找颜色最深的格子。remove.bg 少掉的 400 万次访问里，直接访问 -200 万、自然搜索 -170 万，两者加起来占了九成——问题不在某个小渠道，而是核心流量在走弱。"},"1158":{"id":"/similarweb/marketing-channels-29","page_id":"/similarweb/marketing-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/marketing-channels#渠道趋势channel-traffic","content":"打开后会把当前月份已经过去的天数也画出来，所以最后一段是虚线，而且会明显变低（不完整的一周）。看趋势时别把它当成\"暴跌\"。"},"1159":{"id":"/similarweb/marketing-channels-30","page_id":"/similarweb/marketing-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/marketing-channels#渠道趋势channel-traffic","content":"右侧图例列出每个渠道在这段时间的访问总量，奖杯图标标出最大的渠道。取消勾选可以隐藏某条线。"},"1160":{"id":"/similarweb/marketing-channels-31","page_id":"/similarweb/marketing-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/marketing-channels#流量来源明细traffic-sources","content":"渠道只是大类。想知道\"自然搜索具体来自哪个搜索引擎\"\"社交具体是哪个平台\"，看页面底部的 Traffic sources："},"1161":{"id":"/similarweb/marketing-channels-32","page_id":"/similarweb/marketing-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/marketing-channels#流量来源明细traffic-sources","content":"All sources 下拉可以只看某一类，例如只看 Gen AI，或只看 Referrals。"},"1162":{"id":"/similarweb/marketing-channels-33","page_id":"/similarweb/marketing-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/marketing-channels#流量来源明细traffic-sources","content":"输入网站名搜索某个来源，例如 `reddit`。"},"1163":{"id":"/similarweb/marketing-channels-34","page_id":"/similarweb/marketing-channels","tags":[],"ty