rch-overview-23","page_id":"/similarweb/search-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/search-overview#付费落地页top-paid-landing-pages","content":"**Top / Trending / New 三个视图。**\nTrending 看点击增长最快的页面，New 看新出现的投放页面——竞品刚开始测试的新方向常常藏在这里。"},"1234":{"id":"/similarweb/search-overview-24","page_id":"/similarweb/search-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/search-overview#付费落地页top-paid-landing-pages","content":"首页拿了 67.86% 的付费点击，投放词是 \"bg remove\" 等 12 个词，月花费约 $1.2K。"},"1235":{"id":"/similarweb/search-overview-25","page_id":"/similarweb/search-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/search-overview#付费落地页top-paid-landing-pages","content":"`/id`（印尼语）、`/es`（西班牙语）、`/fr`（法语）、`/pt-br`（巴西葡语）分别投放当地语言的关键词。"},"1236":{"id":"/similarweb/search-overview-26","page_id":"/similarweb/search-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/search-overview#付费落地页top-paid-landing-pages","content":"penghilang background png（印尼语）、eliminar fondo（西语）、retirer fond image（法语）、remover fundo（葡语）。"},"1237":{"id":"/similarweb/search-overview-27","page_id":"/similarweb/search-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/search-overview#付费落地页top-paid-landing-pages","content":"remove.bg 的广告花费很少，但它的付费落地页已经暴露了它的打法：**每个主要市场一个本地语言页面，投当地语言的\"去背景\"关键词**。结合上一节的非品牌热词，你可以得到一份\"哪个语言、哪个关键词值得做\"的清单。"},"1238":{"id":"/similarweb/search-overview-28","page_id":"/similarweb/search-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/search-overview#本章小结","content":"先看 6 张卡片：搜索流量占比、关键词数量、前三名占比、广告花费。"},"1239":{"id":"/similarweb/search-overview-29","page_id":"/similarweb/search-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/search-overview#本章小结","content":"再看非品牌热词：找到新站能抢的词，注意区分同比和环比。"},"1240":{"id":"/similarweb/search-overview-30","page_id":"/similarweb/search-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/search-overview#本章小结","content":"最后看付费落地页：竞品愿意花钱的页面和关键词，通常就是最有商业价值的方向。"},"1241":{"id":"/similarweb/search-overview-31","page_id":"/similarweb/search-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/search-overview#本章小结","content":"在 Top non-branded keywords 里切到 Paid，看看 remove.bg 投放的非品牌词有哪些。"},"1242":{"id":"/similarweb/search-overview-32","page_id":"/similarweb/search-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/search-overview#本章小结","content":"在 Top paid landing pages 里切到 New，记录最近新出现的投放页面。"},"1243":{"id":"/similarweb/search-overview-33","page_id":"/similarweb/search-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/search-overview#本章小结","content":"打开 photoroom.com 的 Search overview，比较它和 remove.bg 的 PPC spend，判断谁更依赖买量。"},"1244":{"id":"/similarweb/similar-sites","page_id":"/similarweb/similar-sites","type":"page","content":"Similarweb 相似网站 Similar sites","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Similarweb 教程","网站分析 Website analysis"],"tags":[],"url":"/similarweb/similar-sites"},"1245":{"id":"/similarweb/similar-sites-0","page_id":"/similarweb/similar-sites","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/similar-sites","content":"一键列出和目标网站最像的 40 个网站，是找竞品、找替代品、摸清赛道格局的第一步。"},"1246":{"id":"/similarweb/similar-sites-1","page_id":"/similarweb/similar-sites","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/similarweb/similar-sites#怎么用这张表","content":"怎么用这张表"},"1247":{"id":"/similarweb/similar-sites-2","page_id":"/similarweb/similar-sites","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/similar-sites","content":"用 Similar sites 快速列出一个赛道里的主要玩家"},"1248":{"id":"/similarweb/similar-sites-3","page_id":"/similarweb/similar-sites","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/similar-sites","content":"看懂 Affinity（相似度）和它的局限"},"1249":{"id":"/similarweb/similar-sites-4","page_id":"/similarweb/similar-sites","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/similar-sites","content":"学会从相似网站列表里筛出真正的竞品和\"跨界\"对手"},"1250":{"id":"/similarweb/similar-sites-5","page_id":"/similarweb/similar-sites","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/similar-sites","content":"打开方式：二级菜单 Overview → Similar sites。"},"1251":{"id":"/similarweb/similar-sites-6","page_id":"/similarweb/similar-sites","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/similar-sites","content":"这个报告不受顶部时间范围影响（日期控件是灰色的），反映的是 Similarweb 综合流量、受众和内容算出来的\"长期相似度\"。"},"1252":{"id":"/similarweb/similar-sites-7","page_id":"/similarweb/similar-sites","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/similar-sites","content":"只看某个行业的相似网站，例如只看 Computers Electronics and Technology。"},"1253":{"id":"/similarweb/similar-sites-8","page_id":"/similarweb/similar-sites","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/similar-sites","content":"导出 Excel，方便批量查流量。"},"1254":{"id":"/similarweb/similar-sites-9","page_id":"/similarweb/similar-sites","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/similar-sites","content":"**相似度（越高越像）。**\nAffinity 是 0–100% 的相似度得分。注意它不是\"重合了多少用户\"，而是综合受众、内容、流量来源的相似程度。"},"1255":{"id":"/similarweb/similar-sites-10","page_id":"/similarweb/similar-sites","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/similar-sites","content":"photoroom.com、pixelcut.ai、iloveimg.com：功能高度重叠的图片编辑 / 抠图工具。"},"1256":{"id":"/similarweb/similar-sites-11","page_id":"/similarweb/similar-sites","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/similar-sites","content":"slazzer.com、erase.bg、removal.ai、clippingmagic.com：专门做\"去背景\"的工具，规模比 remove.bg 小得多。"},"1257":{"id":"/similarweb/similar-sites-12","page_id":"/similarweb/similar-sites","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/similar-sites","content":"canva.com（全球排名 #32）、adobe.com（#78）：不是专门做抠图，但抠图是它们的一个功能，抢的是同一批用户。"},"1258":{"id":"/similarweb/similar-sites-13","page_id":"/similarweb/similar-sites","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/similar-sites","content":"注意行业分类：erase.bg 被分到了\"游戏\"类，说明 Similarweb 的行业标签并不总是准确。"},"1259":{"id":"/similarweb/similar-sites-14","page_id":"/similarweb/similar-sites","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/similar-sites#怎么用这张表","content":"**先按 Affinity 看前 10~15 个**：这是 Similarweb 认为最像的网站，通常包括直接竞品、同类小站和平台型对手。"},"1260":{"id":"/similarweb/similar-sites-15","page_id":"/similarweb/similar-sites","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/similar-sites#怎么用这张表","content":"**再看 Global rank 分层**：排名在几千名以内的是头部玩家（photoroom #3,348、iloveimg #1,318），几万到几十万名的是小站（slazzer #87,406、bgeraser #259,710）。小站往往更值得研究——它们的打法新站更容易复制。"},"1261":{"id":"/similarweb/similar-sites-16","page_id":"/similarweb/similar-sites","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/similar-sites#怎么用这张表","content":"**把候选竞品加入对比**：挑 2~4 个，用顶部的 Add website to compare 和 remove.bg 做同屏对比（见「网站对比」一章）。"},"1262":{"id":"/similarweb/similar-sites-17","page_id":"/similarweb/similar-sites","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/similar-sites#怎么用这张表","content":"Similar sites 是\"Similarweb 觉得像\"，受众画像里的 Audience Interests 是\"访客实际还去哪\"。两张表都出现的网站（比如 photoroom、iloveimg、canva），才是最确定的竞品。"},"1263":{"id":"/similarweb/similar-sites-18","page_id":"/similarweb/similar-sites","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/similar-sites#怎么用这张表","content":"在 Similar sites 里找出排名在 #10,000 到 #100,000 之间的\"去背景\"工具，记下它们的域名。"},"1264":{"id":"/similarweb/similar-sites-19","page_id":"/similarweb/similar-sites","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/similar-sites#怎么用这张表","content":"分别打开它们的 Website performance，比较谁的自然搜索占比最高。"},"1265":{"id":"/similarweb/similar-sites-20","page_id":"/similarweb/similar-sites","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/similar-sites#怎么用这张表","content":"想一想：如果你要做一个新的抠图工具，最该学习哪一个？为什么？"},"1266":{"id":"/similarweb/social","page_id":"/similarweb/social","type":"page","content":"Similarweb 社交流量 Social","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Similarweb 教程","网站分析 Website analysis"],"tags":[],"url":"/similarweb/social"},"1267":{"id":"/similarweb/social-0","page_id":"/similarweb/social","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/social","content":"网站从哪些社交平台获得访问、各平台占比多少、趋势如何。判断一个产品\"靠内容传播\"还是\"靠搜索\"。"},"1268":{"id":"/similarweb/social-1","page_id":"/similarweb/social","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/similarweb/social#怎么用社交数据","content":"怎么用社交数据"},"1269":{"id":"/similarweb/social-2","page_id":"/similarweb/social","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/social","content":"看懂 Social 报告：社交访问总量、平台分布、趋势"},"1270":{"id":"/similarweb/social-3","page_id":"/similarweb/social","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/social","content":"判断哪个平台是竞品的内容主阵地，去对应平台研究它的打法"},"1271":{"id":"/similarweb/social-4","page_id":"/similarweb/social","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/social","content":"打开方式：二级菜单点 Social。"},"1272":{"id":"/similarweb/social-5","page_id":"/similarweb/social","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/social","content":"占总流量的 3.66%。"},"1273":{"id":"/similarweb/social-6","page_id":"/similarweb/social","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/social","content":"WhatsApp Webapp 占 20.13%：多半是用户在 WhatsApp 网页版里互相分享 remove.bg 的链接——在印度、印尼、巴西这些 WhatsApp 普及的市场，这是很常见的传播方式。"},"1274":{"id":"/similarweb/social-7","page_id":"/similarweb/social","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/social","content":"把这张图表分享或导出。"},"1275":{"id":"/similarweb/social-8","page_id":"/similarweb/social","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/social","content":"Social traffic over time：社交流量没有像搜索流量那样明显下滑。"},"1276":{"id":"/similarweb/social-9","page_id":"/similarweb/social","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/social#怎么用社交数据","content":"| 你看到的        | 说明             | 下一步                             |\n| ----------- | -------------- | ------------------------------- |\n| YouTube 占比高 | 有大量教程、测评视频在推荐它 | 去 YouTube 搜产品名，看哪些视频带来流量、用户在问什么 |","table":"table-0"},"1277":{"id":"/similarweb/social-10","page_id":"/similarweb/social","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/social#怎么用社交数据","content":"| 你看到的                    | 说明              | 下一步                |\n| ----------------------- | --------------- | ------------------ |\n| Facebook / WhatsApp 占比高 | 用户在私域里分享，新兴市场常见 | 做适合分享的结果页（带水印、带链接） |","table":"table-0"},"1278":{"id":"/similarweb/social-11","page_id":"/similarweb/social","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/social#怎么用社交数据","content":"| 你看到的       | 说明     | 下一步                     |\n| ---------- | ------ | ----------------------- |\n| Reddit 占比高 | 社区讨论驱动 | 去相关 subreddit 看用户怎么评价竞品 |","table":"table-0"},"1279":{"id":"/similarweb/social-12","page_id":"/similarweb/social","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/social#怎么用社交数据","content":"| 你看到的          | 说明        | 下一步          |\n| ------------- | --------- | ------------ |\n| Pinterest 占比高 | 视觉内容、素材需求 | 做图片模板、素材类落地页 |","table":"table-0"},"1280":{"id":"/similarweb/social-13","page_id":"/similarweb/social","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/social#怎么用社交数据","content":"Social 统计的是**从社交平台点进网站的访问**，不是粉丝数，也不是帖子曝光。remove.bg 自己未必在运营 WhatsApp，这些流量是用户自发分享产生的。"},"1281":{"id":"/similarweb/social-14","page_id":"/similarweb/social","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/social#怎么用社交数据","content":"页面下方还有按来源列出的明细表（All sources 筛选），可以看到具体是哪些社交平台、占比和变化。"},"1282":{"id":"/similarweb/social-15","page_id":"/similarweb/social","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/social#怎么用社交数据","content":"打开 remove.bg 的 Social 报告，记下前三个社交平台。"},"1283":{"id":"/similarweb/social-16","page_id":"/similarweb/social","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/social#怎么用社交数据","content":"去 YouTube 搜索 \"remove.bg\"，看看排名靠前的视频是什么类型的内容。"},"1284":{"id":"/similarweb/social-17","page_id":"/similarweb/social","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/social#怎么用社交数据","content":"对比 photoroom.com 的 Social 报告：它更依赖哪个平台？这和它的目标用户（电商卖家）有什么关系？"},"1285":{"id":"/similarweb/technologies","page_id":"/similarweb/technologies","type":"page","content":"Similarweb 网站技术栈 Website technologies","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Similarweb 教程","网站分析 Website analysis"],"tags":[],"url":"/similarweb/technologies"},"1286":{"id":"/similarweb/technologies-0","page_id":"/similarweb/technologies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/technologies","content":"竞品网站装了哪些广告像素、分析工具、A/B 测试、客服系统，以及它们是什么时候装上的。"},"1287":{"id":"/similarweb/technologies-1","page_id":"/similarweb/technologies","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/similarweb/technologies#从技术栈能推断什么","content":"从技术栈能推断什么"},"1288":{"id":"/similarweb/technologies-2","page_id":"/similarweb/technologies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/technologies","content":"看懂 Website technologies 的技术清单和\"使用时长\""},"1289":{"id":"/similarweb/technologies-3","page_id":"/similarweb/technologies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/technologies","content":"从技术栈推断竞品的**投放渠道、增长手段和运营重点**"},"1290":{"id":"/similarweb/technologies-4","page_id":"/similarweb/technologies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/technologies","content":"打开方式：二级菜单点 Website technologies。这个报告不受时间范围影响。"},"1291":{"id":"/similarweb/technologies-5","page_id":"/similarweb/technologies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/technologies","content":"Installed and Removed 下拉可以只看\"已移除\"的技术——竞品换掉了什么工具，往往说明它的策略变了。"},"1292":{"id":"/similarweb/technologies-6","page_id":"/similarweb/technologies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/technologies","content":"Facebook Advertiser、LinkedIn Advertiser、DoubleClick、Facebook Custom Audiences：说明它在这些平台投广告，并对访客做再营销。"},"1293":{"id":"/similarweb/technologies-7","page_id":"/similarweb/technologies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/technologies","content":"内容管理系统显示为 Canva，和\"被 Canva 收购\"对得上。"},"1294":{"id":"/similarweb/technologies-8","page_id":"/similarweb/technologies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/technologies","content":"Optimizely（A/B 测试，用了约 1 年）、Google Analytics、Hotjar（热力图）：重视转化优化。"},"1295":{"id":"/similarweb/technologies-9","page_id":"/similarweb/technologies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/technologies","content":"Working period 和 First seen date：技术从什么时候开始被检测到。新装上的工具（比如只用了几个月的 A/B 测试工具）通常对应着新的增长动作。"},"1296":{"id":"/similarweb/technologies-10","page_id":"/similarweb/technologies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/technologies#从技术栈能推断什么","content":"| 检测到的技术                             | 推断                   |\n| ---------------------------------- | -------------------- |\n| 各平台广告像素（Facebook、LinkedIn、TikTok…） | 在这些平台投广告，或至少在积累再营销人群 |","table":"table-0"},"1297":{"id":"/similarweb/technologies-11","page_id":"/similarweb/technologies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/technologies#从技术栈能推断什么","content":"| 检测到的技术                 | 推断            |\n| ---------------------- | ------------- |\n| A/B 测试工具（Optimizely 等） | 在持续优化落地页和付费转化 |","table":"table-0"},"1298":{"id":"/similarweb/technologies-12","page_id":"/similarweb/technologies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/technologies#从技术栈能推断什么","content":"| 检测到的技术             | 推断          |\n| ------------------ | ----------- |\n| 热力图 / 录屏（Hotjar 等） | 重视用户体验和转化漏斗 |","table":"table-0"},"1299":{"id":"/similarweb/technologies-13","page_id":"/similarweb/technologies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/technologies#从技术栈能推断什么","content":"| 检测到的技术             | 推断               |\n| ------------------ | ---------------- |\n| 客服 / 工单（Zendesk 等） | 有付费用户需要支持，可能是订阅制 |","table":"table-0"},"1300":{"id":"/similarweb/technologies-14","page_id":"/similarweb/technologies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/technologies#从技术栈能推断什么","content":"| 检测到的技术                | 推断    |\n| --------------------- | ----- |\n| 支付工具（Stripe、Paddle 等） | 有在线收费 |","table":"table-0"},"1301":{"id":"/similarweb/technologies-15","page_id":"/similarweb/technologies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/technologies#从技术栈能推断什么","content":"| 检测到的技术          | 推断      |\n| --------------- | ------- |\n| 广告联盟（AdSense 等） | 靠展示广告变现 |","table":"table-0"},"1302":{"id":"/similarweb/technologies-16","page_id":"/similarweb/technologies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/technologies#从技术栈能推断什么","content":"Similarweb 通过扫描网页代码识别技术，服务端工具、App 内 SDK 都看不到；也可能把已经停用但代码还在的工具算作 Installed。把它当作线索，而不是完整清单。"},"1303":{"id":"/similarweb/technologies-17","page_id":"/similarweb/technologies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/technologies#从技术栈能推断什么","content":"在 Website technologies 里把状态切到 Removed，看看 remove.bg 停用过哪些工具。"},"1304":{"id":"/similarweb/technologies-18","page_id":"/similarweb/technologies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/technologies#从技术栈能推断什么","content":"打开 photoroom.com 的技术栈，比较两家在广告像素上的差异：谁在更多平台投放？"},"1305":{"id":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement","page_id":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement","type":"page","content":"Similarweb 流量与互动 Traffic & engagement","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Similarweb 教程","网站分析 Website analysis"],"tags":[],"url":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement"},"1306":{"id":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement-0","page_id":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement","content":"逐月看访问量、独立访客、新老访客和去重受众，再看访问时长、浏览页数、跳出率，并区分桌面端和移动端。"},"1307":{"id":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement-1","page_id":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement#报告顶部","content":"报告顶部"},"1308":{"id":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement-2","page_id":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement#访问量的四种口径","content":"访问量的四种口径"},"1309":{"id":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement-3","page_id":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement#互动质量时长页数跳出率","content":"互动质量：时长、页数、跳出率"},"1310":{"id":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement-4","page_id":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement#本章小结","content":"本章小结"},"1311":{"id":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement-5","page_id":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement","content":"用 Traffic & engagement 报告看一个网站流量的**逐月走势**"},"1312":{"id":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement-6","page_id":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement","content":"分清访问次数、独立访客、去重受众三种\"量\"的口径"},"1313":{"id":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement-7","page_id":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement","content":"用 Engaged visits only、桌面/移动拆分，判断流量**质量**"},"1314":{"id":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement-8","page_id":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement","content":"上一章的网站概览只给了汇总数字。想知道\"这些数字是怎么变过来的\"，就要进 Traffic & engagement（流量与互动）报告。"},"1315":{"id":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement-9","page_id":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement","content":"打开方式：二级菜单 Traffic → Traffic & engagement。本章仍以 remove.bg、Jul–Sep 2026 为例。"},"1316":{"id":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement-10","page_id":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement#报告顶部","content":"标题旁的学士帽图标是官方教程入口，看不懂某个报告时可以点开。"},"1317":{"id":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement-11","page_id":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement#报告顶部","content":"PoP = Period over Period（周期对比）。打开后，指标和图表会和\"之前的同长度周期\"做对比，旁边的下拉箭头用来选择对比口径。"},"1318":{"id":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement-12","page_id":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement#报告顶部","content":"和网站概览里的 Total visits 是同一个数。卡片右上角的 + 可以把这张卡片加到自己的看板（Dashboards）。"},"1319":{"id":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement-13","page_id":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement#报告顶部","content":"Connect your website：网站主可以连接自己的 Google Analytics，让 Similarweb 显示经过验证的真实数据。分析别人的网站时用不到。"},"1320":{"id":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement-14","page_id":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement#报告顶部","content":"下面详细讲。"},"1321":{"id":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement-15","page_id":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement#报告顶部","content":"Month-to-date：把当月已经过去的天数也算进来，看\"这个月到目前为止\"的数据。默认只统计完整月份。"},"1322":{"id":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement-16","page_id":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement#报告顶部","content":"导出 Excel。"},"1323":{"id":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement-17","page_id":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement#访问量的四种口径","content":"工具栏下面是四个可以切换的指标标签，点哪个，下面的图就画哪个："},"1324":{"id":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement-18","page_id":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement#访问量的四种口径","content":"**Monthly Visits**：每月访问次数的平均值，5862 万。一次访问 = 一次会话，用户停止操作超过 30 分钟就算一次新的访问。"},"1325":{"id":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement-19","page_id":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement#访问量的四种口径","content":"**Unique Visitors**：每月有多少台设备访问过，2234 万。同一个人用电脑和手机各访问一次，算 2 个独立访客。"},"1326":{"id":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement-20","page_id":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement#访问量的四种口径","content":"**New vs. Returning Visitors**：新访客占比高，说明拉新能力强；老访客占比高，说明留存好。"},"1327":{"id":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement-21","page_id":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement#访问量的四种口径","content":"**Deduplicated Audience**：跨设备去重后的\"人数\"，1860 万。它是 Similarweb 用模型估算的，比独立访客更接近真实用户数。"},"1328":{"id":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement-22","page_id":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement#访问量的四种口径","content":"切换柱状图 / 折线图，以及按天（D）、周（W）、月（M）显示。"},"1329":{"id":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement-23","page_id":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement#访问量的四种口径","content":"Benchmark to a category：把所属行业的平均水平画成一条参考线，判断这个网站在行业里算快还是慢。"},"1330":{"id":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement-24","page_id":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement#访问量的四种口径","content":"取消勾选 Desktop 或 Mobile Web，可以只看某一端的数据。"},"1331":{"id":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement-25","page_id":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement#访问量的四种口径","content":"三种\"量\"怎么选："},"1332":{"id":"/similarweb/t