n**：每次访问平均停留多久。"},"1339":{"id":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement-33","page_id":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement#互动质量时长页数跳出率","content":"**Pages Per Visit**：每次访问平均浏览几个页面。"},"1340":{"id":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement-34","page_id":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement#互动质量时长页数跳出率","content":"**Bounce Rate**：只看了一个页面就离开的访问占比。"},"1341":{"id":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement-35","page_id":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement#互动质量时长页数跳出率","content":"**Page Views**：所选时间内的页面浏览总次数。"},"1342":{"id":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement-36","page_id":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement#互动质量时长页数跳出率","content":"拆开看会发现，移动端用户的单次访问反而更长。对工具站来说，这通常意味着手机上传、处理图片更慢，而不是手机用户更\"投入\"。"},"1343":{"id":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement-37","page_id":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement#互动质量时长页数跳出率","content":"勾选 Engaged visits only 后，Similarweb 会去掉低互动的访问。实测 remove.bg：跳出率变为 N/A，访问时长从 2:51 变成 4:15，每次访问页数从 2.87 变成 3.79。"},"1344":{"id":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement-38","page_id":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement#互动质量时长页数跳出率","content":"和竞品对比时，**访问量相近但访问时长、页数明显更高**的一方，通常产品体验或内容深度更好"},"1345":{"id":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement-39","page_id":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement#互动质量时长页数跳出率","content":"跳出率很高的站，要么是\"查一下就走\"的工具（正常），要么是靠低质量流量堆起来的（要警惕）"},"1346":{"id":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement-40","page_id":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement#互动质量时长页数跳出率","content":"用 Engaged visits only 过滤后再比较，可以排除刷量、误点带来的干扰"},"1347":{"id":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement-41","page_id":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/