 remove.bg 的 Traffic & engagement，把粒度从 M 切到 W，看看月内有没有明显的周期波动。"},"1354":{"id":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement-48","page_id":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement#本章小结","content":"打开 PoP 开关，比较 Jul–Sep 和上一个 3 个月。"},"1355":{"id":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement-49","page_id":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/traffic-engagement#本章小结","content":"在 Benchmark to a category 里选择它所属的行业，判断 remove.bg 的下滑是自身问题还是行业整体下滑。"},"1356":{"id":"/similarweb/website-content","page_id":"/similarweb/website-content","type":"page","content":"Similarweb 网站内容 Website content","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Similarweb 教程","网站分析 Website analysis"],"tags":[],"url":"/similarweb/website-content"},"1357":{"id":"/similarweb/website-content-0","page_id":"/similarweb/website-content","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/website-content","content":"看一个网站的流量落在哪些目录、页面和子域名上。对平台型网站尤其有用。"},"1358":{"id":"/similarweb/website-content-1","page_id":"/similarweb/website-content","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/similarweb/website-content#这个报告什么时候最有用","content":"这个报告什么时候最有用？"},"1359":{"id":"/similarweb/website-content-2","page_id":"/similarweb/website-content","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/website-content","content":"认识 Website content 的 4 个标签页：Folders、Business Lines、Popular Pages、Subdomains"},"1360":{"id":"/similarweb/website-content-3","page_id":"/similarweb/website-content","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/website-content","content":"用 Subdomains 判断一个网站的流量是否集中在主站"},"1361":{"id":"/similarweb/website-content-4","page_id":"/similarweb/website-content","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/website-content","content":"知道这个报告在什么情况下最有用，以及数据缺失时怎么办"},"1362":{"id":"/similarweb/website-content-5","page_id":"/similarweb/website-content","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/website-content","content":"打开方式：二级菜单 Overview → Website content。"},"1363":{"id":"/similarweb/website-content-6","page_id":"/similarweb/website-content","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/website-content","content":"Folders：按网址目录（如 `/blog/`、`/tools/`）统计流量。remove.bg 的目录很少，这里没有数据。"},"1364":{"id":"/similarweb/website-content-7","page_id":"/similarweb/website-content","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/website-content","content":"Business Lines（新功能）：把网站按业务拆开看，适合大型网站。"},"1365":{"id":"/similarweb/website-content-8","page_id":"/similarweb/website-content","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/website-content","content":"Popular Pages：流量最高的具体页面，可以筛选 New（新出现的页面）和 Trending（正在上涨的页面）。"},"1366":{"id":"/similarweb/website-content-9","page_id":"/similarweb/website-content","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/website-content","content":"Subdomains：每个子域名的流量占比。"},"1367":{"id":"/similarweb/website-content-10","page_id":"/similarweb/website-content","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/website-content","content":"子域名数据只统计桌面端，打开这个标签页时流量类型会自动变成 Desktop。"},"1368":{"id":"/similarweb/website-content-11","page_id":"/similarweb/website-content","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/website-content","content":"`api.`（接口）、`static.`（静态资源）、`es.`（西班牙语站）等子域名几乎没有直接访问。"},"1369":{"id":"/similarweb/website-content-12","page_id":"/similarweb/website-content","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/website-content#这个报告什么时候最有用","content":"remove.bg 是单一工具，流量几乎全在首页，所以 Website content 能看到的东西不多。它真正的用武之地是**平台型、内容型网站**："},"1370":{"id":"/similarweb/website-content-13","page_id":"/similarweb/website-content","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/website-content#这个报告什么时候最有用","content":"| 网站类型                             | 看哪个标签      | 能发现什么                   |\n| -------------------------------- | ---------- | ----------------------- |\n| 托管平台（如 `vercel.app`、`github.io`） | Subdomains | 平台上哪些用户网站流量最高、最近冒出了哪些新站 |","table":"table-0"},"1371":{"id":"/similarweb/website-content-14","page_id":"/similarweb/website-content","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/website-content#这个报告什么时候最有用","content":"| 网站类型   | 看哪个标签                 | 能发现什么           |\n| ------ | --------------------- | --------------- |\n| 内容站、博客 | Folders、Popular Pages | 哪个栏目、哪篇文章带来最多流量 |","table":"table-0"},"1372":{"id":"/similarweb/website-content-15","page_id":"/similarweb/website-content","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/website-content#这个报告什么时候最有用","content":"| 网站类型  | 看哪个标签                | 能发现什么                      |\n| ----- | -------------------- | -------------------------- |\n| 多语言网站 | Subdomains 或 Folders | 各语言版本的流量分布（`es.`、`/de/` 等） |","table":"table-0"},"1373":{"id":"/similarweb/website-content-16","page_id":"/similarweb/website-content","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/website-content#这个报告什么时候最有用","content":"| 网站类型    | 看哪个标签          | 能发现什么    |\n| ------- | -------------- | -------- |\n| 电商、SaaS | Business Lines | 不同产品线的流量 |","table":"table-0"},"1374":{"id":"/similarweb/website-content-17","page_id":"/similarweb/website-content","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/website-content#这个报告什么时候最有用","content":"在「实战：从 vercel.app 挖新词」一章，我们会用平台型网站演示如何从子域名和落地页里发现新出现的工具站。"},"1375":{"id":"/similarweb/website-content-18","page_id":"/similarweb/website-content","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/website-content#这个报告什么时候最有用","content":"大网站选 3 个月时，Popular Pages 偶尔会提示 \"Something went wrong. Please try again or choose a shorter date range.\"。按提示把时间范围改成 Last 1 Month 再打开即可，看完记得改回来。"},"1376":{"id":"/similarweb/website-content-19","page_id":"/similarweb/website-content","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/website-content#这个报告什么时候最有用","content":"打开 remove.bg 的 Website content，把时间改成 Last 1 Month，查看 Popular Pages 里流量最高的 10 个页面。"},"1377":{"id":"/similarweb/website-content-20","page_id":"/similarweb/website-content","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/website-content#这个报告什么时候最有用","content":"切到 New 筛选，看看最近有没有新上线的页面——新页面往往对应着新功能或新关键词。"},"1378":{"id":"/similarweb/website-keywords","page_id":"/similarweb/website-keywords","type":"page","content":"Similarweb 站点关键词 Website explorer › Keywords","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Similarweb 教程","SEO 关键词研究"],"tags":[],"url":"/similarweb/website-keywords"},"1379":{"id":"/similarweb/website-keywords-0","page_id":"/similarweb/website-keywords","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/website-keywords","content":"把竞品的关键词表完整扒下来：每个词带来多少点击、排名难度、搜索量、CPC、零点击率、落到哪个页面。"},"1380":{"id":"/similarweb/website-keywords-1","page_id":"/similarweb/website-keywords","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/similarweb/website-keywords#报告顶部","content":"报告顶部"},"1381":{"id":"/similarweb/website-keywords-2","page_id":"/similarweb/website-keywords","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/similarweb/website-keywords#关键词表点击变化难度","content":"关键词表：点击、变化、难度"},"1382":{"id":"/similarweb/website-keywords-3","page_id":"/similarweb/website-keywords","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/similarweb/website-keywords#关键词表搜索量cpc零点击","content":"关键词表：搜索量、CPC、零点击"},"1383":{"id":"/similarweb/website-keywords-4","page_id":"/similarweb/website-keywords","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/similarweb/website-keywords#怎么从词表里找机会","content":"怎么从词表里找机会"},"1384":{"id":"/similarweb/website-keywords-5","page_id":"/similarweb/website-keywords","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/website-keywords","content":"打开任意网站的关键词报告，看懂每一列"},"1385":{"id":"/similarweb/website-keywords-6","page_id":"/similarweb/website-keywords","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/website-keywords","content":"用机会卡片和筛选器快速找到值得做的词"},"1386":{"id":"/similarweb/website-keywords-7","page_id":"/similarweb/website-keywords","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/website-keywords","content":"从\"Top URL\"看出竞品是用哪个页面承接哪类词的"},"1387":{"id":"/similarweb/website-keywords-8","page_id":"/similarweb/website-keywords","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/website-keywords","content":"打开方式：Keyword research → Website explorer → Keywords，在弹出的搜索框里输入网站（可以是域名，也可以是具体 URL，例如 `remove.bg/es`）。"},"1388":{"id":"/similarweb/website-keywords-9","page_id":"/similarweb/website-keywords","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/website-keywords#报告顶部","content":"当前分析的网站。"},"1389":{"id":"/similarweb/website-keywords-10","page_id":"/similarweb/website-keywords","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/website-keywords#报告顶部","content":"Add Site for Keyword Gap：加入竞品后，可以看\"对方有、你没有\"的关键词。"},"1390":{"id":"/similarweb/website-keywords-11","page_id":"/similarweb/website-keywords","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/website-keywords#报告顶部","content":"最常用的组合：Branded/non-branded 选 Non-branded（去掉品牌词），Volume 设下限，Clicks change 选增长中的词。"},"1391":{"id":"/similarweb/website-keywords-12","page_id":"/similarweb/website-keywords","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/website-keywords#报告顶部","content":"机会卡片由 Similarweb 自动计算：Cannibalization（多个页面抢同一个词）、Long-tail opps.（长尾机会）、SERP features opps.（可以争取搜索结果特殊展示位的词）、High traffic opps.（高流量机会）、Low potential keywords（低潜力词）。点卡片就会把表格筛成对应的词。"},"1392":{"id":"/similarweb/website-keywords-13","page_id":"/similarweb/website-keywords","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/website-keywords#关键词表点击变化难度","content":"**Clicks 点击**：这个词给网站带来的搜索点击（不是搜索量）。remove bg 带来 2040 万次，占全部搜索点击的 22.51%。"},"1393":{"id":"/similarweb/website-keywords-14","page_id":"/similarweb/website-keywords","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/website-keywords#关键词表点击变化难度","content":"Change：点击量的变化。"},"1394":{"id":"/similarweb/website-keywords-15","page_id":"/similarweb/website-keywords","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/website-keywords#关键词表点击变化难度","content":"background remove 的点击增长了 357%，结合下一节的搜索量就能看出它是一个正在快速变热的说法。"},"1395":{"id":"/similarweb/website-keywords-16","page_id":"/similarweb/website-keywords","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/website-keywords#关键词表点击变化难度","content":"**排名难度 KD**（Keyword Difficulty）0–100，红点表示很难（80 以上），浅色表示中等。核心大词基本都在 84–92。"},"1396":{"id":"/similarweb/website-keywords-17","page_id":"/similarweb/website-keywords","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/website-keywords#关键词表点击变化难度","content":"**搜索意图 Intent**：NAV = 导航型（想找某个网站），另外还有 INFO（了解信息）、COM（商业调研）、TRANS（交易）。"},"1397":{"id":"/similarweb/website-keywords-18","page_id":"/similarweb/website-keywords","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/website-keywords#关键词表点击变化难度","content":"quitar fondo（西班牙语\"去除背景\"）带来 280 万次点击，KD 只有 63——比英文核心词容易得多。"},"1398":{"id":"/similarweb/website-keywords-19","page_id":"/similarweb/website-keywords","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/website-keywords#关键词表点击变化难度","content":"勾选左侧的词后点 Clicks over time，可以看这些词的点击走势。"},"1399":{"id":"/similarweb/website-keywords-20","page_id":"/similarweb/website-keywords","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/website-keywords#关键词表搜索量cpc零点击","content":"表格可以左右滚动，往右是另一组重要指标："},"1400":{"id":"/similarweb/website-keywords-21","page_id":"/similarweb/website-keywords","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/website-keywords#关键词表搜索量cpc零点击","content":"**Volume 当前搜索量**：所选时间段里这个词的月搜索量。"},"1401":{"id":"/similarweb/website-keywords-22","page_id":"/similarweb/website-keywords","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/website-keywords#关键词表搜索量cpc零点击","content":"**Avg. volume 平均搜索量**：更长周期的平均月搜索量。和 Volume 差距大，说明这个词有季节性或趋势变化。"},"1402":{"id":"/similarweb/website-keywords-23","page_id":"/similarweb/website-keywords","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/website-keywords#关键词表搜索量cpc零点击","content":"background remove 当前搜索量是平均水平的 4 倍多，和上一张图 +357% 的点击增长对得上。"},"1403":{"id":"/similarweb/website-keywords-24","page_id":"/similarweb/website-keywords","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/website-keywords#关键词表搜索量cpc零点击","content":"Desktop vs. mobile：搜索来自桌面端和移动端的比例。"},"1404":{"id":"/similarweb/website-keywords-25","page_id":"/similarweb/website-keywords","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/website-keywords#关键词表搜索量cpc零点击","content":"**CPC 广告单价**：越高，说明广告主越愿意为这个词花钱、商业价值越高。bg remover 的 $0.67 是这组里最高的。"},"1405":{"id":"/similarweb/website-keywords-26","page_id":"/similarweb/website-keywords","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/website-keywords#关键词表搜索量cpc零点击","content":"**Zero-click 零点击率**：搜索后没有点击任何结果的比例。越高，说明搜索结果页本身已经回答了问题，能抢到的点击越少。"},"1406":{"id":"/similarweb/website-keywords-27","page_id":"/similarweb/website-keywords","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/website-keywords#关键词表搜索量cpc零点击","content":"再往右还有 **Top URL**（这个词主要落到网站的哪个页面）和 **SERP features**（搜索结果里出现了哪些特殊展示位）。例如 quitar fondo 的 Top URL 是 `remove.bg/es`，remover fundo 是 `remove.bg/pt-br`——竞品用**独立的语言页面**承接各国的本地词。"},"1407":{"id":"/similarweb/website-keywords-28","page_id":"/similarweb/website-keywords","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/website-keywords#怎么从词表里找机会","content":"**去掉品牌词**：Branded/non-branded 选 Non-branded，排除 \"remove bg\" 这类带品牌名的词。"},"1408":{"id":"/similarweb/website-keywords-29","page_id":"/similarweb/website-keywords","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/website-keywords#怎么从词表里找机会","content":"**按难度排序**：点 KD 列表头，从低到高看，找 KD 低于 60、点击量还不错的词。"},"1409":{"id":"/similarweb/website-keywords-30","page_id":"/similarweb/website-keywords","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/website-keywords#怎么从词表里找机会","content":"**看 Volume 和 Avg. volume 的差距**：当前量远高于平均量的，是正在变热的词，越早做越有利。"},"1410":{"id":"/similarweb/website-keywords-31","page_id":"/similarweb/website-keywords","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/website-keywords#怎么从词表里找机会","content":"**看 Top URL**：竞品用什么页面承接这个词？如果只是首页顺带排上去的，你做一个专门的页面就很有机会。"},"1411":{"id":"/similarweb/website-keywords-32","page_id":"/similarweb/website-keywords","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/website-keywords#怎么从词表里找机会","content":"打开 remove.bg 的 Keywords 报告，筛选 Non-branded，按 KD 升序，找出 5 个 KD 低于 60 的词。"},"1412":{"id":"/similarweb/website-keywords-33","page_id":"/similarweb/website-keywords","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/website-keywords#怎么从词表里找机会","content":"在 Include/Exclude URLs 里只看 `remove.bg/es`，看看西语页面一共排了多少个词。"},"1413":{"id":"/similarweb/website-keywords-34","page_id":"/similarweb/website-keywords","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/website-keywords#怎么从词表里找机会","content":"点 Add Site for Keyword Gap 加入 photoroom.com，找出 photoroom 有排名、remove.bg 没有的词。"},"1414":{"id":"/similarweb/website-performance","page_id":"/similarweb/website-performance","type":"page","content":"Similarweb 网站概览 Website performance","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Similarweb 教程","网站分析 Website analysis"],"tags":[],"url":"/similarweb/website-performance"},"1415":{"id":"/similarweb/website-performance-0","page_id":"/similarweb/website-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/website-performance","content":"输入一个域名后看到的第一个报告：流量规模、互动质量、国家、渠道、搜索词一屏总览。"},"1416":{"id":"/similarweb/website-performance-1","page_id":"/similarweb/website-performance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/similarweb/website-performance#打开报告","content":"打开报告"},"1417":{"id":"/similarweb/website-performance-2","page_id":"/similarweb/website-performance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/similarweb/website-performance#流量规模traffic--engagement","content":"流量规模：Traffic & engagement"},"1418":{"id":"/similarweb/website-performance-3","page_id":"/similarweb/website-performance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/similarweb/website-performance#互动质量engagement-overview","content":"互动质量：Engagement overview"},"1419":{"id":"/similarweb/website-performance-4","page_id":"/similarweb/website-performance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/similarweb/website-performance#访问趋势visits-over-time","content":"访问趋势：Visits over time"},"1420":{"id":"/similarweb/website-performance-5","page_id":"/similarweb/website-performance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/similarweb/website-performance#国家分布top-countries","content":"国家分布：Top countries"},"1421":{"id":"/similarweb/website-performance-6","page_id":"/similarweb/website-performance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/similarweb/website-performance#渠道结构marketing-channels","content":"渠道结构：Marketing channels"},"1422":{"id":"/similarweb/website-performance-7","page_id":"/similarweb/website-performance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/similarweb/website-performance#搜索词organic-search","content":"搜索词：Organic search"},"1423":{"id":"/similarweb/website-performance-8","page_id":"/similarweb/website-performance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/similarweb/website-performance#报告剩下的部分","content":"报告剩下的部分"},"1424":{"id":"/similarweb/website-performance-9","page_id":"/similarweb/website-performance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/similarweb/website-performance#5-分钟判断清单","content":"5 分钟判断清单"},"1425":{"id":"/similarweb/website-performance-10","page_id":"/similarweb/website-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/website-performance","content":"打开任意网站的 Website performance 报告，并把时间切换到按月统计"},"1426":{"id":"/similarweb/website-performance-11","page_id":"/similarweb/website-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/website-performance","content":"看懂流量规模、排名、设备、互动指标这几组核心数字"},"1427":{"id":"/similarweb/website-performance-12","page_id":"/similarweb/website-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/website-performance","content":"从国家、渠道、搜索词三个角度，5 分钟内给一个网站下初步结论"},"1428":{"id":"/similarweb/website-performance-13","page_id":"/similarweb/website-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/website-performance","content":"Website performance（网站概览）是 Website analysis 模块的第一个报告，也是你搜索一个域名后默认打开的页面。它把后面各章的内容各抽取了一小块放在一起，适合**快速判断一个网站值不值得深入研究**。"},"1429":{"id":"/similarweb/website-performance-14","page_id":"/similarweb/website-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/website-performance","content":"本章以 remove.bg 为例，时间范围选 **Jul 2026 – Sep 2026（Last 3 Months）**，地区为 Worldwide。"},"1430":{"id":"/similarweb/website-performance-15","page_id":"/similarweb/website-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/website-performance#打开报告","content":"左侧主导航点 Website analysis，在搜索框输入 `remove.bg`，从下拉建议里选中它（参考上一章界面导览）。"},"1431":{"id":"/similarweb/website-performance-16","page_id":"/similarweb/website-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/website-performance#打开报告","content":"默认进入二级菜单 Overview 下的 Website performance。"},"1432":{"id":"/similarweb/website-performance-17","page_id":"/similarweb/website-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/website-performance#打开报告","content":"把顶部时间范围从 Last 28 days 改成 **Last 3 Months**。按天滚动的 28 天视图不显示环比，也看不到 Notable changes。"},"1433":{"id":"/similarweb/website-performance-18","page_id":"/similarweb/website-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/website-performance#流量规模traffic--engagement","content":"页面第一块是流量和排名的总览："},"1434":{"id":"/similarweb/website-performance-19","page_id":"/similarweb/website-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/website-performance#流量规模traffic--engagement","content":"Total visits 是所选时间范围内的**访问次数总和**（不是人数）。选了 3 个月，就是 3 个月加起来。"},"1435":{"id":"/similarweb/website-performance-20","page_id":"/similarweb/website-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/website-performance#流量规模traffic--engagement","content":"Notable changes 会自动挑出变化最大的维度：这里是 Direct（直接访问）环比下降 10%、印度流量环比下降 12%，点后面的链接可以直接跳到对应报告。"},"1436":{"id":"/similarweb/website-performance-21","page_id":"/similarweb/website-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/website-performance#流量规模traffic--engagement","content":"AI insights 是新功能，这里提示 AI 搜索带来的流量主要来自 Gemini。"},"1437":{"id":"/similarweb/website-performance-22","page_id":"/similarweb/website-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/website-performance#流量规模traffic--engagement","content":"Device distribution：桌面端和移动网页端的访问占比。注意它**不包含 App 内的访问**。"},"1438":{"id":"/similarweb/website-performance-23","page_id":"/similarweb/website-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/website-performance#流量规模traffic--engagement","content":"Global rank 全球排名 #960；Country rank 在主要国家（印度）的排名 #565；Industry rank 在所属行业（图形多媒体与网页设计）里排第 5。排名越小越好。"},"1439":{"id":"/similarweb/website-performance-24","page_id":"/similarweb/website-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/website-performance#流量规模traffic--engagement","content":"几个容易误解的地方："},"1