站主要靠 SEO 获客。"},"1462":{"id":"/similarweb/website-performance-47","page_id":"/similarweb/website-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/website-performance#渠道结构marketing-channels","content":"Direct：直接输入网址、书签、App 内跳转等。占比高说明品牌认知度高、回访用户多。"},"1463":{"id":"/similarweb/website-performance-48","page_id":"/similarweb/website-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/website-performance#渠道结构marketing-channels","content":"Gen AI 是新增渠道：从 ChatGPT、Gemini、Perplexity 等 AI 产品点进来的访问。"},"1464":{"id":"/similarweb/website-performance-49","page_id":"/similarweb/website-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/website-performance#渠道结构marketing-channels","content":"这里一共 10 个渠道，含义见下表（「营销渠道」一章会详细展开）："},"1465":{"id":"/similarweb/website-performance-50","page_id":"/similarweb/website-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/website-performance#渠道结构marketing-channels","content":"| 渠道     | 中文   | 典型来源              |\n| ------ | ---- | ----------------- |\n| Direct | 直接访问 | 输入网址、书签、无法识别来源的访问 |","table":"table-1"},"1466":{"id":"/similarweb/website-performance-51","page_id":"/similarweb/website-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/website-performance#渠道结构marketing-channels","content":"| 渠道          | 中文   | 典型来源                   |\n| ----------- | ---- | ---------------------- |\n| Org. Search | 自然搜索 | Google、Bing 等搜索结果的自然排名 |","table":"table-1"},"1467":{"id":"/similarweb/website-performance-52","page_id":"/similarweb/website-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/website-performance#渠道结构marketing-channels","content":"| 渠道          | 中文   | 典型来源 |\n| ----------- | ---- | ---- |\n| Paid Search | 付费搜索 | 搜索广告 |","table":"table-1"},"1468":{"id":"/similarweb/website-performance-53","page_id":"/similarweb/website-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/website-performance#渠道结构marketing-channels","content":"| 渠道        | 中文  | 典型来源     |\n| --------- | --- | -------- |\n| Referrals | 引荐  | 其他网站上的链接 |","table":"table-1"},"1469":{"id":"/similarweb/website-performance-54","page_id":"/similarweb/website-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/website-performance#渠道结构marketing-channels","content":"| 渠道      | 中文   | 典型来源    |\n| ------- | ---- | ------- |\n| Display | 展示广告 | 横幅、图片广告 |","table":"table-1"},"1470":{"id":"/similarweb/website-performance-55","page_id":"/similarweb/website-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/website-performance#渠道结构marketing-channels","content":"| 渠道          | 中文   | 典型来源                           |\n| ----------- | ---- | ------------------------------ |\n| Org. Social | 自然社交 | Facebook、YouTube、Reddit 等的普通帖子 |","table":"table-1"},"1471":{"id":"/similarweb/website-performance-56","page_id":"/similarweb/website-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/website-performance#渠道结构marketing-channels","content":"| 渠道          | 中文   | 典型来源   |\n| ----------- | ---- | ------ |\n| Paid Social | 付费社交 | 社交媒体广告 |","table":"table-1"},"1472":{"id":"/similarweb/website-performance-57","page_id":"/similarweb/website-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/website-performance#渠道结构marketing-channels","content":"| 渠道     | 中文    | 典型来源                        |\n| ------ | ----- | --------------------------- |\n| Gen AI | AI 引荐 | ChatGPT、Gemini、Perplexity 等 |","table":"table-1"},"1473":{"id":"/similarweb/website-performance-58","page_id":"/similarweb/website-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/website-performance#渠道结构marketing-channels","content":"| 渠道    | 中文  | 典型来源      |\n| ----- | --- | --------- |\n| Email | 邮件  | 邮件营销、通知邮件 |","table":"table-1"},"1474":{"id":"/similarweb/website-performance-59","page_id":"/similarweb/website-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/similarweb/website-performance#渠道结构marketing-channels","content":"| 渠道         | 中文  | 典型来源   |\n| ---------- | --- | ------ |\n| Affiliates | 联盟  | 联盟营销链接 |","table":"table-1"},"1475":{"id":"/